    "直接进入功能，不执行自动删除" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Open a feature directly; nothing is deleted automatically" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "直接進入功能，不執行自動刪除" } } } },
    "记录统计；移到废纸篓不等于磁盘已释放。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Based on activity records; moving items to Trash does not mean disk space has been released." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "記錄統計；移到廢紙簍不等於磁碟已釋放。" } } } },
    "磁盘余量和内存压力正常，本轮清理扫描也没有发现候选项。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Disk headroom and memory pressure are normal, and this cleanup scan found no candidates." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "磁碟餘量和記憶體壓力正常，本輪清理掃描也沒有發現候選項。" } } } },
