    "健康检查" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Health Check" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "健康檢查" } } } },
    "首字延迟" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "First Output" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "首字延遲" } } } },
    "完整响应" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Full Response" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "完整回應" } } } },
    "没有内置电池" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "No Internal Battery" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "沒有內置電池" } } } },
    "读取失败" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Read Failed" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "讀取失敗" } } } },
    "导出" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Export" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "匯出" } } } },
    "清空…" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Clear…" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "清除…" } } } },
    "恢复安全默认设置" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Restore Safe Defaults" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "恢復安全預設值" } } } },
    "累计成果" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Cumulative Results" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "累計成果" } } } },
    "累计处理空间" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Space Processed" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "累計處理空間" } } } },
    "来自清理与卸载记录" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "From cleanup and uninstall records" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "來自清理與解除安裝記錄" } } } },
    "清理项目" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Items Cleaned" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "清理項目" } } } },
    "已成功移入废纸篓" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Successfully moved to Trash" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "已成功移入垃圾桶" } } } },
    "卸载 App" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Apps Uninstalled" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "解除安裝 App" } } } },
    "App 本体已移入废纸篓" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "App bundles moved to Trash" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "App 本體已移入垃圾桶" } } } },
    "有成果操作" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Productive Actions" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "有成果操作" } } } },
    "完成或部分完成" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Completed or partially completed" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "完成或部分完成" } } } },
    "根据仍保留的 %d 条活动记录统计；移入废纸篓不等于已释放 APFS 空间，清空记录后统计归零。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Calculated from the %d activity records still retained. Moving items to Trash does not equal freed APFS space, and clearing records resets these totals." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "根據仍保留的 %d 筆活動記錄統計；移入垃圾桶不等於已釋放 APFS 空間，清除記錄後統計歸零。" } } } },
    "%@：%@。%@" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%@: %@. %@" } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%@：%@。%@" } } } },
    "这项操作不能从 CleanNest 内撤销，累计成果统计也会归零；但不会删除文件或清空废纸篓。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "This cannot be undone in CleanNest and will reset cumulative results, but it will not delete files or empty Trash." } }, "zh-Hant" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "這項操作無法從 CleanNest 內復原，累計成果統計也會歸零；但不會刪除檔案或清空垃圾桶。" } } } },
    "打开废纸篓" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Open Trash"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"打開垃圾桶"}}}},
    "打开这条记录的完整详情" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Open full details for this record"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"開啟這筆記錄的完整詳情"}}}},
    "清空记录" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clear Records"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"清除記錄"}}}},
    "这项操作不能从 CleanNest 内撤销，但累计成果不会归零；也不会删除文件或清空废纸篓。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This cannot be undone in CleanNest, but cumulative results will not be reset. It will not delete files or empty Trash."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這項操作無法從 CleanNest 內復原，但累計成果不會歸零；也不會刪除檔案或清空垃圾桶。"}}}},
    "累计成果归零" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reset Cumulative Results"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"累計成果歸零"}}}},
    "只会重置累计空间、清理项目、卸载 App 和有成果操作计数；活动明细、文件与废纸篓保持不变。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This only resets cumulative space, cleaned items, uninstalled apps, and productive-action counts. Activity details, files, and Trash remain unchanged."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只會重置累計空間、清理項目、解除安裝 App 和有成果操作計數；活動明細、檔案與垃圾桶保持不變。"}}}},
    "搜索只改变当前显示，不会删除或修改记录" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Search only changes what is shown; it does not delete or modify records"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"搜尋只會改變目前顯示，不會刪除或修改記錄"}}}},
    "显示 %d / %d 条；筛选只改变当前显示。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Showing %d of %d records; filters only change the current view."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"顯示 %d / %d 筆；篩選只會改變目前顯示。"}}}},
    "类型" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Type"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"類型"}}}},
    "结果" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Result"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"結果"}}}},
    "全部时间" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"All Time"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"全部時間"}}}},
    "最近 24 小时" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Last 24 Hours"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"最近 24 小時"}}}},
    "最近 7 天" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Last 7 Days"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"最近 7 天"}}}},
    "最近 30 天" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Last 30 Days"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"最近 30 天"}}}},
    "累计归零…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reset Totals…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"累計歸零…"}}}},
    "候选 %@ · 移入废纸篓 %@ · APFS %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Candidates %@ · Moved to Trash %@ · APFS %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"候選 %@ · 移入垃圾桶 %@ · APFS %@"}}}},
    "返回概览" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Back to Overview"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"返回概覽"}}}},
    "工具账本" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tool Ledger"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"工具帳本"}}}},
    "重新读取 Agent 文件元数据；刷新本身不会修改文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reread Agent file metadata; refreshing does not modify files"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重新讀取 Agent 檔案後設資料；重新整理本身不會修改檔案"}}}},
    "正在统计占用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Calculating Storage"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在統計佔用"}}}},
    "上次完成的 Agent 聚合结果" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Last completed Agent aggregate results"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"上次完成的 Agent 彙總結果"}}}},
    "目录分配块占用，不等于最终 APFS 可释放量" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Allocated directory blocks; not the final reclaimable APFS space"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目錄分配區塊佔用，不等於最終 APFS 可釋放空間"}}}},
    "导入签名规则…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Import Signed Rules…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"匯入已簽章規則…"}}}},
    "恢复内置" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Restore Built-in Rules"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"恢復內建規則"}}}},
    "复核关系" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Review Relationships"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"複核關係"}}}},
    "查看清理计划…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Review Cleanup Plan…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"查看清理計畫…"}}}},
    "本机恢复记录" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Recovery History on This Mac"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本機復原記錄"}}}},
    "恢复会先检查原位置，绝不覆盖 Agent 后来新建的同名文件。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Recovery checks the original location first and never overwrites same-named files later created by an Agent."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"復原會先檢查原位置，絕不覆寫 Agent 後來新增的同名檔案。"}}}},
    "打开恢复区" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Open Recovery Area"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"開啟復原區"}}}},
    "让工具自己解释可回收对象" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Let Each Tool Explain What Can Be Reclaimed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"讓工具自行說明可回收物件"}}}},
    "优先使用官方 dry-run/账本；没有预演能力的广域删除保持禁用。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prefer official dry runs and ledgers. Broad deletion without a preview remains disabled."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"優先使用官方 dry-run／帳本；沒有預演能力的廣域刪除保持停用。"}}}},
    "选择 Git 仓库" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose Git Repository"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選擇 Git 儲存庫"}}}},
    "正在读取 Git、Docker、Hugging Face、npm 与 pip 的原生账本…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reading native ledgers from Git, Docker, Hugging Face, npm, and pip…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在讀取 Git、Docker、Hugging Face、npm 與 pip 的原生帳本…"}}}},
    "打开只读明细，不会移动或删除文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Open read-only details; no files will be moved or deleted"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"開啟唯讀明細，不會移動或刪除檔案"}}}},
    "旧内容建议" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Old Content Suggestions"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"舊內容建議"}}}},
    "0.8.0 起，这些建议如何变成动作？" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"How do these suggestions become actions in 0.8.0 and later?"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"從 0.8.0 起，這些建議如何變成動作？"}}}},
    "超过 30 天的备份、已归档会话和超时未用的虚拟机，以及超过 60 天的会话文件，可以在详情页进入备份优先的安全处置，随时从恢复区还原。生成图片、记忆、索引、凭据和运行时继续保持只读。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Backups, archived sessions, and expired unused virtual machines older than 30 days, plus session files older than 60 days, can enter backup-first safe handling from Details and be restored from Recovery at any time. Generated images, memory, indexes, credentials, and runtimes remain read-only."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"超過 30 天的備份、已封存會話和逾時未用的虛擬機，以及超過 60 天的會話檔案，可在詳情頁進入備份優先的安全處置，隨時從復原區還原。生成圖片、記憶、索引、憑證和執行時繼續保持唯讀。"}}}},
    "注意：移除会话文件后，Agent 自己的会话列表可能短暂保留失效条目；这是已知现象，恢复备份即可还原。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Note: after session files are removed, the Agent’s own session list may temporarily retain stale entries. This is known behavior; restoring the backup restores them."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"注意：移除會話檔案後，Agent 自己的會話清單可能短暫保留失效項目；這是已知現象，復原備份即可還原。"}}}},
    "“显示位置”只会打开 Finder，不会改动文件。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"“Show in Finder” only opens Finder; it does not change files."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"「顯示位置」只會開啟 Finder，不會改動檔案。"}}}},
    "显示位置" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Show in Finder"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"顯示位置"}}}},
    "在 Finder 中显示该分组的第一个已验证位置" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Show the group’s first verified location in Finder"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在 Finder 中顯示該分組的第一個已驗證位置"}}}},
    "移除会话文件后，Agent 自己的会话列表可能短暂保留失效条目；备份保留在恢复区，可随时还原。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"After session files are removed, the Agent’s own session list may temporarily retain stale entries. Backups remain in Recovery and can be restored at any time."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"移除會話檔案後，Agent 自己的會話清單可能短暫保留失效項目；備份保留在復原區，可隨時還原。"}}}},
    "确认 Agent 安全处置" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Confirm Safe Agent Handling"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"確認 Agent 安全處置"}}}},
    "查看技术保护步骤" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Review Technical Safeguards"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"查看技術保護步驟"}}}},
    "我知道这不会让模型变快，并确认范围和恢复方式" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"I understand this will not make the model faster, and I confirm the scope and recovery method"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"我知道這不會讓模型變快，並確認範圍和復原方式"}}}},
    "这次只是把所选旧文件移出原位置。它不会降低当前进程内存、减少 Token，或改善模型能力；下次用到相关缓存时可能会重新生成，第一次打开反而可能稍慢。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This only moves selected old files out of their original locations. It will not reduce current process memory, reduce tokens, or improve model capability. Related caches may be regenerated when next needed, so the first opening may be slightly slower."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這次只是把所選舊檔案移出原位置。它不會降低目前程序記憶體、減少 Token，或改善模型能力；下次用到相關快取時可能會重新生成，第一次開啟反而可能稍慢。"}}}},
    "会话历史、登录状态、记忆、配置和生成媒体不会被处理。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Session history, sign-in state, memory, configuration, and generated media will not be handled."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"會話歷史、登入狀態、記憶、設定和生成媒體不會被處理。"}}}},
    "检查并执行…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Review and Run…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"檢查並執行…"}}}},
    "风险与恢复边界" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Risks and Recovery Boundaries"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"風險與復原邊界"}}}},
    "Hugging Face 未引用修订不会进入 CleanNest 压缩恢复区；需要时由 hf 重新下载。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Unreferenced Hugging Face revisions do not enter CleanNest’s compressed recovery area; hf can download them again when needed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hugging Face 未引用修訂不會進入 CleanNest 壓縮復原區；需要時由 hf 重新下載。"}}}},
    "我已确认原生工具的处理范围" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"I have confirmed the native tool’s handling scope"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"我已確認原生工具的處理範圍"}}}},
    "重新预演并执行" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Preview Again and Run"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重新預演並執行"}}}},
    "打开该 Agent 的类别、文件、运行关系和恢复记录" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Open this Agent’s categories, files, runtime relationships, and recovery records"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"開啟該 Agent 的類別、檔案、執行關係和復原記錄"}}}},
    "恢复" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Restore"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"復原"}}}},
    "%d 类 · %@ 个文件 · %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d categories · %@ files · %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d 類 · %@ 個檔案 · %@"}}}},
    "· %@ 个文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"· %@ files"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"· %@ 個檔案"}}}},
    "%d 个活跃文件已保护" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d active files protected"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d 個活躍檔案已保護"}}}},
    "另有 %d 条较低优先级线索，可在各 Agent 分组中查看。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d more lower-priority findings are available in each Agent group."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"另有 %d 條較低優先級線索，可在各 Agent 分組中查看。"}}}},
    "规则 %@ · %@。%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Rules %@ · %@. %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"規則 %@ · %@。%@"}}}},
    "可处理 %@ 项 · %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ actionable items · %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"可處理 %@ 項 · %@"}}}},
    "已选 %@ 项 · %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ selected · %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已選 %@ 項 · %@"}}}},
    "%@ 类数据 · %@ 个旧文件 · %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ data categories · %@ old files · %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 類資料 · %@ 個舊檔案 · %@"}}}},
    "%@ · %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · %@"}}}},
    "%@ 个旧文件只进入建议；该分组共 %@ 个文件。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ old files are suggestions only; this group contains %@ files in total."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 個舊檔案只進入建議；該分組共 %@ 個檔案。"}}}},
    "%@ 项 · %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ items · %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 項 · %@"}}}},
    "已选 %d" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d selected"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已選 %d"}}}},
    "另有 %d 个较小文件；按分类选择会包含它们，仍会在执行前逐一复核身份。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d additional smaller files; selecting by category includes them, and each identity is still rechecked before execution."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"另有 %d 個較小檔案；按分類選取會包含它們，仍會在執行前逐一複核身分。"}}}},
    "%d 个 Agent 文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d Agent files"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d 個 Agent 檔案"}}}},
    "原目录 %@ · 备份 %@ · %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Original %@ · Backup %@ · %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"原目錄 %@ · 備份 %@ · %@"}}}},
    "%@ 个文件 · 分配块 %@ · 逻辑体积 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ files · Allocated %@ · Logical size %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 個檔案 · 分配區塊 %@ · 邏輯體積 %@"}}}},
    "不会让 %@ 的模型回复更快" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This will not make %@ model responses faster"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"不會讓 %@ 的模型回應更快"}}}},
    "执行 %@ 原生清理" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Run %@ native cleanup"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行 %@ 原生清理"}}}},
    "%@ 个文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ files"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 個檔案"}}}},
    "%@，占用 %@，%@，%d 个活跃文件，%d 条异常线索" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@, using %@, %@, %d active files, %d abnormal findings"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@，佔用 %@，%@，%d 個活躍檔案，%d 條異常線索"}}}},
    "%d 类内容 · %@ 个文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d content categories · %@ files"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d 類內容 · %@ 個檔案"}}}},
    "%@ 占用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ storage"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 佔用"}}}},
    "最大单文件 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Largest file %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"最大單一檔案 %@"}}}},
    "%@ 文件 · %@写入" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ files · Written %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 檔案 · %@寫入"}}}},
    "其中 %@ 可安全清理" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ can be cleaned safely"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"其中 %@ 可安全清理"}}}},
    "其中 %@ 需要先过目" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ requires review first"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"其中 %@ 需先查看"}}}},
    "返回检查" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Back to Review"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"返回檢查"}}}},
    "打开 %@ 的卸载详情" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Open uninstall details for %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"開啟 %@ 的解除安裝詳情"}}}},
    "版本 %@ · %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Version %@ · %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"版本 %@ · %@"}}}},
    "正在核对代码签名、Launch Services、相关目录与 launchd 配置；不会改动文件。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Checking code signatures, Launch Services, related directories, and launchd configuration; no files will be changed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在核對程式碼簽章、Launch Services、相關目錄與 launchd 設定；不會改動檔案。"}}}},
    "当前版本不执行永久删除。完成后会显示 App 与相关文件各自的恢复位置。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This version never permanently deletes items. When finished, it shows separate recovery locations for the app and related files."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目前版本不會執行永久刪除。完成後會顯示 App 與相關檔案各自的復原位置。"}}}},
    "预计处理 %d 项" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d items to process"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"預計處理 %d 項"}}}},
    "卸载步骤" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Uninstall Steps"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"解除安裝步驟"}}}},
    "一并处理已确认归属的私有文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Also handle private files with confirmed ownership"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"一併處理已確認歸屬的私有檔案"}}}},
    "没有找到可安全一并处理的私有文件；卸载只会处理 App 本体。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No private files were found that can be handled safely together; uninstalling will only process the app itself."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"找不到可安全一併處理的私有檔案；解除安裝只會處理 App 本體。"}}}},
    "在 Finder 中查看 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"View %@ in Finder"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在 Finder 中查看 %@"}}}},
    "App 恢复位置：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"App recovery location: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"App 復原位置：%@"}}}},
    "保持原位：%@%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Left in place: %@%@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"保持原位：%@%@"}}}},
    " 等 %d 项" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" and %d items"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" 等 %d 項"}}}},
    "在 Finder 中查看" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"View in Finder"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在 Finder 中查看"}}}},
    "重试未完成项" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Retry Incomplete Items"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重試未完成項目"}}}},
    "本次只移入废纸篓；清空废纸篓后空间才会真正释放。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Items are only moved to Trash this time; space is actually reclaimed after Trash is emptied."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本次只移入垃圾桶；清空垃圾桶後空間才會真正釋放。"}}}},
    "已选 %d 项" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d selected"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已選 %d 項"}}}},
    "清空选择" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clear Selection"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"清空選取"}}}},
    "本次扫描会话" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This Scan Session"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本次掃描會話"}}}},
    "记下扫了哪里、看了多少文件、跳过了什么；结果本身不会删除文件。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Records where it scanned, how many files it examined, and what it skipped; the results themselves do not delete files."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"記下掃描位置、檢視檔案數量和略過項目；結果本身不會刪除檔案。"}}}},
    "反选截图" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Invert Screenshot Selection"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"反選截圖"}}}},
    "媒体时间与体积分组：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Media time and size groups: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"媒體時間與體積分組：%@"}}}},
    "选择 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Select %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選取 %@"}}}},
    "未找到可验证的保留副本；本项不会通过执行前重验" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No verifiable retained copy was found; this item will not pass pre-execution revalidation"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"找不到可驗證的保留副本；本項不會通過執行前重驗"}}}},
    "不会自动改变排序；到“清理习惯”页启用后才生效" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sorting does not change automatically; it takes effect only after you enable it on the Cleanup Habits page"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"不會自動改變排序；到「清理習慣」頁啟用後才會生效"}}}},
    "提议：以后优先清理" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Suggest: Prioritize Cleanup"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"建議：以後優先清理"}}}},
    "提议：以后优先保留" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Suggest: Prioritize Keeping"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"建議：以後優先保留"}}}},
    "打开规则审核" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Open Rule Review"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"開啟規則審核"}}}},
    "撤销这条提案/规则" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Withdraw This Suggestion/Rule"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"撤銷這條提案／規則"}}}},
    "只读分析，不会改动你的选择" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Read-only analysis; your selections will not be changed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"唯讀分析，不會改動你的選取"}}}},
    "%@ 正在判断体积最大的 %d 项…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ is evaluating the %d largest items…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 正在判斷體積最大的 %d 項…"}}}},
    "优先覆盖体积最大的项目" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prioritizes the largest items"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"優先涵蓋體積最大的項目"}}}},
    "详情" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Details"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"詳情"}}}},
    "预计可释放 %@ · 移到废纸篓" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Estimated reclaimable %@ · Move to Trash"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"預計可釋放 %@ · 移到垃圾桶"}}}},
    "深度刷新（忽略缓存与条目上限）" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Deep Refresh (Ignore Cache and Item Limits)"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"深度重新整理（忽略快取與項目上限）"}}}},
    "普通扫描每个顶层项目最多遍历 50 万项，并会明确标出触顶目录；15 分钟内只复用签名未变化且完整度已知的项目。深度刷新会忽略缓存和条目上限，可随时取消。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A standard scan traverses up to 500,000 entries per top-level item and explicitly flags directories that reach the limit. For 15 minutes, it only reuses items with unchanged signatures and known completeness. Deep Refresh ignores caches and item limits and can be cancelled at any time."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"一般掃描每個頂層項目最多遍歷 50 萬項，並會明確標出達到上限的目錄；15 分鐘內只重用簽名未變化且完整度已知的項目。深度重新整理會忽略快取和項目上限，可隨時取消。"}}}},
    "当前任务" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Current Task"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目前任務"}}}},
    "切换不会重新扫描或处理任何文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Switching views does not rescan or process any files"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"切換不會重新掃描或處理任何檔案"}}}},
    "按用途解释系统数据位置与处理影响" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Explains system-data locations by purpose and handling impact"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"按用途解釋系統資料位置與處理影響"}}}},
    "正在计算当前层级 · 已出现的结果可先查看" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Calculating the current level · Available results can be reviewed now"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在計算目前層級 · 已出現的結果可先查看"}}}},
    "深度重扫，不设条目上限" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Deep Rescan, No Item Limit"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"深度重新掃描，不設項目上限"}}}},
    "检查文件访问" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Check File Access"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"檢查檔案存取"}}}},
    "仍保持只读，不会把差额当成垃圾" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Still read-only; differences are not treated as junk"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仍保持唯讀，不會把差額當成垃圾"}}}},
    "磁盘总账与文件归类。%@。%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Disk accounting and file classification. %@. %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"磁碟總帳與檔案歸類。%@。%@"}}}},
    "APFS 已用空间中，文件遍历已归类约 %d 百分比" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"File traversal classified approximately %d percent of used APFS space"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"APFS 已用空間中，檔案遍歷已歸類約 %d 百分比"}}}},
    "基线：%@ · 只比较同一根目录的两次可靠结果" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Baseline: %@ · Only two reliable results for the same root are compared"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"基線：%@ · 只比較同一根目錄的兩次可靠結果"}}}},
    "前 16 个证据目录没有可见变化。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No visible changes in the first 16 evidence directories."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"前 16 個證據目錄沒有可見變化。"}}}},
    "决策筛选" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Decision Filter"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"決策篩選"}}}},
    "这个筛选下没有项目。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No items match this filter."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這個篩選下沒有項目。"}}}},
    "在所属 App 管理" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Manage in Owning App"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在所屬 App 管理"}}}},
    "进入此文件夹" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Open This Folder"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"進入此資料夾"}}}},
    "前往设置页" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Open Settings"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"前往設定頁"}}}},
    "正在读取大目录内部构成，这一步可能需要十几秒…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reading the contents of large directories; this may take several seconds…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在讀取大目錄內部構成，這一步可能需要十幾秒…"}}}},
    "所选本机模型正在根据实际子项和体积判断用途与风险…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Your selected on-device model is assessing purpose and risk from actual child items and sizes…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所選本機模型正在根據實際子項和體積判斷用途與風險…"}}}},
    "覆盖 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Coverage %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"涵蓋 %@"}}}},
    "容量扫描已经完成。点击“AI 深度分析”，即可看到大目录的实际主要构成和安全处理建议。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The storage scan is complete. Click “AI Deep Analysis” to see what actually occupies large directories and get safe handling suggestions."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"容量掃描已經完成。點擊「AI 深度分析」，即可看到大目錄的實際主要構成和安全處理建議。"}}}},
    "有 %@ 无法从当前层级确认所属软件。展开“归属待确认”并继续进入目录后，CleanNest 才会按 App 路径重新归类。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ cannot be attributed to an app from the current level. Expand “Ownership Unconfirmed” and continue into directories so CleanNest can reclassify items by app path."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"有 %@ 無法從目前層級確認所屬軟體。展開「歸屬待確認」並繼續進入目錄後，CleanNest 才會按 App 路徑重新歸類。"}}}},
    "这个位置没有可显示的内容，或当前权限不足。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This location has no displayable content, or current permissions are insufficient."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這個位置沒有可顯示的內容，或目前權限不足。"}}}},
    "这里改变的只是看法，不是删除权限。占用大不等于可清理；所有视角继续遵守原来的只读、复核和保护边界。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Only the perspective changes here, not deletion permission. Large usage does not mean an item is cleanable; every perspective retains the same read-only, review, and protection boundaries."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這裡改變的只是看法，不是刪除權限。佔用大不等於可清理；所有視角繼續遵守原來的唯讀、複核和保護邊界。"}}}},
    "磁盘占用清单" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Disk Storage Inventory"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"磁碟佔用清單"}}}},
    "占用视角" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Storage Perspective"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"佔用視角"}}}},
    "磁盘占用视角" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Disk Storage Perspective"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"磁碟佔用視角"}}}},
    "占本次扫描 %d%%" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d%% of this scan"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"佔本次掃描 %d%%"}}}},
    "%@，占用 %@，%@，%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@, using %@, %@, %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@，佔用 %@，%@，%@"}}}},
    "AI 优先 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"AI priority %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"AI 優先 %@"}}}},
    "清理习惯" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cleanup Habits"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"清理習慣"}}}},
    "清理偏好和模型评价会被清空；文件、扫描结果与本机模型不会受到影响。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cleanup preferences and model ratings will be cleared; files, scan results, and on-device models are unaffected."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"清理偏好和模型評價會被清除；檔案、掃描結果與本機模型不會受到影響。"}}}},
    "只保存项目类型、哈希身份、你的选择和模型评价；不保存文件内容或完整路径。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Only item types, hash identities, your choices, and model ratings are saved; file contents and full paths are not."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只保存項目類型、雜湊身分、你的選擇和模型評價；不保存檔案內容或完整路徑。"}}}},
    "在清理列表里对某类项目点“以后优先清理”或“以后优先保留”，这里就会攒出一条习惯。你启用后，下次扫描时这类文件自动排前或排后——只改顺序，不会替你勾选，更不会删文件。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"In the cleanup list, choose “Prioritize Cleanup” or “Prioritize Keeping” for a type of item to build a habit here. Once enabled, these files move earlier or later in the next scan—only the order changes; nothing is selected or deleted for you."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在清理清單裡對某類項目點「以後優先清理」或「以後優先保留」，這裡就會累積出一條習慣。你啟用後，下次掃描時這類檔案自動排前或排後——只改順序，不會替你勾選，更不會刪檔案。"}}}},
    "先去扫描一次" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Run a Scan First"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"先執行一次掃描"}}}},
    "先处理待确认的习惯" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Review Pending Habits First"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"先處理待確認的習慣"}}}},
    "你可以启用、先试 7 天、暂停或撤销。所有习惯只改变下次清理列表的排序，不会替你勾选或删除文件。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"You can enable, try for 7 days, pause, or withdraw them. Habits only change the order of the next cleanup list; they never select or delete files for you."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你可以啟用、先試用 7 天、暫停或撤銷。所有習慣只改變下次清理清單的排序，不會替你勾選或刪除檔案。"}}}},
    "再显示 %d 组" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Show %d More Groups"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"再顯示 %d 組"}}}},
    "只加载更多习惯，不会启用或修改" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Only loads more habits; nothing is enabled or modified"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只載入更多習慣，不會啟用或修改"}}}},
    "对当前清理列表的真实影响" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Actual Impact on the Current Cleanup List"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"對目前清理清單的實際影響"}}}},
    "当前没有保留扫描结果；下次扫描后会显示具体有多少项目被前移或后移。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No scan results are currently retained; the next scan will show exactly how many items moved earlier or later."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目前沒有保留掃描結果；下次掃描後會顯示具體有多少項目被前移或後移。"}}}},
    "当前扫描结果里没有命中已启用习惯的项目，顺序不变。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No items in the current scan match an enabled habit, so the order is unchanged."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目前掃描結果裡沒有符合已啟用習慣的項目，順序不變。"}}}},
    "命中 %d 项，其中 %d 项位置发生变化：%d 项前移复核，%d 项后移保留。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d items matched; %d changed position: %d moved earlier for review and %d moved later to keep."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"符合 %d 項，其中 %d 項位置發生變化：%d 項前移複核，%d 項後移保留。"}}}},
    "习惯从不替你勾选：已选数量始终是 0 项被自动改变。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Habits never select items for you: the number of automatic selection changes is always 0."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"習慣從不替你勾選：自動改變的已選數量始終是 0 項。"}}}},
    "习惯排序影响，命中 %d 项，移动 %d 项，没有自动改变选择" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Habit sorting impact: %d matched, %d moved, no selections changed automatically"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"習慣排序影響，符合 %d 項，移動 %d 項，沒有自動改變選取"}}}},
    "%@，%@，%@，%@，共 %d 条习惯" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@, %@, %@, %@, %d habits in total"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@，%@，%@，%@，共 %d 條習慣"}}}},
    "%@ · %d 个文件 · 你选择过 %d 次" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · %d files · You chose %d times"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · %d 個檔案 · 你選擇過 %d 次"}}}},
    "示例：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Examples: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"範例：%@"}}}},
    "启用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enable"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"啟用"}}}},
    "先试 7 天" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Try for 7 Days"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"先試用 7 天"}}}},
    "有帮助 %d · 不准确 %d" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Helpful %d · Inaccurate %d"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"有幫助 %d · 不準確 %d"}}}},
    "再显示 %d 个模型" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Show %d More Models"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"再顯示 %d 個模型"}}}},
    "清空学习记录不会删除扫描结果、文件或本机模型。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clearing learning records does not delete scan results, files, or on-device models."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"清除學習記錄不會刪除掃描結果、檔案或本機模型。"}}}},
    "全部清空" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clear All"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"全部清除"}}}},
    "本地模型，" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Local Models,"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本機模型，"}}}},
    "停止" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stop"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"停止"}}}},
    "重新启用…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enable Again…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重新啟用…"}}}},
    "启动" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Start"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"啟動"}}}},
    "重新发现本地模型" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Rediscover Local Models"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重新探索本機模型"}}}},
    "先发送正常终止；不会批量结束同名进程。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sends a normal termination request first; it never ends same-named processes in bulk."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"先發送正常終止；不會批次結束同名程序。"}}}},
    "停用并关闭…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Disable and Stop…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"停用並關閉…"}}}},
    "启动后由 CleanNest 持有并可安全停止。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Once started, the service is owned by CleanNest and can be stopped safely."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"啟動後由 CleanNest 持有並可安全停止。"}}}},
    "服务列出的模型短 ID" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Short model ID listed by the service"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"服務列出的模型短 ID"}}}},
    "DFlash2：当前 oMLX 健康接口没有返回可验证的启用状态，因此这里只展示模型短 ID，不猜测加速配置。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"DFlash2: the current oMLX health endpoint does not return a verifiable enabled state, so only the short model ID is shown; acceleration configuration is not guessed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"DFlash2：目前 oMLX 健康介面沒有回傳可驗證的啟用狀態，因此這裡只展示模型短 ID，不猜測加速設定。"}}}},
    "每条链都来自当前进程、TCP、平台 API 与 launchd 证据；没有连接就显示“未观察到”，不会猜测谁在使用模型。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Every chain comes from current process, TCP, platform API, and launchd evidence. Without a connection it shows “Not Observed” rather than guessing who is using the model."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"每條鏈都來自目前程序、TCP、平台 API 與 launchd 證據；沒有連線就顯示「未觀察到」，不會猜測誰在使用模型。"}}}},
    "本次运行还没有服务启停、PID 替换、模型切换或唤醒复核事件。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No service start/stop, PID replacement, model switch, or wake-verification events have occurred in this session."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本次執行還沒有服務啟停、PID 替換、模型切換或喚醒複核事件。"}}}},
    "最近一次唤醒复核：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Last wake verification: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"最近一次喚醒複核：%@"}}}},
    "当前没有确认到健康模型服务。你可以启动已经在设置中选定的模型；CleanNest 只会保存结构化路径和端口，不执行拼接的终端命令。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No healthy model service is currently confirmed. You can start the model already selected in Settings; CleanNest only stores structured paths and ports and never runs assembled shell commands."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目前沒有確認到健康模型服務。你可以啟動已經在設定中選定的模型；CleanNest 只會保存結構化路徑和連接埠，不執行拼接的終端機指令。"}}}},
    "只对当前配置的模型短 ID 发出一个“OK”最小请求。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sends one minimal “OK” request only to the currently configured short model ID."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只對目前設定的模型短 ID 發出一個「OK」最小請求。"}}}},
    "不发送扫描结果、文件名或文件内容；结果只代表当前机器负载。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No scan results, file names, or file contents are sent; results only represent the current machine load."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"不發送掃描結果、檔名或檔案內容；結果只代表目前機器負載。"}}}},
    "发送一个仅包含 OK 的本机推理请求" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Send an on-device inference request containing only OK"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"發送一個僅包含 OK 的本機推理請求"}}}},
    "本次实测对象：%@。这不是长文本吞吐或峰值内存承诺。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Benchmarked model: %@. This is not a promise of long-text throughput or peak memory use."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本次實測對象：%@。這不是長文本吞吐或峰值記憶體承諾。"}}}},
    "先确认设置中的回环服务与模型短 ID，才能运行测速。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Confirm the loopback service and short model ID in Settings before running a benchmark."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"先確認設定中的回環服務與模型短 ID，才能執行測速。"}}}},
    "检测连接" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Test Connection"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"檢測連線"}}}},
    "多类本地运行时共享同一套证据门；除进程与 API 外，还会识别 launchd 守护、自动重启和登录启动状态。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Multiple local runtime types share the same evidence gate. In addition to processes and APIs, CleanNest recognizes launchd daemons, automatic restart, and login-start state."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"多類本機執行時共享同一套證據門；除程序與 API 外，還會識別 launchd 守護、自動重新啟動和登入啟動狀態。"}}}},
    "·" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"·"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"·"}}}},
    "CleanNest 实时监测" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest Live Monitor"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest 即時監測"}}}},
    "正在读取第一个本机样本…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reading the first on-device sample…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在讀取第一個本機樣本…"}}}},
    "打开系统状态" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Open System Status"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"開啟系統狀態"}}}},
    "菜单栏设置" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Menu Bar Settings"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選單列設定"}}}},
    "暂不可用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Temporarily Unavailable"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"暫不可用"}}}},
    "打开对应栏目；不会直接执行清理或修改设置" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Open the corresponding section; no cleanup or settings changes are performed directly"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"開啟對應欄目；不會直接執行清理或修改設定"}}}},
    "打开" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Open"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"開啟"}}}},
    "累计成果独立保存；清空明细不会归零。移到废纸篓也不等于磁盘已释放。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cumulative results are stored separately; clearing details does not reset them. Moving items to Trash also does not mean disk space has been reclaimed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"累計成果獨立保存；清除明細不會歸零。移到垃圾桶也不等於磁碟已釋放。"}}}},
    "打开这条活动记录的完整详情" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Open full details for this activity record"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"開啟這條活動記錄的完整詳情"}}}},
    "活动明细已清空；累计成果仍保留。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activity details were cleared; cumulative results are retained."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"活動明細已清除；累計成果仍保留。"}}}},
    "打开对应功能；不会直接执行删除" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Open the corresponding feature; nothing is deleted directly"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"開啟對應功能；不會直接執行刪除"}}}},
    "返回" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Back"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"返回"}}}},
    "前进" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Forward"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"前進"}}}},
    "这些信息只来自本机，可复制后用于排查问题。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This information comes only from this Mac and can be copied to help diagnose issues."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這些資訊只來自本機，可複製後用於排查問題。"}}}},
    "清空历史记录" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clear History"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"清除歷史記錄"}}}},
    "这只删除 CleanNest 记录的 CPU、内存、磁盘、电池与温度样本；不会删除系统文件。后续采样会重新开始。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This only deletes CPU, memory, disk, battery, and temperature samples recorded by CleanNest; it does not delete system files. Subsequent sampling starts again."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這只會刪除 CleanNest 記錄的 CPU、記憶體、磁碟、電池與溫度樣本；不會刪除系統檔案。後續採樣會重新開始。"}}}},
    "恢复默认设置" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Restore Default Settings"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"恢復預設設定"}}}},
    "会关闭由 CleanNest 启动的本机模型并重置引擎路径、模型连接、扫描开关和指标保留期限；不会清除活动、扫描结果、学习规则、历史指标或 macOS 授权。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This stops on-device models started by CleanNest and resets engine paths, model connections, scan switches, and metric retention. It does not clear activities, scan results, learned rules, historical metrics, or macOS permissions."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"會關閉由 CleanNest 啟動的本機模型並重置引擎路徑、模型連線、掃描開關和指標保留期限；不會清除活動、掃描結果、學習規則、歷史指標或 macOS 授權。"}}}},
    "设置分栏" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Settings Sections"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"設定分欄"}}}},
    "通过 Homebrew 免费安装" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Install Free with Homebrew"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"透過 Homebrew 免費安裝"}}}},
    "在其他 App 里也能直接看到这台 Mac 的负载" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"See this Mac’s load directly while using other apps"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在其他 App 裡也能直接看到這台 Mac 的負載"}}}},
    "启用菜单栏实时监测" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enable Live Menu Bar Monitoring"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"啟用選單列即時監測"}}}},
    "双层紧凑" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Compact Two Rows"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"雙層緊湊"}}}},
    "展开文字" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Expanded Text"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"展開文字"}}}},
    "%d 秒" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d seconds"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d 秒"}}}},
    "摄氏 °C" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Celsius °C"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"攝氏 °C"}}}},
    "华氏 °F" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fahrenheit °F"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"華氏 °F"}}}},
    "物理网卡合计" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"All Physical Interfaces"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"實體網卡合計"}}}},
    "系统主接口" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"System Primary Interface"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"系統主要介面"}}}},
    "手动指定" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Specify Manually"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"手動指定"}}}},
    "选择网络接口" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose Network Interface"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選擇網路介面"}}}},
    "未找到活动接口" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No Active Interface Found"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"找不到活躍介面"}}}},
    "在系统设置中允许" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Allow in System Settings"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在系統設定中允許"}}}},
    "登录后常驻菜单栏" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stay in Menu Bar After Login"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"登入後常駐選單列"}}}},
    "启用全局快捷键" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enable Global Keyboard Shortcut"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"啟用全域快速鍵"}}}},
    "指标按你选定的频率在本机读取，不保存网络地址，不上传；退出 CleanNest 后采样立即停止。温度、GPU 和风扇取决于当前硬件是否提供可读计数；CleanNest 不控制风扇，也不要求管理员密码。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Metrics are read on this Mac at your chosen frequency. Network addresses are not stored and nothing is uploaded; sampling stops immediately when CleanNest quits. Temperature, GPU, and fan readings depend on counters exposed by the current hardware. CleanNest does not control fans or require an administrator password."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"指標按你選定的頻率在本機讀取，不保存網路位址，不上傳；結束 CleanNest 後採樣立即停止。溫度、GPU 和風扇取決於目前硬體是否提供可讀計數；CleanNest 不控制風扇，也不要求管理員密碼。"}}}},
    "立即刷新" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Refresh Now"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"立即重新整理"}}}},
    "macOS 只提供正常、警告、严重等级，不伪造百分比阈值。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS provides only normal, warning, and critical levels; CleanNest does not invent percentage thresholds."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS 只提供正常、警告、嚴重等級，不偽造百分比閾值。"}}}},
    "警告等级就提醒" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Notify at Warning Level"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"警告等級就提醒"}}}},
    "菜单栏、弹出面板、系统状态页和告警时间线共用这一份设置。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The menu bar, popover, System Status page, and alert timeline all share these settings."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選單列、彈出面板、系統狀態頁和警示時間線共用這一份設定。"}}}},
    "恢复保守预设" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Restore Conservative Preset"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"恢復保守預設"}}}},
    "异常阈值" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Anomaly Thresholds"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"異常閾值"}}}},
    "保守预设可调整；每次变色都能回到同一条规则。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The conservative preset is adjustable; every color change maps back to the same rule."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"保守預設可調整；每次變色都能回到同一條規則。"}}}},
    "提醒 %d%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Warning %d%@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"提醒 %d%@"}}}},
    "严重 %d%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Critical %d%@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"嚴重 %d%@"}}}},
    "向前移动" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Move Forward"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"向前移動"}}}},
    "向后移动" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Move Backward"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"向後移動"}}}},
    "在菜单栏显示" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Show in Menu Bar"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在選單列顯示"}}}},
    "显示方式" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Display Style"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"顯示方式"}}}},
    "数值" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Value"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"數值"}}}},
    "曲线" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Graph"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"曲線"}}}},
    "使用 oMLX" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Use oMLX"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"使用 oMLX"}}}},
    "管理明细" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Manage Details"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"管理明細"}}}},
    "只重置偏好；活动、学习、扫描索引、历史指标和系统授权分别保留。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Only preferences are reset; activities, learning, scan indexes, historical metrics, and system permissions are each retained."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只重置偏好；活動、學習、掃描索引、歷史指標和系統授權分別保留。"}}}},
    "恢复…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Restore…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"恢復…"}}}},
    "仅显示" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Show Only"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"僅顯示"}}}},
    "系统数据" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"System Data"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"系統資料"}}}},
    "找到大项，看懂用途，再决定怎么处理。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Find large items, understand their purpose, then decide how to handle them."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"找到大項，看懂用途，再決定怎麼處理。"}}}},
    "检查本机 %d 个常见位置：开发缓存、模拟器、设备备份、模型和虚拟机。只读元数据，不扫描你的整块硬盘。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Checks %d common locations on this Mac: developer caches, simulators, device backups, models, and virtual machines. Reads metadata only; it does not scan your entire disk."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"檢查本機 %d 個常見位置：開發快取、模擬器、裝置備份、模型和虛擬機。唯讀後設資料，不掃描你的整塊硬碟。"}}}},
    "搜索系统数据" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Search System Data"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"搜尋系統資料"}}}},
    "筛选" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Filter"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"篩選"}}}},
    "可重建" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Rebuildable"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"可重建"}}}},
    "%d / %d · %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d / %d · %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d / %d · %@"}}}},
    "取消扫描" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cancel Scan"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"取消掃描"}}}},
    "下方仍是上次完成的结果，本次扫描尚未替换它。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The previous completed results remain below; the current scan has not replaced them yet."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"下方仍是上次完成的結果，本次掃描尚未替換它。"}}}},
    "可以清空搜索或切回“全部”；默认路径未找到不代表该软件没有安装。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clear the search or switch back to “All”; a missing default path does not mean the software is not installed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"可以清空搜尋或切回「全部」；預設路徑未找到不代表該軟體沒有安裝。"}}}},
    "只统计清单内已读到的文件分配块；硬链接 / APFS 克隆可能共享空间，合计不等于可释放空间或 macOS“系统数据”。不含系统快照、系统级运行时、交换文件和自定义目录。每处最多遍历 10 万项；不跨卷、不跟随符号链接。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Only allocated blocks for files read within the inventory are counted. Hard links and APFS clones may share space, so totals do not equal reclaimable space or macOS “System Data.” System snapshots, system-level runtimes, swap files, and custom directories are excluded. Each location traverses at most 100,000 entries; volumes are not crossed and symbolic links are not followed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只統計清單內已讀到的檔案分配區塊；硬連結／APFS 複製可能共享空間，合計不等於可釋放空間或 macOS「系統資料」。不含系統快照、系統級執行時、交換檔案和自訂目錄。每處最多遍歷 10 萬項；不跨卷、不跟隨符號連結。"}}}},
    "%d 个位置 · %d 处未完整扫描" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d locations · %d incompletely scanned"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d 個位置 · %d 處未完整掃描"}}}},
    "系统另估可回收 %@，不保证立即释放" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"System separately estimates %@ reclaimable; immediate release is not guaranteed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"系統另估可回收 %@，不保證立即釋放"}}}},
    "采样 %@ · 变化只比较本次打开 App 后的两次完整测量" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sampled %@ · Changes compare only two complete measurements since this app opening"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"採樣 %@ · 變化只比較本次開啟 App 後的兩次完整測量"}}}},
    "较上次 %@%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@%@ since previous"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"較上次 %@%@"}}}},
    "%@，%@，查看用途和处理影响" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@, %@; review purpose and handling impact"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@，%@，查看用途和處理影響"}}}},
    "已读 %d 个文件 · 不可读 %d · 链接跳过 %d%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d files read · %d unreadable · %d links skipped%@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已讀 %d 個檔案 · 不可讀 %d · 連結略過 %d%@"}}}},
    " · 已达条目上限，大小仅为下限" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" · Entry limit reached; size is a lower bound only"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" · 已達項目上限，大小僅為下限"}}}},
    "最近文件写入：%@（不是最后使用时间）" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Latest file write: %@ (not last-used time)"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"最近檔案寫入：%@（不是最後使用時間）"}}}},
    "在 Finder 查看" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"View in Finder"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在 Finder 查看"}}}},
    "强制结束“%@”？" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Force Quit “%@”?"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"強制結束「%@」？"}}}},
    "该进程没有在正常请求后退出。强制结束不会给它保存状态的机会，未保存的内容可能丢失。\n\n%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The process did not exit after a normal request. Force quitting will not give it a chance to save state, and unsaved changes may be lost.\n\n%@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"該程序沒有在正常請求後結束。強制結束不會給它保存狀態的機會，未保存的內容可能遺失。\n\n%@"}}}},
    "强制结束" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Force Quit"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"強制結束"}}}},
    "继续等待" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Keep Waiting"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"繼續等待"}}}},
    "退出“%@”？" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Quit “%@”?"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"結束「%@」？"}}}},
    "CleanNest 会先发送正常退出请求；是否保存状态由所属 App 决定。\n\n%@\n\n未保存的内容可能丢失。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest sends a normal quit request first; the owning app decides whether to save state.\n\n%@\n\nUnsaved changes may be lost."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest 會先發送正常結束請求；是否保存狀態由所屬 App 決定。\n\n%@\n\n未保存的內容可能遺失。"}}}},
    "发送退出请求" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Send Quit Request"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"發送結束請求"}}}},
    "最新样本 " : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Latest sample "}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"最新樣本 "}}}},
    "正在等待第一个本机样本…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Waiting for the first on-device sample…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在等待第一個本機樣本…"}}}},
    "只记录温度、电池、内存压力、磁盘余量和风扇相对负载的异常、峰值与恢复；CPU、GPU 和网络繁忙不会被当成故障。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Only anomalies, peaks, and recovery for temperature, battery, memory pressure, free disk space, and relative fan load are recorded; CPU, GPU, and network activity are not treated as failures."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只記錄溫度、電池、記憶體壓力、磁碟餘量和風扇相對負載的異常、峰值與恢復；CPU、GPU 和網路繁忙不會被當成故障。"}}}},
    "历史只保存在本机，不记录网络地址、访问内容或流量正文；睡眠和退出期间不会虚增持续时间。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"History stays on this Mac. Network addresses, accessed content, and traffic payloads are not recorded; sleep and quit periods do not artificially increase durations."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"歷史只保存在本機，不記錄網路位址、存取內容或流量正文；睡眠和結束期間不會虛增持續時間。"}}}},
    "峰值：%@ · 持续 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Peak: %@ · Duration %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"峰值：%@ · 持續 %@"}}}},
    "内存占用较高的应用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Apps Using More Memory"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"記憶體佔用較高的應用程式"}}}},
    "先按所属 App 汇总，再按需展开辅助进程；退出风险仍逐个确认，不提供整组强制结束。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Processes are grouped by owning app, with helpers expandable as needed. Quit risk is still confirmed individually; no group force-quit is provided."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"先按所屬 App 彙總，再按需展開輔助程序；結束風險仍逐個確認，不提供整組強制結束。"}}}},
    "%d 个进程" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d processes"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d 個程序"}}}},
    "%@，%d 个进程，近似内存足迹 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@, %d processes, approximate memory footprint %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@，%d 個程序，近似記憶體足跡 %@"}}}},
    "强制结束…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Force Quit…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"強制結束…"}}}},
    "电池，%@，%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Battery, %@, %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"電池，%@，%@"}}}},
    "执行“%@”？" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Run “%@”?"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行「%@」？"}}}},
    "尚未诊断；先做只读检查，不会重启服务。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Not diagnosed yet; start with a read-only check that does not restart services."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"尚未診斷；先做唯讀檢查，不會重新啟動服務。"}}}},
    "先诊断" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Diagnose First"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"先診斷"}}}},
    "查看影响并执行…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Review Impact and Run…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"查看影響並執行…"}}}},
    "重新诊断" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Diagnose Again"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重新診斷"}}}},
    "执行前：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Before: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行前：%@"}}}},
    "执行后：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"After: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行後：%@"}}}},
    "全部类型" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"All Types"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"全部類型"}}}},
    "清理" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cleanup"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"清理"}}}},
    "App 卸载" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"App Uninstall"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"App 解除安裝"}}}},
    "维护与其他" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Maintenance & Other"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"維護與其他"}}}},
    "全部结果" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"All Results"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"全部結果"}}}},
    "部分完成" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Partially Completed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"部分完成"}}}},
    "未完成" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Not Completed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未完成"}}}},
    "活动记录未能导出" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activity Could Not Be Exported"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"活動記錄未能導出"}}}},
    "活动记录已导出" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activity Exported"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"活動記錄已導出"}}}},
    "活动明细已清空" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activity Details Cleared"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"活動明細已清空"}}}},
    "累计成果仍保留；新的清理、卸载或维护结果会继续出现在这里。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cumulative results are preserved. New cleanup, uninstall, and maintenance results will continue to appear here."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"累計成果仍保留；新的清理、解除安裝或維護結果會繼續出現在這裡。"}}}},
    "完成一次清理、卸载或维护后，这里会显示结果。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Results appear here after you complete a cleanup, uninstall, or maintenance task."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"完成一次清理、解除安裝或維護後，這裡會顯示結果。"}}}},
    "没有符合条件的记录" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No Matching Records"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"沒有符合條件的記錄"}}}},
    "调整搜索、类型、结果或时间范围；不会修改原始记录。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Adjust the search, type, result, or time range. Original records are not modified."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"調整搜索、類型、結果或時間範圍；不會修改原始記錄。"}}}},
    "已处理 %@ · %@ 次有成果操作" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Processed %@ · %@ productive operations"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已處理 %@ · %@ 次有成果操作"}}}},
    "操作记录保存在本机" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activity Records Stay on This Mac"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"操作記錄保存在本機"}}}},
    "清空所有 CleanNest 活动明细？" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clear All CleanNest Activity Details?"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"清空所有 CleanNest 活動明細？"}}}},
    "把累计成果归零？" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reset Cumulative Results?"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"把累計成果歸零？"}}}},
    "搜索标题或说明" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Search titles or descriptions"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"搜索標題或說明"}}}},
    "筛选记录" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Filter Records"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"篩選記錄"}}}},
    "全部记录" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"All Records"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"全部記錄"}}}},
    "导出活动记录" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Export Activity Records"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"導出活動記錄"}}}},
    "已写入你选择的位置；JSON 可能包含操作项目名称，请在公开分享前检查。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Saved to your chosen location. The JSON may contain operated item names; review it before sharing publicly."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已寫入你選擇的位置；JSON 可能包含操作項目名稱，請在公開分享前檢查。"}}}},
    "独立累计，不随明细清空" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tracked independently; not reset when details are cleared"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"獨立累計，不隨明細清空"}}}},
    "累计成果与 %@ 条活动明细分开保存；移入废纸篓不等于已释放 APFS 空间。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cumulative results are stored separately from %@ activity records. Moving items to Trash does not mean APFS space has been released."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"累計成果與 %@ 條活動明細分開保存；移入垃圾桶不等於已釋放 APFS 空間。"}}}},
    "只读统计，%@：%@。%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Read-only statistic, %@: %@. %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"唯讀統計，%@：%@。%@"}}}},
    "这是一条本机结果记录" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This Is an On-Device Result Record"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這是一條本機結果記錄"}}}},
    "三个数字代表不同事情" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The Three Values Measure Different Things"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"三個數字代表不同事情"}}}},
    "它能说明当时发生了什么，但不会重新执行操作。需要恢复文件时，请先在废纸篓或对应功能页核对当前状态。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"It describes what happened and does not repeat the operation. To restore files, first check the current state in Trash or the relevant feature."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"它能說明當時發生了什麼，但不會重新執行操作。需要恢復檔案時，請先在垃圾桶或對應功能頁核對當前狀態。"}}}},
    "候选体积是你当时勾选的量；移入废纸篓体积是成功处理的量；APFS 变化是操作前后立即实测，可受其他系统活动影响。只移入废纸篓通常不会立即释放空间。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Candidate size is what you selected; moved-to-Trash size is what was processed; APFS change is measured immediately before and after and may be affected by other system activity. Moving items to Trash usually does not release space immediately."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"候選體積是你當時勾選的量；移入垃圾桶體積是成功處理的量；APFS 變化是操作前後立即實測，可受其他系統活動影響。只移入垃圾桶通常不會立即釋放空間。"}}}},
    "项目" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Items"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"項目"}}}},
    "候选体积" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Candidate Size"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"候選體積"}}}},
    "移入废纸篓" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Moved to Trash"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"移入垃圾桶"}}}},
    "APFS 实测变化" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Measured APFS Change"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"APFS 實測變化"}}}},
    "记录体积" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Recorded Size"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"記錄體積"}}}},
    "记录 ID" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Record ID"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"記錄 ID"}}}},
    "%@ 项本机证据" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ items of on-device evidence"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 項本機證據"}}}},
    "未检查" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Not Checked"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未檢查"}}}},
    "适配器待验证：没有可靠路径，不会猜测扫描" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Adapter not verified: no reliable path, so CleanNest will not guess where to scan"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"適配器待驗證：沒有可靠路徑，不會猜測掃描"}}}},
    "没有发现应用、数据、进程或守护证据" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No app, data, process, or supervisor evidence found"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"沒有發現應用、資料、進程或守護證據"}}}},
    "尚未扫描 Agent 占用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agent usage has not been scanned"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"尚未掃描 Agent 佔用"}}}},
    "正在使用内置规则。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Using built-in rules."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在使用內置規則。"}}}},
    "已释放文件级明细；再次进入时会重新验证。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"File-level details were released and will be revalidated when you return."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已釋放檔案級明細；再次進入時會重新驗證。"}}}},
    "清空所有清理习惯？" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clear All Cleanup Habits?"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"清空所有清理習慣？"}}}},
    "它会怎样影响下一次扫描" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"How It Affects the Next Scan"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"它會怎樣影響下一次掃描"}}}},
    "只调整排序，需要你明确启用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Only changes sorting and requires your explicit approval"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只調整排序，需要你明確啟用"}}}},
    "尚未影响任何排序" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No sorting affected yet"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"尚未影響任何排序"}}}},
    "已启用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enabled"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已啟用"}}}},
    "可随时暂停或撤销" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pause or remove at any time"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"可隨時暫停或撤銷"}}}},
    "试用中" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Trial Active"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"試用中"}}}},
    "到期自动暂停" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Automatically pauses when the trial ends"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"到期自動暫停"}}}},
    "用于比较本机模型" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Used to compare on-device models"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"用於比較本機模型"}}}},
    "你标记" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"You Mark"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你標記"}}}},
    "清理页里点优先清理/保留" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose prioritize cleanup/keep on the Cleanup page"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"清理頁里點優先清理/保留"}}}},
    "它总结" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"It Summarizes"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"它總結"}}}},
    "同类选择攒成一条习惯" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Similar choices become a habit"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"同類選擇攢成一條習慣"}}}},
    "你确认" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"You Confirm"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你確認"}}}},
    "启用、先试 7 天或撤销" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enable, try for 7 days, or remove"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"啟用、先試 7 天或撤銷"}}}},
    "下次扫描" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Next Scan"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"下次掃描"}}}},
    "这类文件自动排前或排后" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"These files automatically move earlier or later"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這類檔案自動排前或排後"}}}},
    "正在生效的习惯" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Active Habits"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在生效的習慣"}}}},
    "%@ 条启用 · %@ 条试用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ enabled · %@ on trial"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 條啟用 · %@ 條試用"}}}},
    "还没有评价" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No Feedback Yet"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"還沒有評價"}}}},
    "%@ 条本机评价" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ on-device ratings"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 條本機評價"}}}},
    "最近变更记录" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Recent Changes"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"最近變更記錄"}}}},
    "还没有记录" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No Records Yet"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"還沒有記錄"}}}},
    "最近 %@ 条" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Latest %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"最近 %@ 條"}}}},
    "管理学习记录" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Manage Learning Records"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"管理學習記錄"}}}},
    "清空不会影响文件、扫描结果或本机模型" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clearing does not affect files, scan results, or on-device models"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"清空不會影響檔案、掃描結果或本機模型"}}}},
    "待你确认的习惯" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Habits Awaiting Your Approval"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"待你確認的習慣"}}}},
    "一条习惯就是一类文件的排序倾向" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A habit is a sorting preference for a type of file"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"一條習慣就是一類檔案的排序傾向"}}}},
    "按文件类型、位置、风险和新旧归组。启用后只改变下次清理列表的先后顺序：不会替你勾选，不会删文件，不会动其他东西。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Grouped by file type, location, risk, and age. Once enabled, a habit only changes order in the next cleanup list: it never selects or deletes files or changes anything else."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"按檔案類型、位置、風險和新舊歸組。啟用後只改變下次清理列表的先後順序：不會替你勾選，不會刪檔案，不會動其他東西。"}}}},
    "有 %@ 条习惯的试用期到了" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ habits have reached the end of their trial"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"有 %@ 條習慣的試用期到了"}}}},
    "它们已自动暂停，不再影响排序；可以一次清理这些过期记录。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"They were automatically paused and no longer affect sorting. You can remove these expired records together."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"它們已自動暫停，不再影響排序；可以一次清理這些過期記錄。"}}}},
    "清掉到期习惯" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Remove Expired Habits"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"清掉到期習慣"}}}},
    "还没有攒出习惯" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No Habits Learned Yet"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"還沒有攢出習慣"}}}},
    "在清理列表中选择“提议：以后优先清理/保留”，或完成一次安全清理。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose “Suggest prioritizing cleanup/keeping” in the cleanup list, or complete a safe cleanup."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在清理列表中選擇“提議：以後優先清理/保留”，或完成一次安全清理。"}}}},
    "优先复核" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Review First"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"優先復核"}}}},
