    "试用中 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"On trial %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"試用中 %@"}}}},
    "已暂停 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Paused %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已暫停 %@"}}}},
    "已到期 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Expired %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已到期 %@"}}}},
    "已启用的习惯" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enabled Habits"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已啟用的習慣"}}}},
    "还没有启用的习惯" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No Enabled Habits"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"還沒有啟用的習慣"}}}},
    "在上方启用一条习惯后，它会显示在这里。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enable a habit above and it will appear here."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在上方啟用一條習慣後，它會顯示在這裡。"}}}},
    "还没有模型评价" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No Model Feedback Yet"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"還沒有模型評價"}}}},
    "完成一次 AI 分析后，评价建议是否有帮助。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"After an AI analysis, rate whether its suggestions were helpful."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"完成一次 AI 分析後，評價建議是否有幫助。"}}}},
    "模型短 ID 未确认" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Short model ID not confirmed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"模型短 ID 未確認"}}}},
