    "CleanNest 已经启动了一个本机模型进程" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest has already started an on-device model process"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest 已經啓動了一個本機模型進程"}}}},
    "所选本机模型服务程序不存在或不可执行" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The selected on-device model server does not exist or is not executable"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所選本機模型服務程式不存在或不可執行"}}}},
    "模型目录不完整，需要 config.json 与 safetensors 权重" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The model directory is incomplete; config.json and safetensors weights are required"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"模型目錄不完整，需要 config.json 與 safetensors 權重"}}}},
    "0.5.3 只允许直接启动 oMLX 或 mlx_lm.server" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Version 0.5.3 can only launch oMLX or mlx_lm.server directly"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"0.5.3 只允許直接啓動 oMLX 或 mlx_lm.server"}}}},
    "\n模型进程已退出（状态 %@）。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"\nThe model process exited (status %@)."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"\n模型進程已退出（狀態 %@）。"}}}},
    "页面巡游使用合成数据；它验证渲染生命周期，不证明真实扫描峰值。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The page walkthrough uses synthetic data. It verifies rendering lifecycle, not peak memory during real scans."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"頁面巡遊使用合成資料；它驗證渲染生命週期，不證明真實掃描峰值。"}}}},
    "未知模式 %@；没有执行内存场景。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Unknown mode %@; no memory scenario was run."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未知模式 %@；沒有執行記憶體場景。"}}}},
    "你的 Mac，今天怎么样？" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"How is your Mac doing today?"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你的 Mac，今天怎麼樣？"}}}},
    "最近操作与累计成果" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Recent Activity & Cumulative Results"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"最近操作與累計成果"}}}},
    "查看处理结果、统计与恢复入口" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Review outcomes, statistics, and recovery options"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"查看處理結果、統計與恢復入口"}}}},
    "查看最近未完成的操作" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Review the latest incomplete operation"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"查看最近未完成的操作"}}}},
    "查看记录详情" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"View Record Details"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"查看記錄詳情"}}}},
    "受保护目录访问未通过" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Protected Directory Access Failed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"受保護目錄訪問未通過"}}}},
    "确认受保护目录访问" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Confirm Protected Directory Access"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"確認受保護目錄訪問"}}}},
    "需要受保护目录的任务会在扫描前停止；普通目录仍可使用。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tasks requiring protected directories stop before scanning; ordinary locations remain available."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"需要受保護目錄的任務會在掃描前停止；普通目錄仍可使用。"}}}},
    "CleanNest 本次还没有实测受保护目录；进入隐私设置后只检测一次。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest has not tested protected-directory access in this session. Open Privacy Settings to run one test."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest 本次還沒有實測受保護目錄；進入隱私設定後只檢測一次。"}}}},
    "打开扫描与隐私" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Open Scanning & Privacy"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"打開掃描與隱私"}}}},
