    "实时用量、占用进程与异常记录。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Live usage, top processes, and anomaly history."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"即時用量、佔用進程與異常記錄。"}}}},
