    "内存压力、交换空间和处理建议" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Memory pressure, swap, and recommended actions"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"記憶體壓力、交換空間和處理建議"}}}},
