    "在设置中重新开启后，这里会恢复原生采样。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Re-enable it in Settings to resume native sampling here."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在設定中重新開啓後，這裡會恢復原生採樣。"}}}},
    "告警时间线" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alert Timeline"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"告警時間線"}}}},
