    "这是正常状态。达到你在设置中保存的阈值后，这里才会开始计时并说明变色原因。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This is normal. Once a saved threshold is reached, CleanNest starts timing the event and explains the highlight."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這是正常狀態。達到你在設定中保存的閾值後，這裡才會開始計時並說明變色原因。"}}}},
