    "显示全部 %@ 个 App" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Show All %@ Apps"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"顯示全部 %@ 個 App"}}}},
    " · %@ 个受保护" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" · %@ protected"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" · %@ 個受保護"}}}},
    "收起进程" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Collapse Processes"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"收起進程"}}}},
    "展开进程并逐个查看退出风险" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Expand processes and review each termination risk"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"展開進程並逐個查看退出風險"}}}},
    "进程没有在正常请求后退出。它可能正在保存数据、没有响应，或已被所属 App 重新启动。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The process did not exit after a normal request. It may be saving data, unresponsive, or relaunched by its app."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"進程沒有在正常請求後退出。它可能正在保存資料、沒有響應，或已被所屬 App 重新啓動。"}}}},
    "受保护进程" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Protected Process"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"受保護進程"}}}},
    "正在请求退出…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Requesting Quit…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在請求退出…"}}}},
    "容量未知" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Capacity Unknown"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"容量未知"}}}},
    "选择遇到的问题，先诊断，再决定是否修复。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose a symptom, diagnose it first, then decide whether to repair."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選擇遇到的問題，先診斷，再決定是否修復。"}}}},
    "不删除个人文件；每次只运行一项" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Does not delete personal files; runs one task at a time"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"不刪除個人檔案；每次只運行一項"}}}},
    "诊断 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Diagnose %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"診斷 %@"}}}},
    "只读检查：%@\n%@\n%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Read-only check: %@\n%@\n%@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"唯讀檢查：%@\n%@\n%@"}}}},
    "只读检查：尚未完成。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Read-only check: not yet completed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"唯讀檢查：尚未完成。"}}}},
    "\n\n提醒：基础检查没有发现明确异常。反复重启不会让 Mac 更快。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"\n\nNote: basic checks found no clear anomaly. Repeated restarts will not make your Mac faster."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"\n\n提醒：基礎檢查沒有發現明確異常。反復重啓不會讓 Mac 更快。"}}}},
    "%@%@\n\n适用于：%@\n\n会发生：%@\n\n安全边界：%@\n\n如果未恢复：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@%@\n\nUse when: %@\n\nWhat happens: %@\n\nSafety boundary: %@\n\nIf it does not recover: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@%@\n\n適用於：%@\n\n會發生：%@\n\n安全邊界：%@\n\n如果未恢復：%@"}}}},
    "无法创建 Finder 废纸篓请求。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Could not create the Finder Trash request."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"無法創建 Finder 垃圾桶請求。"}}}},
    "Finder 未能完成废纸篓操作。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Finder could not complete the Trash operation."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Finder 未能完成垃圾桶操作。"}}}},
    "选择一个 App，决定是否一并处理它能确认归属的私有文件。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose an app and decide whether to include private files whose ownership can be confirmed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選擇一個 App，決定是否一並處理它能確認歸屬的私有檔案。"}}}},
