    "扫描只读取应用名称、版本、Bundle ID 和磁盘大小，不会卸载任何内容。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Scanning only reads app names, versions, bundle IDs, and disk sizes. It does not uninstall anything."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"掃描唯讀取應用名稱、版本、Bundle ID 和磁盤大小，不會解除安裝任何內容。"}}}},
