    "CleanNest 当前检查 /Applications 和当前账户的 Applications 文件夹。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest checks /Applications and the current account’s Applications folder."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest 當前檢查 /Applications 和當前帳戶的 Applications 資料夾。"}}}},
