    "未取得完整权重或物理内存数据；是否可运行仍以实际载入结果为准。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Complete weight or physical-memory data is unavailable. Actual loading determines whether the model can run."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未取得完整權重或物理記憶體資料；是否可運行仍以實際載入結果為準。"}}}},
    "权重仍为系统、KV 缓存和其他 App 留有较明显空间" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Weights still leave substantial room for the system, KV cache, and other apps"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"權重仍為系統、KV 緩存和其他 App 留有較明顯空間"}}}},
    "可用余量有限，长上下文或同时运行多个重型 App 时应观察内存压力" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Headroom is limited; watch memory pressure with long contexts or multiple heavy apps"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"可用餘量有限，長上下文或同時運行多個重型 App 時應觀察記憶體壓力"}}}},
