    "连接电源或充电时不告警。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Does not alert while connected to power or charging."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"連接電源或充電時不告警。"}}}},
    "风扇相对负载" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Relative Fan Load"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"風扇相對負載"}}}},
    "按该机型报告的最大转速比例，不使用通用 RPM。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Uses the proportion of the model-reported maximum speed, not a generic RPM."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"按該機型報告的最大轉速比例，不使用通用 RPM。"}}}},
    "合计 en 系列物理网卡，避免把 VPN 隧道重复计数。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sums en-series physical interfaces to avoid counting VPN tunnels twice."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"合計 en 系列物理網卡，避免把 VPN 隧道重復計數。"}}}},
    "跟随 macOS 当前主路由，开启 VPN 时可能显示 utun。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Follows the current macOS primary route and may show utun when a VPN is active."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"跟隨 macOS 當前主路由，開啓 VPN 時可能顯示 utun。"}}}},
    "只计算你指定的一个活动接口。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Measures only the active interface you specify."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只計算你指定的一個活動接口。"}}}},
    "等待首个样本" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Waiting for First Sample"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"等待首個樣本"}}}},
    "本机为无风扇设计" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This Mac has a fanless design"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本機為無風扇設計"}}}},
    "当前硬件未返回有效值" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Current hardware returned no valid value"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"當前硬件未返回有效值"}}}},
    "系统设置已由你手动打开；打开成功不等于已授权。确实离开并返回 CleanNest 后只会重新测试一次。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"You opened System Settings manually; opening it does not grant access. After actually leaving and returning to CleanNest, access is retested once."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"系統設定已由你手動打開；打開成功不等於已授權。確實離開並返回 CleanNest 後只會重新測試一次。"}}}},
    "CleanNest 自身的访问测试收到权限拒绝。受保护目录的扫描与 AI 采样会先被阻止。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest’s own access test was denied. Scanning and AI sampling of protected directories will be blocked first."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest 自身的訪問測試收到權限拒絕。受保護目錄的掃描與 AI 採樣會先被阻止。"}}}},
    "本次访问测试无法得出结论。为避免连续授权弹窗，受保护目录仍默认不扫描。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This access test was inconclusive. To avoid repeated authorization prompts, protected directories remain unscanned by default."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本次訪問測試無法得出結論。為避免連續授權彈窗，受保護目錄仍默認不掃描。"}}}},
    "oMLX 调用必须使用 /v1/models 返回的短名；下方模型与程序只用于 CleanNest 自己启动 oMLX 或 MLX-LM。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"oMLX calls must use the short name returned by /v1/models. The model and executable below are only for CleanNest to launch oMLX or MLX-LM itself."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"oMLX 調用必須使用 /v1/models 返回的短名；下方模型與程式只用於 CleanNest 自己啓動 oMLX 或 MLX-LM。"}}}},
    "omlx 或 mlx_lm.server 可执行文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"omlx or mlx_lm.server executable"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"omlx 或 mlx_lm.server 可執行檔案"}}}},
    "启停与运行诊断已经归到本地模型中心" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Start, stop, and runtime diagnostics now live in Local Models"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"啓停與運行診斷已經歸到本機模型中心"}}}},
    "设置页只保存 CleanNest 要连接的回环地址、API 短名和自启程序；启动、停止、守护、端口与客户端实连请在运行中心处理。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Settings only stores the loopback address, API short name, and launch executable. Manage start, stop, supervisors, ports, and client connections in Local Models."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"設定頁只保存 CleanNest 要連接的loopback地址、API 短名和自啓程式；啓動、停止、守護、端口與客戶端實連請在運行中心處理。"}}}},
    "%@ 已连接" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ Connected"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 已連接"}}}},
    "MLX 模型" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MLX Model"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MLX 模型"}}}},
    "活动与累计成果" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activity & Cumulative Results"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"活動與累計成果"}}}},
    "活动明细" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activity Details"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"活動明細"}}}},
    "保留最近 %@ 条，可搜索、筛选、导出或单独清空。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Keeps the latest %@ records, with search, filters, export, and independent clearing."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"保留最近 %@ 條，可搜索、篩選、導出或單獨清空。"}}}},
    "已处理 %@；清空活动明细不会让这些计数归零。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Processed %@; clearing activity details does not reset these totals."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已處理 %@；清空活動明細不會讓這些計數歸零。"}}}},
    "独立保存" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stored Independently"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"獨立保存"}}}},
    "本机存储边界" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"On-Device Storage Boundaries"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本機儲存邊界"}}}},
    "活动明细、累计成果与历史指标分别保存；删除其中一种不会连带删除另外两种。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activity details, cumulative results, and metric history are stored separately. Deleting one does not delete the others."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"活動明細、累計成果與歷史指標分別保存；刪除其中一種不會連帶刪除另外兩種。"}}}},
    "只在本机" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"On This Mac Only"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只在本機"}}}},
    "选择 oMLX 或 mlx_lm.server" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose oMLX or mlx_lm.server"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選擇 oMLX 或 mlx_lm.server"}}}},
    "当前分栏" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Current Section"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"當前分欄"}}}},
    "未选中" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Not Selected"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未選中"}}}},
    "常规" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"General"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"常規"}}}},
    "菜单栏" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Menu Bar"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選單列"}}}},
    "扫描与隐私" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Scanning & Privacy"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"掃描與隱私"}}}},
    "本机 AI" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"On-Device AI"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本機 AI"}}}},
    "历史与存储" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"History & Storage"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"歷史與儲存"}}}},
    "高级" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Advanced"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"高級"}}}},
    "关于" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"About"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"關於"}}}},
    "连接可替换的本地引擎；普通使用不需要终端。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Connect a replaceable local engine; no Terminal needed for ordinary use."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"連接可替換的本機引擎；普通使用不需要終端機。"}}}},
    "控制常驻指标、排版、刷新频率、登录启动和快捷键。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Control persistent metrics, layout, refresh frequency, login launch, and shortcuts."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"控制常駐指標、排版、刷新頻率、登錄啓動和快捷鍵。"}}}},
    "明确扫描范围、完全磁盘访问实测与不可关闭的安全保护。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Defines scan scope, real Full Disk Access tests, and safety protections that cannot be disabled."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"明確掃描範圍、完全磁盤訪問實測與不可關閉的安全保護。"}}}},
    "保存回环连接和模型短名；日常启停回到本地模型运行中心。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stores loopback connection and short model name; use Local Models for everyday start and stop."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"保存loopback連接和模型短名；日常啓停回到本機模型運行中心。"}}}},
    "分别管理指标、活动明细和不会随明细清空的累计成果。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Manage metrics, activity details, and cumulative results independently."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"分別管理指標、活動明細和不會隨明細清空的累計成果。"}}}},
    "面向 AI 客户端的只读 MCP 与可审计集成边界。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Read-only MCP for AI clients with auditable integration boundaries."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"面向 AI 客戶端的唯讀 MCP 與可審計集成邊界。"}}}},
    "版本、更新、开源归属和恢复安全默认设置。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Version, updates, open-source credits, and restoring safe defaults."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"版本、更新、開源歸屬和恢復安全默認設定。"}}}},
    "演示数据，不读取本机目录。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo data; no on-device directories are read."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示資料，不讀取本機目錄。"}}}},
    "已取消；上一次完成的清单仍保留，没有处理任何文件。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cancelled. The last completed inventory remains; no files were processed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已取消；上一次完成的清單仍保留，沒有處理任何檔案。"}}}},
    "本次扫描未完成；旧结果已保留。%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This scan did not complete; previous results remain. %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本次掃描未完成；舊結果已保留。%@"}}}},
    "正在连接扫描服务" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Connecting to Scanner Service"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在連接掃描服務"}}}},
    "点“开始扫描”生成占用清单" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose “Start Scan” to build a usage inventory"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"點“開始掃描”生成佔用清單"}}}},
    "没有符合条件的项目" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No Matching Items"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"沒有符合條件的項目"}}}},
    "统计范围与口径" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Scope and Measurement"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"統計範圍與口徑"}}}},
    "占用不是可释放空间；模型与备份不能直接删。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Usage is not reclaimable space; models and backups cannot be deleted directly."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"佔用不是可釋放空間；模型與備份不能直接刪。"}}}},
    "未测量" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Not Measured"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未測量"}}}},
    "内置签名基线" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Built-in Signed Baseline"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"內置簽名基線"}}}},
    "已验证外部规则" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Verified External Rules"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已驗證外部規則"}}}},
    "外部规则已拒绝·内置回退" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"External rules rejected · Built-in fallback"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"外部規則已拒絕·內置回退"}}}},
    "所选项目不是有效的 CleanNest 规则包。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The selected item is not a valid CleanNest rule bundle."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所選項目不是有效的 CleanNest 規則包。"}}}},
    "规则包或规则文件是符号链接，已拒绝导入。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The rule bundle or rule file is a symbolic link and was not imported."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"規則包或規則檔案是符號鏈接，已拒絕導入。"}}}},
    "规则包签名无效：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Invalid rule bundle signature: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"規則包簽名無效：%@"}}}},
    "规则包与当前 CleanNest 不是同一签名者，已拒绝导入。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The rule bundle and current CleanNest have different signers, so it was not imported."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"規則包與當前 CleanNest 不是同一簽名者，已拒絕導入。"}}}},
    "规则包缺少 Contents/Resources/AgentRules.json。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The rule bundle is missing Contents/Resources/AgentRules.json."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"規則包缺少 Contents/Resources/AgentRules.json。"}}}},
    "规则文件超过 1 MB 安全上限。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The rule file exceeds the 1 MB safety limit."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"規則檔案超過 1 MB 安全上限。"}}}},
    "规则包安装失败：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Rule bundle installation failed: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"規則包安裝失敗：%@"}}}},
    "正在使用随 App 发布并经过测试的内置规则。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Using the built-in rules shipped and tested with the app."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在使用隨 App 發佈並經過測試的內置規則。"}}}},
    "外部规则签名与内容校验均已通过。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"External rule signature and content validation both passed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"外部規則簽名與內容校驗均已通過。"}}}},
    "外部规则未通过校验，已失败关闭并回退内置规则：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"External rules failed validation; the operation failed closed and reverted to built-in rules: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"外部規則未通過校驗，已失敗關閉並回退內置規則：%@"}}}},
    "规则包路径不在 CleanNest 数据目录。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The rule bundle path is outside the CleanNest data directory."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"規則包路徑不在 CleanNest 資料目錄。"}}}},
    "无法读取代码签名（%@）。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Could not read the code signature (%@)."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"無法讀取代碼簽名（%@）。"}}}},
    "系统校验状态 %@。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"System validation status: %@."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"系統校驗狀態 %@。"}}}},
    "签名证书链不可用。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The signing certificate chain is unavailable."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"簽名證書鏈不可用。"}}}},
    "原生 dry-run · 只在本机" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Native dry-run · On-device only"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"原生 dry-run · 只在本機"}}}},
    "占用 · 变化 · 活跃保护" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Usage · Changes · Active-file protection"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"佔用 · 變化 · 活躍保護"}}}},
    "Agent 工作区扫描没有完成" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agent Workspace Scan Did Not Complete"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agent 工作區掃描沒有完成"}}}},
    "重试" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Retry"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重試"}}}},
    "没有发现已验证的 Agent 数据根" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No Verified Agent Data Roots Found"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"沒有發現已驗證的 Agent 資料根"}}}},
    "CleanNest 没有猜测目录，也没有遍历你的项目文件。可以刷新聚合账本，或进入工具账本查看官方 dry-run。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest did not guess directories or traverse your project files. Refresh the aggregate ledger, or open Tool Ledger for official dry-runs."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest 沒有猜測目錄，也沒有遍歷你的項目檔案。可以刷新聚合帳本，或進入工具帳本查看官方 dry-run。"}}}},
    "活跃会话已锁定" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Active Sessions Locked"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"活躍會話已鎖定"}}}},
    "活跃文件确认不完整" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Active-file Verification Incomplete"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"活躍檔案確認不完整"}}}},
    "还没有扫描过 Agent 占用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agent Usage Has Not Been Scanned"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"還沒有掃描過 Agent 佔用"}}}},
    "首次扫描只读取文件大小、数量、时间与打开状态。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The first scan only reads file sizes, counts, timestamps, and open state."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"首次掃描唯讀取檔案大小、數量、時間與打開狀態。"}}}},
    "Agent 工具账本" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agent Tool Ledger"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agent 工具帳本"}}}},
    "%@ 工作区" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ Workspace"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 工作區"}}}},
    "概览不建文件明细" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Overview does not build file details"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"概覽不建檔案明細"}}}},
    "详情已绑定身份" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Details bound to file identities"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"詳情已綁定身份"}}}},
    "Agent 占用概览" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agent Usage Overview"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agent 佔用概覽"}}}},
    "聚合账本已验证" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aggregate Ledger Verified"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"聚合帳本已驗證"}}}},
    "部分路径不完整" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Some Paths Incomplete"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"部分路徑不完整"}}}},
    "总占用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Total Usage"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"總佔用"}}}},
    "目录分配块" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Directory Allocated Blocks"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目錄分配塊"}}}},
    "相比上次" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Since Last Scan"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"相比上次"}}}},
    "同一元数据口径" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Same metadata basis"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"同一元資料口徑"}}}},
    "活跃保护" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Active-file Protection"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"活躍保護"}}}},
    "%@ 个" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 個"}}}},
    "不会进入处置" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Excluded from processing"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"不會進入處置"}}}},
    "异常" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Anomalies"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"異常"}}}},
    "%@ 条" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 條"}}}},
    "先看高优先级" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Review high priority first"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"先看高優先級"}}}},
    "选择一个 Agent 深入查看" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose an Agent to Inspect"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選擇一個 Agent 深入查看"}}}},
    "进入后才构建该 Agent 的文件级证据" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"File-level evidence is built only after you open an Agent"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"進入後才構建該 Agent 的檔案級證據"}}}},
    "待建立基线" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Baseline Pending"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"待建立基線"}}}},
    "无变化" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No Change"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"無變化"}}}},
    "%@ 个活跃文件已锁定" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ active files locked"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 個活躍檔案已鎖定"}}}},
    "未发现活跃写入" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No Active Writes Detected"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未發現活躍寫入"}}}},
    "尚无变化基线" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No Change Baseline Yet"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"尚無變化基線"}}}},
    "相比上次无变化" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No change since last scan"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"相比上次無變化"}}}},
    "相比上次%@ %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ %@ since last scan"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"相比上次%@ %@"}}}},
    "增加" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"increase"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"增加"}}}},
    "减少" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"decrease"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"減少"}}}},
    "上次完成的聚合结果" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Last Completed Aggregate Result"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"上次完成的聚合結果"}}}},
    "历史结果" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Historical Result"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"歷史結果"}}}},
    "历史结果不完整" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Historical Result Incomplete"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"歷史結果不完整"}}}},
    "仅聚合计数" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aggregate counts only"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"僅聚合計數"}}}},
    "上次占用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Previous Usage"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"上次佔用"}}}},
    "不含文件路径" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No file paths included"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"不含檔案路徑"}}}},
    "文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Files"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"檔案"}}}},
    "活跃 %@ 个" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ active"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"活躍 %@ 個"}}}},
    "正在重新验证，不会沿用旧处置权限" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Revalidating; old processing authorization is not reused"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在重新驗證，不會沿用舊處置權限"}}}},
    "这个摘要不含路径、打开文件或处置令牌；刷新完成前只能看，不能据此清理。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This summary contains no paths, open files, or processing tokens. It is read-only until refresh completes and cannot authorize cleanup."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這個摘要不含路徑、打開檔案或處置令牌；刷新完成前只能看，不能據此清理。"}}}},
    "当前占用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Current Usage"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"當前佔用"}}}},
    "元数据完整" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Metadata Complete"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"元資料完整"}}}},
    "活跃文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Active Files"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"活躍檔案"}}}},
    "已锁定" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Locked"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已鎖定"}}}},
    "回收预览" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reclamation Preview"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"回收預覽"}}}},
    "未执行" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Not Executed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未執行"}}}},
    "异常线索" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Anomaly Clues"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"異常線索"}}}},
    "需复核" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Review Required"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"需復核"}}}},
    "异常增长与风险线索" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Abnormal Growth and Risk Clues"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"異常增長與風險線索"}}}},
    "%@ 条；不会自动处理文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@; files are never processed automatically"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 條；不會自動處理檔案"}}}},
    "本机运行关系" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"On-Device Runtime Relationships"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本機運行關係"}}}},
    "像电路追踪板一样，只点亮有系统证据的节点和连接" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Like a circuit trace, only nodes and links backed by system evidence are illuminated"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"像電路追蹤板一樣，只點亮有系統證據的節點和連接"}}}},
    "正在核对" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Verifying"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在核對"}}}},
    "%@ 个运行中" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ running"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 個運行中"}}}},
    "模型实连" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Model Connection"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"模型實連"}}}},
    "已建立 TCP" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"TCP Established"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已建立 TCP"}}}},
    "有界适配器" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bounded Adapter"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"有界適配器"}}}},
    "未验证不猜测" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No guesses without verification"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未驗證不猜測"}}}},
    "只接受与当前 CleanNest 同一签名者签署、且通过严格路径校验的规则包" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Only accepts rule bundles signed by the same signer as this CleanNest and passing strict path validation"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只接受與當前 CleanNest 同一簽名者簽署、且通過嚴格路徑校驗的規則包"}}}},
    "选择由 CleanNest 维护者签名的 Agent 规则包" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose an Agent rule bundle signed by a CleanNest maintainer"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選擇由 CleanNest 維護者簽名的 Agent 規則包"}}}},
    "验证并导入" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Validate and Import"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"驗證並導入"}}}},
    "会话、缓存与运行时" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sessions, Caches & Runtime"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"會話、緩存與運行時"}}}},
    "按真实用途分组，不把整个 Agent 目录当作垃圾" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Grouped by actual purpose; an entire Agent directory is never treated as junk"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"按真實用途分組，不把整個 Agent 目錄當作垃圾"}}}},
    "安全处置与恢复" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Safe Processing & Recovery"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"安全處置與恢復"}}}},
    "可执行候选" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Actionable Candidates"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"可執行候選"}}}},
    "%@ 个静置普通文件；逐文件身份已绑定。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ idle regular files; each file identity is bound."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 個靜置普通檔案；逐檔案身份已綁定。"}}}},
    "会话归档建议" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Session Archive Suggestions"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"會話歸檔建議"}}}},
    "这不是已选垃圾。点开查看由哪些旧会话、备份和生成资源组成。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"These are not selected junk. Open to review the old sessions, backups, and generated resources involved."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這不是已選垃圾。點開查看由哪些舊會話、備份和生成資源組成。"}}}},
    "查看详情" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"View Details"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"查看詳情"}}}},
    "选择全部可执行项" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Select All Actionable Items"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選擇全部可執行項"}}}},
    "当前没有满足类别静置门槛（缓存与安装残留 15 分钟，备份、已归档会话与虚拟机 30 天，活跃会话 60 天）、未被打开且扫描完整的可执行候选。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No actionable candidates currently meet category idle thresholds (15 minutes for caches and installer remnants; 30 days for backups, archived sessions, and VMs; 60 days for active sessions), are not open, and have complete scans."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"當前沒有滿足類別靜置門檻（緩存與安裝殘留 15 分鐘，備份、已歸檔會話與虛擬機 30 天，活躍會話 60 天）、未被打開且掃描完整的可執行候選。"}}}},
    "安全处置需要注意" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Safe Processing Needs Attention"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"安全處置需要注意"}}}},
    "安全处置已更新" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Safe Processing Updated"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"安全處置已更新"}}}},
    "压缩包和含原路径的恢复清单只保存在本机 Application Support；CleanNest 不会结束 Agent、清空废纸篓或直接改写会话索引。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The archive and recovery manifest with original paths stay only in on-device Application Support. CleanNest does not quit Agents, empty Trash, or directly rewrite session indexes."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"壓縮包和含原路徑的恢復清單只保存在本機 Application Support；CleanNest 不會結束 Agent、清空垃圾桶或直接改寫會話索引。"}}}},
    "开发工具原生接口" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Native Developer Tool Interfaces"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"開發工具原生接口"}}}},
    "原生工具操作未完成" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Native Tool Operation Incomplete"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"原生工具操作未完成"}}}},
    "原生工具账本已更新" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Native Tool Ledger Updated"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"原生工具帳本已更新"}}}},
    "Git worktree prune 与 hf cache prune 只有在官方 dry-run 重新通过后才开放；Docker system prune、npm clean 与 pip purge 当前不会执行。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Git worktree prune and hf cache prune are enabled only after a fresh official dry-run passes. Docker system prune, npm clean, and pip purge are not currently executed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Git worktree prune 與 hf cache prune 只有在官方 dry-run 重新通過後才開放；Docker system prune、npm clean 與 pip purge 當前不會執行。"}}}},
    "选择要检查 worktree 的 Git 仓库" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose a Git repository whose worktrees should be checked"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選擇要檢查 worktree 的 Git 倉庫"}}}},
    "选择仓库" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose Repository"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選擇倉庫"}}}},
    "%@ 建立首个基线；之后才能比较增长" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ established the first baseline; growth comparisons require another sample"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 建立首個基線；之後才能比較增長"}}}},
    "%@ 采样 · 上次基线 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ sampled · Previous baseline %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 採樣 · 上次基線 %@"}}}},
    "只读建议" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Read-Only Suggestions"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"唯讀建議"}}}},
    "这些不是“已选垃圾”" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"These Are Not “Selected Junk”"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這些不是“已選垃圾”"}}}},
    "CleanNest 只是根据时间找到旧会话、备份和生成资源。它们可能仍然是你的工作记录，所以当前不会自动移动或删除。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest only identifies old sessions, backups, and generated resources by time. They may still be work records, so they are not moved or deleted automatically."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest 只是根據時間找到舊會話、備份和生成資源。它們可能仍然是你的工作記錄，所以當前不會自動移動或刪除。"}}}},
    "暂时没有归档建议" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No Archive Suggestions Right Now"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"暫時沒有歸檔建議"}}}},
    "重新扫描后，只有时间较旧且允许只读复核的会话类数据会显示在这里。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"After rescanning, only older session data eligible for read-only review appears here."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重新掃描後，只有時間較舊且允許唯讀復核的會話類資料會顯示在這裡。"}}}},
    "在用·先别动" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"In use · Leave alone"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在用·先別動"}}}},
    "看一眼再定" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Review before deciding"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"看一眼再定"}}}},
    "收起文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Collapse Files"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"收起檔案"}}}},
    "展开文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Expand Files"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"展開檔案"}}}},
    "清除" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clear"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"清除"}}}},
    "选择" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Select"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選擇"}}}},
    "未命名文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Unnamed File"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未命名檔案"}}}},
    "APFS 尚未完成对比" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"APFS Comparison Not Complete"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"APFS 尚未完成對比"}}}},
    "APFS 无可确认变化" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No Confirmed APFS Change"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"APFS 無可確認變化"}}}},
    "恢复包包含所选文件的真实内容" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The recovery archive contains the actual contents of selected files"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"恢復包包含所選檔案的真實內容"}}}},
    "它只保存在这台 Mac 的 CleanNest Application Support，不上传；恢复清单还会保存原路径。恢复时若原位置已有新文件，会拒绝覆盖。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"It stays only in CleanNest Application Support on this Mac and is not uploaded. The manifest retains original paths. Restore refuses to overwrite a newer file at an original location."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"它只保存在這台 Mac 的 CleanNest Application Support，不上傳；恢復清單還會保存原路徑。恢復時若原位置已有新檔案，會拒絕覆蓋。"}}}},
    "收起" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Collapse"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"收起"}}}},
    "展开" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Expand"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"展開"}}}},
    "再次读取打开文件表并核对设备号、文件号、大小与修改时间。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reads the open-file table again and verifies device ID, file ID, size, and modification time."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"再次讀取打開檔案表並核對設備號、檔案號、大小與修改時間。"}}}},
    "在本机恢复区创建 ZIP，并用 CRC 完整性检查确认备份可读。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Creates a ZIP in the on-device recovery area and verifies readability with CRC integrity checks."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在本機恢復區創建 ZIP，並用 CRC 完整性檢查確認備份可讀。"}}}},
    "只有备份通过后才处理所选文件；生成内容、索引、记忆与凭据不动。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Selected files are processed only after backup verification. Generated content, indexes, memory, and credentials remain untouched."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只有備份通過後才處理所選檔案；生成內容、索引、記憶與憑據不動。"}}}},
    "完成后对比 APFS 可用空间；结果可能小于候选体积，甚至因压缩率低而不增加。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Compares APFS free space afterward. The gain may be smaller than the candidate size and may even be negative because the recovery ZIP consumes space."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"完成後對比 APFS 可用空間；結果可能小於候選體積，甚至因壓縮率低而不增加。"}}}},
    "等任务结束再处理" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wait for the task to finish before processing"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"等任務結束再處理"}}}},
    "创建备份并处理" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Create Backup and Process"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"創建備份並處理"}}}},
    "仍要创建备份并处理" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Create Backup and Process Anyway"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仍要創建備份並處理"}}}},
    "候选分配块是 %@，但恢复 ZIP 也占空间，所以实际腾出的空间会更少，并以完成后的 APFS 实测为准。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Candidates occupy %@ in allocated blocks, but the recovery ZIP also uses space. Actual gains will be smaller and are measured with APFS after completion."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"候選分配塊是 %@，但恢復 ZIP 也佔空間，所以實際騰出的空間會更少，並以完成後的 APFS 實測為準。"}}}},
    "%@ 现在仍在运行。最稳妥的做法是先完成当前任务并退出；若继续，CleanNest 仍会复核打开文件和身份，发生变化就停止。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ is still running. The safest option is to finish current work and quit. If you continue, CleanNest still rechecks open files and identities and stops on any change."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 現在仍在運行。最穩妥的做法是先完成當前任務並退出；若繼續，CleanNest 仍會復核打開檔案和身份，發生變化就停止。"}}}},
    "执行前会重新 dry-run" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Runs a fresh dry-run before execution"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行前會重新 dry-run"}}}},
    "CleanNest 不会直接复用这张旧预览；范围或工具状态变化时会停止。完成后记录 APFS 前后可用空间。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest never reuses an old preview directly; it stops if scope or tool state changes. APFS free space is recorded before and after."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest 不會直接復用這張舊預覽；範圍或工具狀態變化時會停止。完成後記錄 APFS 前後可用空間。"}}}},
    "%@ 活跃已保护" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ active files protected"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 活躍已保護"}}}},
    "无活跃写入" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No Active Writes"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"無活躍寫入"}}}},
    "%@ 条线索" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ clues"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 條線索"}}}},
    "无异常" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No Anomalies"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"無異常"}}}},
    "待建立变化基线" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Change Baseline Pending"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"待建立變化基線"}}}},
    "%@ 个活跃文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ active files"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 個活躍檔案"}}}},
    "可清理 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ cleanable"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"可清理 %@"}}}},
    "暂无可清理项" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No cleanable items"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"暫無可清理項"}}}},
    "技术口径：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Technical basis: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"技術口徑：%@"}}}},
    "路径未知" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Path Unknown"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"路徑未知"}}}},
    "  +%@ 个路径" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"  +%@ paths"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"  +%@ 個路徑"}}}},
    "先看空间" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Space Overview"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"先看空間"}}}},
    "处理建议" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Action Suggestions"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"處理建議"}}}},
    "核对详情" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Verify Details"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"核對詳情"}}}},
    "已阻止连续授权弹窗" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Repeated Authorization Prompts Blocked"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已阻止連續授權彈窗"}}}},
    "正在检测受保护目录访问" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Testing Protected Directory Access"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在檢測受保護目錄訪問"}}}},
    "受保护目录暂不扫描" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Protected directories are not scanned"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"受保護目錄暫不掃描"}}}},
    "默认分析启动卷 %@。如果只想快速查看个人文件，可切换到主目录；也可选择项目文件夹或外接磁盘。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Analyzes startup volume %@ by default. Switch to your home folder for a quick personal-file review, or choose a project folder or external disk."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"默認分析啓動卷 %@。如果只想快速查看個人檔案，可切換到主目錄；也可選擇項目資料夾或外接磁盤。"}}}},
    "分析 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Analyze %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"分析 %@"}}}},
    "分析完成后才能给出处理建议" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Action suggestions require a completed analysis"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"分析完成後才能給出處理建議"}}}},
    "当前仍在汇总文件用途与安全边界。你可以先在“先看空间”查看已出现的目录；不会根据部分结果推荐处理。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"File purposes and safety boundaries are still being summarized. You can review directories already shown in Space Overview; partial results never produce action suggestions."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"當前仍在匯總檔案用途與安全邊界。你可以先在“先看空間”查看已出現的目錄；不會根據部分結果推薦處理。"}}}},
    "这里负责解释和决策，不会从任意文件夹直接删除内容。请先在 Finder 中确认，或使用“清理空间”里的安全范围。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This view explains evidence and decisions; it does not delete from arbitrary folders. Confirm in Finder or use the safe scope under Cleanup."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這裡負責解釋和決策，不會從任意資料夾直接刪除內容。請先在 Finder 中確認，或使用“清理空間”里的安全範圍。"}}}},
    "按视角找大目录，点一行继续查看。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Find large directories by perspective and select a row to drill down."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"按視角找大目錄，點一行繼續查看。"}}}},
    "手动决定保留、稍后或待复核。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Manually decide whether to keep, defer, or review."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"手動決定保留、稍後或待復核。"}}}},
    "核对账本、变化和空间结构。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Verify ledgers, changes, and space composition."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"核對帳本、變化和空間結構。"}}}},
    "复用 %@ 项" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ reused"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"復用 %@ 項"}}}},
    "实扫 %@ 项" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ scanned"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"實掃 %@ 項"}}}},
    "完整度待核验" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Completeness needs verification"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"完整度待核驗"}}}},
    "%@ 个目录触顶 · %@ 项不可读" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ directories reached limits · %@ unreadable items"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 個目錄觸頂 · %@ 項不可讀"}}}},
    "%@ 个目录触顶" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ directories reached limits"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 個目錄觸頂"}}}},
    "%@ 项不可读" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ unreadable items"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 項不可讀"}}}},
    "遍历 %@ 项" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ entries traversed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"遍歷 %@ 項"}}}},
    "另实扫 %@ 项" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ additional items scanned"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"另實掃 %@ 項"}}}},
    "未使用缓存" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cache Not Used"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未使用緩存"}}}},
    "%@ 秒 · %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ sec · %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 秒 · %@"}}}},
    "已归类文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Classified Files"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已歸類檔案"}}}},
    "已发现文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Files Discovered"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已發現檔案"}}}},
    "来自文件遍历，不是 APFS 已用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"From file traversal, not APFS usage"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"來自檔案遍歷，不是 APFS 已用"}}}},
    "扫描进行中，数值仍会变化" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Scan in progress; values may still change"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"掃描進行中，數值仍會變化"}}}},
    "实时部分结果" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Live Partial Results"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"即時部分結果"}}}},
    "扫描完整度" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Scan Completeness"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"掃描完整度"}}}},
    "APFS 实际已用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Actual APFS Used"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"APFS 實際已用"}}}},
    "卷总容量 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Total volume capacity %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"卷總容量 %@"}}}},
    "APFS 实际可用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Actual APFS Available"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"APFS 實際可用"}}}},
    "由 macOS 卷总账直接读取" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Read directly from the macOS volume ledger"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"由 macOS 卷總賬直接讀取"}}}},
    "切换到整个启动卷" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Switch to Entire Startup Volume"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"切換到整個啓動卷"}}}},
    "正在汇总文件类型、时间与来源…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Summarizing file types, timestamps, and origins…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在匯總檔案類型、時間與來源…"}}}},
    "正在检查 %@ · %@/%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Checking %@ · %@/%@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在檢查 %@ · %@/%@"}}}},
    "正在等待分析引擎返回…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Waiting for the analysis engine…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在等待分析引擎返回…"}}}},
    "正在分析 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Analyzing %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在分析 %@"}}}},
    " · %@/%@ · 复用 %@ · 实扫 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" · %@/%@ · %@ reused · %@ scanned"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" · %@/%@ · 復用 %@ · 實掃 %@"}}}},
    "磁盘总账与文件归类" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Disk Ledger and File Classification"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"磁盤總賬與檔案歸類"}}}},
    "APFS 已用 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"APFS used %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"APFS 已用 %@"}}}},
    "文件已归类 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Files classified %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"檔案已歸類 %@"}}}},
    "还有 %@ 未被文件遍历解释" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ is not explained by file traversal"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"還有 %@ 未被檔案遍歷解釋"}}}},
    "这不是“可清理空间”。它可能包含 APFS 快照、Preboot/Recovery/VM 等同容器卷、受保护目录、触及条目上限的目录、系统保留，以及克隆或硬链接造成的账本差异。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This is not “cleanable space.” It may include APFS snapshots, sibling volumes such as Preboot/Recovery/VM, protected directories, directories that reached entry limits, system reserves, and ledger differences from clones or hard links."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這不是“可清理空間”。它可能包含 APFS 快照、Preboot/Recovery/VM 等同容器卷、受保護目錄、觸及條目上限的目錄、系統保留，以及克隆或硬鏈接造成的帳本差異。"}}}},
    "文件分配块合计比 APFS 物理已用多 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"File allocated-block total exceeds physical APFS usage by %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"檔案分配塊合計比 APFS 物理已用多 %@"}}}},
    "APFS 克隆、硬链接或 firmlink 可能让多个路径引用同一批物理块。文件求和不能替代卷总账。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"APFS clones, hard links, or firmlinks can make multiple paths reference the same physical blocks. File sums cannot replace the volume ledger."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"APFS 克隆、硬鏈接或 firmlink 可能讓多個路徑引用同一批物理塊。檔案求和不能替代卷總賬。"}}}},
    "当前只分析所选文件夹" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Only the Selected Folder Is Analyzed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"當前只分析所選資料夾"}}}},
    "%@ 不是卷根目录，因此只显示这里已归类的文件；不会拿它与整块磁盘已用空间制造虚假的“缺口”。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ is not a volume root, so only files classified here are shown. It is never compared with whole-disk usage to imply a false “gap.”"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 不是卷根目錄，因此只顯示這裡已歸類的檔案；不會拿它與整塊磁盤已用空間製造虛假的“缺口”。"}}}},
    "完整度未知" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Completeness Unknown"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"完整度未知"}}}},
    "文件夹归类与整卷空间是两套数字" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Folder classification and whole-volume space are different measurements"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"資料夾歸類與整卷空間是兩套數字"}}}},
    "%@ 已归类；不是磁盘总占用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ classified; not total disk usage"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 已歸類；不是磁盤總佔用"}}}},
    "文件路径求和与 APFS 物理账本存在重叠" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"File-path sums overlap with the APFS physical ledger"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"檔案路徑求和與 APFS 物理帳本存在重疊"}}}},
    "CleanNest 目前只有文件遍历结果，无法读取这个位置所在卷的容量总账。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest currently has file traversal results but cannot read the capacity ledger for this location’s volume."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest 目前只有檔案遍歷結果，無法讀取這個位置所在卷的容量總賬。"}}}},
    "macOS 报告 %@ 实际已用 %@、实际可用 %@；CleanNest 另行解释能遍历到的文件。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS reports that %@ actually uses %@ and has %@ available; CleanNest separately explains the files it can traverse."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS 報告 %@ 實際已用 %@、實際可用 %@；CleanNest 另行解釋能遍歷到的檔案。"}}}},
    "所在卷实际已用 %@、可用 %@；当前所选文件夹只占其中一部分。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The containing volume actually uses %@ and has %@ available; the selected folder accounts for only part of it."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所在卷實際已用 %@、可用 %@；當前所選資料夾只佔其中一部分。"}}}},
    "文件 %@ 个" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ files"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"檔案 %@ 個"}}}},
    "隐藏顶层 %@ 项" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ hidden top-level entries"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"隱藏頂層 %@ 項"}}}},
    "跳过 %@ 个其他卷入口" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Skipped %@ other-volume entry points"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"跳過 %@ 個其他捲入口"}}}},
    "与上次完整扫描相比" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Compared with Last Complete Scan"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"與上次完整掃描相比"}}}},
    "本次不生成增长结论" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No Growth Conclusion from This Scan"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本次不生成增長結論"}}}},
    "本次扫描触及条目上限、存在不可读项目或复用了完整度未知的旧索引。CleanNest 保留上次可靠基线，不用不完整数字制造“突然增长”。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This scan reached entry limits, encountered unreadable items, or reused an old index of unknown completeness. CleanNest retains the last reliable baseline rather than implying sudden growth from incomplete numbers."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本次掃描觸及條目上限、存在不可讀項目或復用了完整度未知的舊索引。CleanNest 保留上次可靠基線，不用不完整數字製造“突然增長”。"}}}},
    "不完整扫描不入账" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Incomplete Scans Do Not Update the Baseline"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"不完整掃描不入賬"}}}},
    "这次先建立可靠基线" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Establish a Reliable Baseline First"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這次先建立可靠基線"}}}},
    "完成下一次同一根目录的可靠扫描后，这里会显示新出现、增长、缩小和消失的目录。只保留最近两次本机聚合快照，不保存文件内容。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"After the next reliable scan of the same root, new, growing, shrinking, and disappeared directories appear here. Only the latest two on-device aggregate snapshots are retained; file contents are not stored."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"完成下一次同一根目錄的可靠掃描後，這裡會顯示新出現、增長、縮小和消失的目錄。只保留最近兩次本機聚合快照，不保存檔案內容。"}}}},
    "已归类文件净增加 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Classified files increased by %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已歸類檔案淨增加 %@"}}}},
    "已归类文件净减少 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Classified files decreased by %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已歸類檔案淨減少 %@"}}}},
    "已归类文件总量没有变化" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Total classified file size is unchanged"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已歸類檔案總量沒有變化"}}}},
    "增长" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Growth"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"增長"}}}},
    "缩小" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Shrinkage"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"縮小"}}}},
    "新出现" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"New"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"新出現"}}}},
    "已消失" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Disappeared"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已消失"}}}},
    "与上次扫描相比" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Compared with Last Scan"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"與上次掃描相比"}}}},
    "仅在同一目录、两次可靠扫描之间比较" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Compares only two reliable scans of the same directory"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"僅在同一目錄、兩次可靠掃描之間比較"}}}},
    "空间结构图" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Space Composition Map"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"空間結構圖"}}}},
    "用面积比较当前层级的相对占用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Uses area to compare relative usage at the current level"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"用面積比較當前層級的相對佔用"}}}},
    "本机模型解读" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"On-Device Model Interpretation"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本機模型解讀"}}}},
    "只在已配置并完成分析后显示；不上传文件内容" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Shown only after configuration and completed analysis; file contents are not uploaded"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只在已配置並完成分析後顯示；不上傳檔案內容"}}}},
    "核对详情会等这次分析完成" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Verify Details waits for this analysis to finish"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"核對詳情會等這次分析完成"}}}},
    "账本差额、增长比较和结构图都需要完整扫描，避免把仍在变化的部分结果当成结论。你可以继续在“先看空间”查看已出现的目录，或取消并保留上一次完整结果。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ledger differences, growth comparisons, and the composition map require a complete scan so changing partial results are not treated as conclusions. Continue reviewing directories in Space Overview, or cancel and keep the last complete result."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"帳本差額、增長比較和結構圖都需要完整掃描，避免把仍在變化的部分結果當成結論。你可以繼續在“先看空間”查看已出現的目錄，或取消並保留上一次完整結果。"}}}},
    "可恢复性" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Recoverability"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"可恢復性"}}}},
    "查看本机证据（%@）" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"View on-device evidence (%@)"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"查看本機證據（%@）"}}}},
    "不读取文件内容，不会勾选或删除项目。高风险目录只能解释用途，并引导你进入下一层或在所属 App 内管理。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Does not read file contents or select or delete items. High-risk directories are only explained, with guidance to drill down or manage them in the owning app."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"不讀取檔案內容，不會勾選或刪除項目。高風險目錄只能解釋用途，並引導你進入下一層或在所屬 App 內管理。"}}}},
    "AI 深度分析" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"AI Deep Analysis"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"AI 深度分析"}}}},
    "重新深度分析" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Run Deep Analysis Again"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重新深度分析"}}}},
    "AI 解读没有完成" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"AI Interpretation Did Not Complete"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"AI 解讀沒有完成"}}}},
    "解读 %@ 项" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Interpreted %@ items"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"解讀 %@ 項"}}}},
    "深入 %@ 个目录" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sampled %@ directories deeply"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"深入 %@ 個目錄"}}}},
    "注意事项（%@）" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cautions (%@)"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"注意事項（%@）"}}}},
    "本次扫描 %@ 项" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ items in this scan"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本次掃描 %@ 項"}}}},
    "本次扫描 %@ 组" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ groups in this scan"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本次掃描 %@ 組"}}}},
    "已计入 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ accounted for"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已計入 %@"}}}},
    "含部分/未知结果" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Includes partial or unknown results"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"含部分/未知結果"}}}},
    "同一份扫描结果按目录、所属软件或功能用途重新排列" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reorganizes the same scan by directory, owning software, or functional purpose"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"同一份掃描結果按目錄、所屬軟件或功能用途重新排列"}}}},
    "目录 / 证据" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Directory / Evidence"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目錄 / 證據"}}}},
    "分组 / 构成" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Group / Composition"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"分組 / 構成"}}}},
    "目录视角保留文件系统原貌；点击箭头进入下一层。数值来自本次扫描，部分结果会单独标明。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Directory view preserves the filesystem structure; click an arrow to drill down. Values come from this scan, and partial results are labeled separately."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目錄視角保留檔案系統原貌；點擊箭頭進入下一層。數值來自本次掃描，部分結果會單獨標明。"}}}},
    "软件视角只合并路径能确认归属的项目；无法确认的内容不会猜测 App 名称。展开分组可查看实际路径。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Software view only merges items whose paths confirm ownership; it never guesses app names. Expand a group to see actual paths."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"軟件視角只合併路徑能確認歸屬的項目；無法確認的內容不會猜測 App 名稱。展開分組可查看實際路徑。"}}}},
    "功能视角按本机规则区分个人内容、App 数据、本地模型、虚拟机、Agent/开发产物等；这是用途解释，不是清理许可。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Function view uses on-device rules to distinguish personal content, app data, local models, VMs, Agent/developer artifacts, and more. It explains purpose, not permission to clean."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"功能視角按本機規則區分個人內容、App 資料、本機模型、虛擬機、Agent/開發產物等；這是用途解釋，不是清理許可。"}}}},
