    "CleanNest 启动的模型进程已退出（状态 %@）" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The model process launched by CleanNest exited (status %@)"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest 啓動的模型進程已退出（狀態 %@）"}}}},
    "未选择模型" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No Model Selected"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未選擇模型"}}}},
