    "尚未检查本地模型" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Local models have not been checked"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"尚未檢查本機模型"}}}},
    "所选模型服务程序不存在或不可执行。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The selected model server does not exist or is not executable."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所選模型服務程式不存在或不可執行。"}}}},
    "正在按 %@ 个有界适配器统计文件元数据和活跃写入…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Collecting file metadata and active writes through %@ bounded adapters…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在按 %@ 個有界適配器統計檔案元資料和活躍寫入…"}}}},
    "%@ 耗时 %@ 秒。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ took %@ seconds."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 耗時 %@ 秒。"}}}},
    "Agent 工作区扫描已取消；没有发布不完整结果。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agent workspace scan cancelled; no incomplete results were published."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agent 工作區掃描已取消；沒有發佈不完整結果。"}}}},
    "Agent 工作区扫描已取消；上次聚合结果仍保留，文件级明细需要重新验证。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agent workspace scan cancelled. The last aggregate result remains; file-level details require revalidation."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agent 工作區掃描已取消；上次聚合結果仍保留，檔案級明細需要重新驗證。"}}}},
    "Agent 工作区扫描没有完成：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agent workspace scan did not complete: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agent 工作區掃描沒有完成：%@"}}}},
    "正在重新验证 %@ 的类别、活跃文件和可恢复候选…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Revalidating categories, active files, and recoverable candidates for %@…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在重新驗證 %@ 的類別、活躍檔案和可恢復候選…"}}}},
    "%@ 详情扫描已取消；没有发布不完整结果。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ detail scan cancelled; no incomplete results were published."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 詳情掃描已取消；沒有發佈不完整結果。"}}}},
    "%@ 详情扫描没有完成：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ detail scan did not complete: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 詳情掃描沒有完成：%@"}}}},
    "规则 %@ 的代码签名、签名者和内容边界均已通过校验。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Rule %@ passed code-signature, signer, and content-boundary validation."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"規則 %@ 的代碼簽名、簽名者和內容邊界均已通過校驗。"}}}},
    "规则没有导入：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Rules were not imported: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"規則沒有導入：%@"}}}},
    "已恢复随 App 发布并经过测试的内置规则。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Restored the built-in rules shipped and tested with the app."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已恢復隨 App 發佈並經過測試的內置規則。"}}}},
    "未能恢复内置规则：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Could not restore built-in rules: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未能恢復內置規則：%@"}}}},
    "本次扫描或活跃文件确认不完整，不能执行安全处置。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This scan or active-file verification is incomplete, so safe processing cannot run."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本次掃描或活躍檔案確認不完整，不能執行安全處置。"}}}},
    "请先选择至少一个满足静置门槛的可处置文件。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Select at least one processable file that meets the idle threshold first."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"請先選擇至少一個滿足靜置門檻的可處置檔案。"}}}},
    "正在创建并校验本机压缩备份；完成前不会移动原文件。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Creating and verifying an on-device compressed backup; original files will not move until it completes."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在創建並校驗本機壓縮備份；完成前不會移動原檔案。"}}}},
    "APFS 可用空间实测增加 %@。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Measured APFS free space increased by %@."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"APFS 可用空間實測增加 %@。"}}}},
    "APFS 可用空间实测减少 %@；压缩备份当前大于释放收益。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Measured APFS free space decreased by %@; the compressed backup currently outweighs the space saved."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"APFS 可用空間實測減少 %@；壓縮備份當前大於釋放收益。"}}}},
    "APFS 可用空间实测没有可确认变化。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No confirmed change in measured APFS free space."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"APFS 可用空間實測沒有可確認變化。"}}}},
    "已处理 %@ 个文件，Agent 目录减少 %@；%@ 可随时从本页恢复。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Processed %@ files and reduced the Agent directory by %@. %@ You can restore from this page at any time."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已處理 %@ 個檔案，Agent 目錄減少 %@；%@ 可隨時從本頁恢復。"}}}},
    "Agent 安全处置" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agent Safe Processing"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agent 安全處置"}}}},
    "压缩备份已校验并保存在本机恢复区；%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The compressed backup was verified and stored in the on-device recovery area; %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"壓縮備份已校驗並保存在本機恢復區；%@"}}}},
    "没有完成：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Not completed: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"沒有完成：%@"}}}},
    "正在核对原位置；如果 Agent 已新建同名文件，恢复会停止而不会覆盖。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Verifying original locations. If an Agent created a new file with the same name, restore stops instead of overwriting it."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在核對原位置；如果 Agent 已新建同名檔案，恢復會停止而不會覆蓋。"}}}},
    "已恢复 %@ 个文件；压缩备份仍保留在本机恢复区。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Restored %@ files; the compressed backup remains in the on-device recovery area."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已恢復 %@ 個檔案；壓縮備份仍保留在本機恢復區。"}}}},
    "恢复 Agent 文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Restore Agent Files"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"恢復 Agent 檔案"}}}},
    "已从校验过的本机备份恢复；未覆盖 Agent 后来生成的文件。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Restored from a verified on-device backup without overwriting files later created by the Agent."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已從校驗過的本機備份恢復；未覆蓋 Agent 後來生成的檔案。"}}}},
    "Agent 恢复记录无法读取：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Could not read the Agent recovery record: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agent 恢復記錄無法讀取：%@"}}}},
    "正在重新生成原生 dry-run，执行范围不会沿用过期预览。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Generating a fresh native dry-run; execution will not reuse a stale preview scope."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在重新生成原生 dry-run，執行範圍不會沿用過期預覽。"}}}},
    "原生预演已变化或不再可用，没有执行清理。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The native preview changed or is no longer available, so cleanup was not executed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"原生預演已變化或不再可用，沒有執行清理。"}}}},
    "Git 仓库范围已经丢失，没有执行 prune。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The Git repository scope was lost; prune was not executed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Git 倉庫範圍已經丟失，沒有執行 prune。"}}}},
    "%@ 原生清理已完成；APFS 可用空间实测增加 %@。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ native cleanup completed; measured APFS free space increased by %@."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 原生清理已完成；APFS 可用空間實測增加 %@。"}}}},
    "%@ 原生清理" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ Native Cleanup"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 原生清理"}}}},
    "执行前重新通过官方 dry-run；APFS 前后实测增加 %@。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A fresh official dry-run passed before execution; measured APFS free space increased by %@."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行前重新通過官方 dry-run；APFS 前後實測增加 %@。"}}}},
    "%@ 没有完成：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ did not complete: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 沒有完成：%@"}}}},
    "演示模式：1 个合成模型，不读取本机模型目录。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo mode: one synthetic model; no on-device model directories are read."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示模式：1 個合成模型，不讀取本機模型目錄。"}}}},
    "正在扫描常用模型目录…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Scanning common model directories…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在掃描常用模型目錄…"}}}},
    "未发现完整模型，可手动选择包含 config.json 与 safetensors 的目录。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No complete model found. Manually choose a directory containing config.json and safetensors."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未發現完整模型，可手動選擇包含 config.json 與 safetensors 的目錄。"}}}},
    "发现 %@ 个可用的 MLX 模型。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Found %@ usable MLX models."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"發現 %@ 個可用的 MLX 模型。"}}}},
    "正在交叉检查进程、监听端口与平台 API…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cross-checking processes, listening ports, and platform APIs…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在交叉檢查進程、監聽端口與平台 API…"}}}},
    "%@ 已有健康的 %@；无需重复启动。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ already has a healthy %@; another launch is unnecessary."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 已有健康的 %@；無需重復啓動。"}}}},
    "配置端口" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"configured port"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"配置端口"}}}},
    "%@ 已被 %@ 占用，模型 API 尚未确认。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ is already occupied by %@; the model API has not been confirmed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 已被 %@ 佔用，模型 API 尚未確認。"}}}},
    "其他进程" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"another process"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"其他進程"}}}},
    "另一项模型操作仍在进行。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Another model operation is still in progress."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"另一項模型操作仍在進行。"}}}},
    "这不是 CleanNest 启动的进程；请使用带风险确认的外部服务关闭流程。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest did not launch this process; use the external-service shutdown flow with risk confirmation."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這不是 CleanNest 啓動的進程；請使用帶風險確認的外部服務關閉流程。"}}}},
    "演示模式不会结束任何外部进程。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo mode never terminates external processes."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示模式不會結束任何外部進程。"}}}},
    "外部模型服务没有可验证的进程身份。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The external model service has no verifiable process identity."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"外部模型服務沒有可驗證的進程身份。"}}}},
    "正在重新核对进程身份，准备强制结束…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Revalidating process identity before forcing termination…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在重新核對進程身份，準備強制結束…"}}}},
    "正在重新核对进程身份，准备正常关闭…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Revalidating process identity before a normal shutdown…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在重新核對進程身份，準備正常關閉…"}}}},
    "原服务已退出或身份已改变；CleanNest 没有向新进程发送信号。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The original service exited or its identity changed; CleanNest did not signal the new process."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"原服務已退出或身份已改變；CleanNest 沒有向新進程發送信號。"}}}},
    "关闭外部模型服务" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Shut Down External Model Service"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"關閉外部模型服務"}}}},
    "%@ · PID %@ · 身份已变化" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · PID %@ · Identity changed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · PID %@ · 身份已變化"}}}},
    "身份复核未通过：%@ CleanNest 没有发送信号。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Identity revalidation failed: %@ CleanNest did not send a signal."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"身份復核未通過：%@ CleanNest 沒有發送信號。"}}}},
    "%@ · PID %@ · 身份复核失败" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · PID %@ · Identity revalidation failed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · PID %@ · 身份復核失敗"}}}},
    "原服务已退出，无需再次关闭。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The original service has already exited; no further shutdown is needed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"原服務已退出，無需再次關閉。"}}}},
    "系统身份复核未通过：%@ CleanNest 没有发送信号。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"System identity revalidation failed: %@ CleanNest did not send a signal."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"系統身份復核未通過：%@ CleanNest 沒有發送信號。"}}}},
    "%@ · PID %@ · 系统身份复核失败" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · PID %@ · System identity revalidation failed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · PID %@ · 系統身份復核失敗"}}}},
    "强制结束外部模型服务" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Force Terminate External Model Service"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"強制結束外部模型服務"}}}},
    "%@ · PID %@ 已被强制结束。模型文件和平台设置没有删除。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · PID %@ was force-terminated. Model files and platform settings were not deleted."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · PID %@ 已被強制結束。模型檔案和平台設定沒有刪除。"}}}},
    "%@ · PID %@ 已正常退出。模型文件和平台设置没有删除。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · PID %@ exited normally. Model files and platform settings were not deleted."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · PID %@ 已正常退出。模型檔案和平台設定沒有刪除。"}}}},
    "外部模型服务已关闭" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"External Model Service Shut Down"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"外部模型服務已關閉"}}}},
    "%@ · PID %@ 仍在运行。它可能已被所属平台自动重启。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · PID %@ is still running. Its platform may have restarted it automatically."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · PID %@ 仍在運行。它可能已被所屬平台自動重啓。"}}}},
    "%@ · PID %@ 没有在 3 秒内退出。它可能正在保存状态；如确有需要，可再次确认后强制结束。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · PID %@ did not exit within 3 seconds. It may be saving state; if necessary, confirm again before forcing termination."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · PID %@ 沒有在 3 秒內退出。它可能正在保存狀態；如確有需要，可再次確認後強制結束。"}}}},
    "%@ · 仍在运行" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · Still running"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · 仍在運行"}}}},
    "进程身份在关闭期间发生变化；CleanNest 没有向替换进程发送信号。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The process identity changed during shutdown; CleanNest did not signal the replacement process."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"進程身份在關閉期間發生變化；CleanNest 沒有向替換進程發送信號。"}}}},
    "%@ · 身份已变化" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · Identity changed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · 身份已變化"}}}},
    "没有关闭 %@：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Did not shut down %@: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"沒有關閉 %@：%@"}}}},
    "原进程已退出，但所属平台已自动重启服务为 PID %@。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The original process exited, but its platform automatically restarted the service as PID %@."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"原進程已退出，但所屬平台已自動重啓服務為 PID %@。"}}}},
    "演示模式不会停用任何守护服务。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo mode never disables supervisor services."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示模式不會停用任何守護服務。"}}}},
    "没有取得模型进程与守护服务的精确对应关系。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No precise association between the model process and supervisor service is available."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"沒有取得模型進程與守護服務的精確對應關係。"}}}},
    "正在重新核对进程、守护标签与配置文件…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Rechecking the process, supervisor label, and configuration file…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在重新核對進程、守護標籤與配置檔案…"}}}},
    "模型服务或守护关系已经改变；CleanNest 没有修改 launchd。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The model service or supervisor relationship changed; CleanNest did not modify launchd."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"模型服務或守護關係已經改變；CleanNest 沒有修改 launchd。"}}}},
    "身份复核未通过：%@ CleanNest 没有修改 launchd。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Identity revalidation failed: %@ CleanNest did not modify launchd."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"身份復核未通過：%@ CleanNest 沒有修改 launchd。"}}}},
    "停用模型守护服务" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Disable Model Supervisor Service"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"停用模型守護服務"}}}},
    "%@ · %@ · 身份复核失败" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · %@ · Identity revalidation failed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · %@ · 身份復核失敗"}}}},
    "launchd 没有接受停用请求（退出码 %@）；当前进程未被关闭。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"launchd rejected the disable request (exit code %@); the current process was not terminated."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"launchd 沒有接受停用請求（退出碼 %@）；當前進程未被關閉。"}}}},
    "%@ · %@ · 停用失败" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · %@ · Disable failed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · %@ · 停用失敗"}}}},
    "%@ 已停用，PID %@ 已退出；launchd 不会再次自动拉起。可在本页重新启用。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ is disabled and PID %@ has exited; launchd will not relaunch it automatically. Re-enable it on this page."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 已停用，PID %@ 已退出；launchd 不會再次自動拉起。可在本頁重新啟用。"}}}},
    "模型守护服务已停用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Model Supervisor Service Disabled"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"模型守護服務已停用"}}}},
    "launchd 尚未确认服务完全退出" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"launchd has not confirmed complete service exit"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"launchd 尚未確認服務完全退出"}}}},
    "bootout 返回退出码 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"bootout returned exit code %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"bootout 返回退出碼 %@"}}}},
    "自动启动已标记为停用，但 %@。请重新发现后再决定是否关闭残留进程。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Automatic launch was marked disabled, but %@. Rediscover current state before deciding whether to stop residual processes."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自動啓動已標記為停用，但 %@。請重新發現後再決定是否關閉殘留進程。"}}}},
    "%@ · %@ · 部分完成" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · %@ · Partially completed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · %@ · 部分完成"}}}},
    "停用守护服务已取消；请重新发现当前状态。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Supervisor disable was cancelled; rediscover the current state."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"停用守護服務已取消；請重新發現當前狀態。"}}}},
    "没有停用守护服务：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Supervisor service was not disabled: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"沒有停用守護服務：%@"}}}},
    "演示模式不会启用任何守护服务。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo mode never enables supervisor services."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示模式不會啟用任何守護服務。"}}}},
    "没有找到可重新启用的守护服务。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No supervisor service available to re-enable."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"沒有找到可重新啟用的守護服務。"}}}},
    "正在重新核对守护配置并启用…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Revalidating the supervisor configuration before enabling…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在重新核對守護配置並啟用…"}}}},
    "守护配置已经消失或改变；CleanNest 没有启用服务。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The supervisor configuration disappeared or changed; CleanNest did not enable the service."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"守護配置已經消失或改變；CleanNest 沒有啟用服務。"}}}},
    "守护配置复核未通过：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Supervisor configuration revalidation failed: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"守護配置復核未通過：%@"}}}},
    "launchd 没有接受启用请求（退出码 %@）。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"launchd rejected the enable request (exit code %@)."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"launchd 沒有接受啟用請求（退出碼 %@）。"}}}},
    "%@ 已重新启用，当前 PID 为 %@。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ was re-enabled; the current PID is %@."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 已重新啟用，當前 PID 為 %@。"}}}},
    "启用模型守护服务" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enable Model Supervisor Service"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"啟用模型守護服務"}}}},
    "守护服务已启用，但尚未发现运行进程；它可能仍在启动或启动失败。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The supervisor service is enabled, but no running process was found; it may still be starting or may have failed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"守護服務已啟用，但尚未發現運行進程；它可能仍在啓動或啓動失敗。"}}}},
    "启用状态已恢复，但 bootstrap 返回退出码 %@。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enabled state was restored, but bootstrap returned exit code %@."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"啟用狀態已恢復，但 bootstrap 返回退出碼 %@。"}}}},
    "%@ · %@ · 等待启动" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · %@ · Waiting to start"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · %@ · 等待啓動"}}}},
    "启用守护服务已取消；请重新发现当前状态。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Supervisor enable was cancelled; rediscover the current state."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"啟用守護服務已取消；請重新發現當前狀態。"}}}},
    "没有启用守护服务：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Supervisor service was not enabled: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"沒有啟用守護服務：%@"}}}},
    "Mac 即将休眠；Agent 扫描已取消，上一次完整结果保持不变。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The Mac is going to sleep; Agent scans were cancelled and the last complete results remain unchanged."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mac 即將休眠；Agent 掃描已取消，上一次完整結果保持不變。"}}}},
    "Mac 即将休眠；CleanNest 不停止模型服务，唤醒后会重新核对进程、端口、模型和守护关系。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The Mac is going to sleep. CleanNest does not stop model services and will recheck processes, ports, models, and supervisor relationships after wake."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mac 即將休眠；CleanNest 不停止模型服務，喚醒後會重新核對進程、端口、模型和守護關係。"}}}},
    "唤醒后重新核对模型服务" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Rechecking Model Services After Wake"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"喚醒後重新核對模型服務"}}}},
    "正在重新读取进程、端口、客户端连接、平台 API 与自动拉起来源。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Rereading processes, ports, client connections, platform APIs, and automatic relaunch sources."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在重新讀取進程、端口、客戶端連接、平台 API 與自動拉起來源。"}}}},
    "历史记录已开启，等待首次采样。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"History is enabled and waiting for its first sample."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"歷史記錄已開啓，等待首次採樣。"}}}},
    "每 60 秒本机采样；当前显示 %@ 个数据点。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Samples on-device every 60 seconds; currently showing %@ data points."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"每 60 秒本機採樣；當前顯示 %@ 個資料點。"}}}},
    "暂时无法读取历史记录：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"History is temporarily unreadable: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"暫時無法讀取歷史記錄：%@"}}}},
    "演示模式：保留期只更新当前合成界面。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo mode: retention changes only update the current synthetic view."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示模式：保留期只更新當前合成界面。"}}}},
    "无法更新保留期限：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Could not update the retention period: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"無法更新保留期限：%@"}}}},
    "演示模式：合成历史已从当前界面清空。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo mode: synthetic history was cleared from the current view."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示模式：合成歷史已從當前界面清空。"}}}},
    "本机历史记录已清空；后续采样会重新开始。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"On-device history was cleared; future sampling starts fresh."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本機歷史記錄已清空；後續採樣會重新開始。"}}}},
    "无法清空历史记录：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Could not clear history: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"無法清空歷史記錄：%@"}}}},
    "历史记录已开启；进入系统状态时加载图表。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"History is enabled; charts load when you open System Status."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"歷史記錄已開啓；進入系統狀態時加載圖表。"}}}},
    "历史记录未能启用：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"History could not be enabled: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"歷史記錄未能啟用：%@"}}}},
    "每 60 秒本机采样；保留 %@ 天，不上传。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Samples on-device every 60 seconds; retained for %@ days and never uploaded."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"每 60 秒本機採樣；保留 %@ 天，不上傳。"}}}},
    "本次历史采样未保存：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This history sample was not saved: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本次歷史採樣未保存：%@"}}}},
    "菜单栏监测已关闭；CleanNest 不再进行 2 秒采样。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Menu bar monitoring is off; CleanNest no longer samples every 2 seconds."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選單列監測已關閉；CleanNest 不再進行 2 秒採樣。"}}}},
    "登录启动设置未生效：" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Login launch setting did not take effect:"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"登錄啓動設定未生效："}}}},
    "已由 macOS 登录项管理；下次登录后只在菜单栏安静启动。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Managed by macOS Login Items; the next login launches quietly in the menu bar only."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已由 macOS 登錄項管理；下次登錄後只在選單列安靜啓動。"}}}},
    "已注册，但 macOS 需要你在“登录项”中允许 CleanNest。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Registered, but macOS requires you to allow CleanNest under Login Items."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已註冊，但 macOS 需要你在“登錄項”中允許 CleanNest。"}}}},
    "未设为登录时启动。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Not set to launch at login."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未設為登錄時啓動。"}}}},
    "尚未注册登录项；首次开启后会由 macOS 接管。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Login item not registered yet; macOS takes over after you first enable it."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"尚未註冊登錄項；首次開啓後會由 macOS 接管。"}}}},
    "macOS 返回了未知的登录启动状态。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS returned an unknown login launch status."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS 返回了未知的登錄啓動狀態。"}}}},
    "温度" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Temperature"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"溫度"}}}},
    "风扇" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fans"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"風扇"}}}},
    "已读取 " : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Read "}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已讀取 "}}}},
    " 项本机指标；每 " : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" on-device metrics; refreshes every "}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" 項本機指標；每 "}}}},
    " 秒刷新，不上传。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" seconds. Nothing is uploaded."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" 秒刷新，不上傳。"}}}},
    " 项；" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" items;"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" 項；"}}}},
    "本次未取得有效值。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No valid values were obtained this time."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本次未取得有效值。"}}}},
    "引擎已就绪" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Engine Ready"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"引擎已就緒"}}}},
    "引擎检查未通过" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Engine Check Failed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"引擎檢查未通過"}}}},
    "这台 Mac 尚未安装 Homebrew" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Homebrew is not installed on this Mac"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這台 Mac 尚未安裝 Homebrew"}}}},
    "正在安装本地清理引擎…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Installing the local cleanup engine…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在安裝本機清理引擎…"}}}},
    "安装清理引擎" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Install Cleanup Engine"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"安裝清理引擎"}}}},
    "安装没有完成，尚未更改任何清理项目" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Installation did not complete; no cleanup items were changed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"安裝沒有完成，尚未更改任何清理項目"}}}},
    "自定义引擎不由 Homebrew 管理" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Custom engines are not managed by Homebrew"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自定義引擎不由 Homebrew 管理"}}}},
    "请使用你选择的安装方式更新该引擎，然后在 CleanNest 中重新检测。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Update the engine using your chosen installation method, then check it again in CleanNest."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"請使用你選擇的安裝方式更新該引擎，然後在 CleanNest 中重新檢測。"}}}},
    "未检测到 Homebrew" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Homebrew Not Detected"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未檢測到 Homebrew"}}}},
    "正在检查引擎更新…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Checking for engine updates…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在檢查引擎更新…"}}}},
    "更新清理引擎" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Update Cleanup Engine"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更新清理引擎"}}}},
    "更新没有完成" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Update Did Not Complete"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更新沒有完成"}}}},
    "mlx_lm.server 必须使用完整路径" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"mlx_lm.server requires a full path"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"mlx_lm.server 必須使用完整路徑"}}}},
    "正在停止旧的本机模型进程…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stopping the previous on-device model process…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在停止舊的本機模型進程…"}}}},
    "旧模型进程未能及时停止，设置尚未更改" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The previous model process did not stop in time; settings were not changed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"舊模型進程未能及時停止，設定尚未更改"}}}},
    "正在停止 CleanNest 启动的模型进程…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stopping the model process launched by CleanNest…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在停止 CleanNest 啓動的模型進程…"}}}},
    "本机模型已停止，可随时重新启动" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The on-device model has stopped and can be restarted at any time"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本機模型已停止，可隨時重新啓動"}}}},
    "本机模型已停止" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"On-Device Model Stopped"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本機模型已停止"}}}},
    "模型进程未能及时停止，请稍后重试" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The model process did not stop in time; try again later"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"模型進程未能及時停止，請稍後重試"}}}},
    "模型进程仍在退出" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The model process is still exiting"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"模型進程仍在退出"}}}},
    "已连接本机回环服务；API 模型为 %@。文件内容不会发送给模型。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Connected to the on-device loopback service; API model is %@. File contents are not sent to the model."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已連接本機loopback服務；API 模型為 %@。檔案內容不會發送給模型。"}}}},
    "最小推理测速完成：首字 %@ ms，总耗时 %@ ms。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Minimal inference benchmark complete: first token %@ ms, total %@ ms."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"最小推理測速完成：首字 %@ ms，總耗時 %@ ms。"}}}},
    "已复用正在运行的本机模型服务；API 模型为 %@。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reused the running on-device model service; API model is %@."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已復用正在運行的本機模型服務；API 模型為 %@。"}}}},
    "模型仍在载入" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Model Is Still Loading"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"模型仍在載入"}}}},
    "模型已由 CleanNest 在本机启动；API 模型为 %@。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest launched the model on-device; API model is %@."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"模型已由 CleanNest 在本機啓動；API 模型為 %@。"}}}},
    "\n\n模型日志：\n%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"\n\nModel log:\n%@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"\n\n模型記錄檔：\n%@"}}}},
    "模型启动已取消" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Model Launch Cancelled"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"模型啓動已取消"}}}},
    "模型启动没有完成" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Model Launch Did Not Complete"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"模型啓動沒有完成"}}}},
    "本机模型尚未连接，可在设置中检测或启动。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No on-device model is connected. Detect or start one in Settings."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本機模型尚未連接，可在設定中檢測或啓動。"}}}},
    "结果与当前扫描不一致" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Results Do Not Match the Current Scan"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"結果與當前掃描不一致"}}}},
    "已用 %@ 分析 %@ 项元数据。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Used %@ to analyze metadata for %@ items."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已用 %@ 分析 %@ 項元資料。"}}}},
    "你明确提出以后优先复核这个项目。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"You explicitly asked to prioritize reviewing this item in the future."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你明確提出以後優先復核這個項目。"}}}},
    "你明确提出以后优先保留这个项目。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"You explicitly asked to prioritize keeping this item in the future."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你明確提出以後優先保留這個項目。"}}}},
    "清理建议" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cleanup Suggestions"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"清理建議"}}}},
    "磁盘解读" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Disk Interpretation"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"磁盤解讀"}}}},
    "正在读取这台 Mac 的状态…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reading this Mac’s status…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在讀取這台 Mac 的狀態…"}}}},
    "系统状态暂时不可用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"System Status Temporarily Unavailable"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"系統狀態暫時不可用"}}}},
    "演示模式不会结束任何进程。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo mode never terminates processes."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示模式不會結束任何進程。"}}}},
    "“%@”已被强制结束。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"“%@” was force-terminated."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"“%@”已被強制結束。"}}}},
    "“%@”已正常退出。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"“%@” exited normally."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"“%@”已正常退出。"}}}},
    "“%@”没有退出。它可能正在保存数据、没有响应，或已被所属 App 重新启动；如确有需要，可再次确认后强制结束。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"“%@” did not exit. It may be saving data, unresponsive, or relaunched by its app. If necessary, confirm again before forcing termination."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"“%@”沒有退出。它可能正在保存資料、沒有響應，或已被所屬 App 重新啓動；如確有需要，可再次確認後強制結束。"}}}},
    "原进程已经退出或被重新启动，CleanNest 没有向新的进程发送信号。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The original process already exited or restarted; CleanNest did not signal the new process."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"原進程已經退出或被重新啓動，CleanNest 沒有向新的進程發送信號。"}}}},
    "没有结束“%@”：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Did not terminate “%@”: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"沒有結束“%@”：%@"}}}},
    "正在取消清理扫描…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cancelling cleanup scan…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在取消清理掃描…"}}}},
    "本次独立扫描已取消；上一次完整结果保持不变。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This isolated scan was cancelled; the last complete result remains unchanged."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本次獨立掃描已取消；上一次完整結果保持不變。"}}}},
    "正在启动独立扫描服务…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Starting the isolated scanner service…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在啓動獨立掃描服務…"}}}},
    "独立扫描服务已完成 %@ 项结果，耗时 %@ 秒；高成本文件遍历未在 CleanNest 主进程内执行。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The isolated scanner completed %@ results in %@ seconds; expensive file traversal did not run in CleanNest’s main process."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"獨立掃描服務已完成 %@ 項結果，耗時 %@ 秒；高成本檔案遍歷未在 CleanNest 主進程內執行。"}}}},
    "清理扫描已取消；上一次完整结果保持不变。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cleanup scan cancelled; the last complete result remains unchanged."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"清理掃描已取消；上一次完整結果保持不變。"}}}},
    "清理扫描没有完成" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cleanup Scan Did Not Complete"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"清理掃描沒有完成"}}}},
    "\n挂载安装介质检测：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"\nMounted installer detection: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"\n掛載安裝介質檢測：%@"}}}},
    "演示模式不会更改任何文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo mode never changes files"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示模式不會更改任何檔案"}}}},
    "正在把所选内容移到废纸篓…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Moving selected items to Trash…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在把所選內容移到垃圾桶…"}}}},
    "已把 %@ 项移到废纸篓" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Moved %@ items to Trash"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已把 %@ 項移到垃圾桶"}}}},
    "所选内容已移到废纸篓，可在清空前恢复。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Selected items moved to Trash and can be restored before it is emptied."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所選內容已移到垃圾桶，可在清空前恢復。"}}}},
    "已完成 %@ 项，%@ 项未成功" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Completed %@ items; %@ were unsuccessful"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已完成 %@ 項，%@ 項未成功"}}}},
    "未知错误" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Unknown Error"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未知錯誤"}}}},
    "部分项目未通过执行前安全复核，已安全跳过。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Some items failed the pre-execution safety review and were safely skipped."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"部分項目未通過執行前安全複核，已安全跳過。"}}}},
    "候选已不在本次扫描中，请重新扫描" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The candidate is no longer in this scan; scan again"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"候選已不在本次掃描中，請重新掃描"}}}},
    "正在重新复核“%@”…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reviewing “%@” again…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在重新複核「%@」…"}}}},
    "单项复核没有返回确定结果，文件未移动" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The single-item review returned no definitive result; the file was not moved"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"單項複核沒有返回確定結果，檔案未移動"}}}},
    "目标：%@\n结果数量：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Target: %@\nResult count: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目標：%@\n結果數量：%@"}}}},
    "单项复核仍未通过，文件未移动" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The single-item review still did not pass; the file was not moved"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"單項複核仍未通過，檔案未移動"}}}},
    "单项复核清理" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Single-item review cleanup"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"單項複核清理"}}}},
    "复核通过，已把 1 项移到废纸篓" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Review passed; moved 1 item to Trash"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"複核通過，已把 1 項移到垃圾桶"}}}},
    "单项复核已重新执行路径、身份与活跃检查；未绕过任何执行前安全门。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The single-item review repeated path, identity, and activity checks; no pre-execution safety gate was bypassed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"單項複核已重新執行路徑、身分與活躍檢查；未繞過任何執行前安全門。"}}}},
    "已移到废纸篓，可在清空前恢复。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Moved to Trash and can be restored before it is emptied."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已移到垃圾桶，可在清空前恢復。"}}}},
    "需要逐项复核" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Review each item"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"需要逐項複核"}}}},
    "只重试仍可使用原证据的项目；身份或路径变化必须重新扫描。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Retry only items whose original evidence remains usable; changed identities or paths require a new scan."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只重試仍可使用原證據的項目；身分或路徑變化必須重新掃描。"}}}},
    "%d 项未移动" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d items not moved"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d 項未移動"}}}},
    "诊断" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Diagnostics"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"診斷"}}}},
    "打开权限设置" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Open Permission Settings"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"打開權限設定"}}}},
    "重试此项" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Retry This Item"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重試此項"}}}},
    "重新执行全部执行前安全检查，不会跳过活跃或身份复核" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Repeat all pre-execution safety checks without skipping activity or identity review"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重新執行全部執行前安全檢查，不會跳過活躍或身分複核"}}}},
    "正在读取已安装的 App…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reading installed apps…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在讀取已安裝的 App…"}}}},
    "演示模式不会卸载 App" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo mode never uninstalls apps"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示模式不會解除安裝 App"}}}},
    "依赖检查尚未完成，请稍后再试" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dependency checks have not finished; try again later"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"依賴檢查尚未完成，請稍後再試"}}}},
    "请先退出 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Quit %@ first"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"請先退出 %@"}}}},
    "App 仍在运行；没有改动文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The app is still running; no files were changed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"App 仍在運行；沒有改動檔案"}}}},
    "App 尚未退出，后续步骤未执行" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The app has not quit; subsequent steps were not executed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"App 尚未退出，後續步驟未執行"}}}},
    "确认 App 和相关文件均未改动" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Confirms that the app and related files were not changed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"確認 App 和相關檔案均未改動"}}}},
    "已确认 App 当前未运行" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Confirmed that the app is not currently running"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已確認 App 當前未運行"}}}},
    "%@ 缺少扫描身份，请重新扫描后再试" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ lacks a scan identity; scan again before retrying"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 缺少掃描身份，請重新掃描後再試"}}}},
    "扫描时未能记录 App 的设备号、文件号与所有者；为避免卸载错误目标，本次操作已停止。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The scan could not record the app’s device ID, file ID, and owner. The operation stopped to avoid uninstalling the wrong target."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"掃描時未能記錄 App 的設備號、檔案號與所有者；為避免解除安裝錯誤目標，本次操作已停止。"}}}},
    "缺少稳定文件身份" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stable File Identity Missing"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"缺少穩定檔案身份"}}}},
    "身份无法复核，未请求系统认证" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Identity could not be revalidated; system authentication was not requested"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"身份無法復核，未請求系統認證"}}}},
    "确认相关文件零变更" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Confirms Related Files Remain Unchanged"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"確認相關檔案零變更"}}}},
    "缺少可复核的扫描身份，未改动任何文件。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No revalidatable scan identity is available; no files were changed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"缺少可復核的掃描身份，未改動任何檔案。"}}}},
    "%@ 已发生变化，请重新扫描后再试" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ has changed; scan again before retrying"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 已發生變化，請重新掃描後再試"}}}},
    "路径、Bundle ID 或稳定身份已经变化" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The path, bundle ID, or stable identity changed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"路徑、Bundle ID 或穩定身份已經變化"}}}},
    "身份复核失败，未请求系统认证" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Identity revalidation failed; system authentication was not requested"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"身份復核失敗，未請求系統認證"}}}},
    "App 身份已经变化，未改动任何文件。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The app identity changed; no files were changed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"App 身份已經變化，未改動任何檔案。"}}}},
    "设备号、文件号、所有者和 Bundle ID 一致" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Device ID, file ID, owner, and bundle ID all match"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"設備號、檔案號、所有者和 Bundle ID 一致"}}}},
    "当前账户可直接移动，无需管理员认证" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The current account can move it directly without administrator authentication"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"當前帳戶可直接移動，無需管理員認證"}}}},
    "正在将 %@ 移到废纸篓…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Moving %@ to Trash…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在將 %@ 移到垃圾桶…"}}}},
    "已取消卸载 %@，没有改动任何文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Uninstall of %@ was cancelled; no files were changed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已取消解除安裝 %@，沒有改動任何檔案"}}}},
    "你取消了 macOS 管理员认证" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"You cancelled macOS administrator authentication"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你取消了 macOS 管理員認證"}}}},
    "管理员认证未通过，没有改动任何文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Administrator authentication failed; no files were changed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"管理員認證未通過，沒有改動任何檔案"}}}},
    "macOS 未批准管理员认证" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS did not approve administrator authentication"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS 未批准管理員認證"}}}},
    "执行前身份复核发现变化" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pre-execution identity revalidation detected a change"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行前身份復核發現變化"}}}},
    "Finder 自动化权限被拒绝，没有改动任何文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Finder automation permission was denied; no files were changed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Finder 自動化權限被拒絕，沒有改動任何檔案"}}}},
    "macOS 阻止 CleanNest 控制 Finder" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS prevented CleanNest from controlling Finder"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS 阻止 CleanNest 控制 Finder"}}}},
    "未能卸载 %@，没有处理相关文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Could not uninstall %@; related files were not processed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未能解除安裝 %@，沒有處理相關檔案"}}}},
    "macOS 没有确认 App 已进入废纸篓" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS did not confirm that the app moved to Trash"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS 沒有確認 App 已進入垃圾桶"}}}},
    "认证结果无法独立确认" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Authentication result could not be independently confirmed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"認證結果無法獨立確認"}}}},
    "App 本体未确认进入废纸篓，相关文件强制保持零变更" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The app bundle was not confirmed in Trash; related files were kept strictly unchanged"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"App 本體未確認進入垃圾桶，相關檔案強制保持零變更"}}}},
    "已复核：相关文件没有执行任何移动" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Verified: no related files were moved"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已復核：相關檔案沒有執行任何移動"}}}},
    "macOS 已完成认证" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS authentication completed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS 已完成認證"}}}},
    "已确认 App 离开原位置并进入废纸篓" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Confirmed that the app left its original location and entered Trash"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已確認 App 離開原位置並進入垃圾桶"}}}},
    "没有可单独处理的 App 私有项目" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No separately processable app-private items"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"沒有可單獨處理的 App 私有項目"}}}},
    "你选择保留全部相关文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"You chose to keep all related files"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你選擇保留全部相關檔案"}}}},
    "%@ 项已移到废纸篓" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ items moved to Trash"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 項已移到垃圾桶"}}}},
    "%@ 项完成，%@ 项保留" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ items completed; %@ kept"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 項完成，%@ 項保留"}}}},
    "App 与所选私有项目均已复核" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The app and selected private items were all verified"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"App 與所選私有項目均已復核"}}}},
    "App 已在废纸篓；未完成项目保持原位，可重试" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The app is in Trash; incomplete items remain in place and can be retried"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"App 已在垃圾桶；未完成項目保持原位，可重試"}}}},
    "%@ 已移到废纸篓" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ moved to Trash"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 已移到垃圾桶"}}}},
    "App 已通过 macOS 原生管理员认证移到废纸篓。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The app moved to Trash using native macOS administrator authentication."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"App 已通過 macOS 原生管理員認證移到垃圾桶。"}}}},
    "App 已移到废纸篓。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The app moved to Trash."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"App 已移到垃圾桶。"}}}},
    "%@ 精确匹配的相关文件也已移到废纸篓。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ Precisely matched related files also moved to Trash."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 精確匹配的相關檔案也已移到垃圾桶。"}}}},
    "%@ 相关文件已保留。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ Related files were kept."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 相關檔案已保留。"}}}},
    "App 已卸载，但 %@ 个相关文件未处理" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The app was uninstalled, but %@ related files were not processed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"App 已解除安裝，但 %@ 個相關檔案未處理"}}}},
    "App 已移到废纸篓，部分相关文件因权限被保留。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The app moved to Trash; some related files were kept because of permissions."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"App 已移到垃圾桶，部分相關檔案因權限被保留。"}}}},
    "正在重试未完成的相关文件…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Retrying incomplete related files…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在重試未完成的相關檔案…"}}}},
    "重试完成；%@ 项已移到废纸篓" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Retry complete; %@ items moved to Trash"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重試完成；%@ 項已移到垃圾桶"}}}},
    "仍有 %@ 项保持原位" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ items still remain in place"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仍有 %@ 項保持原位"}}}},
    "所有已确认项目均有废纸篓恢复位置" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"All confirmed items have recovery locations in Trash"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所有已確認項目均有垃圾桶恢復位置"}}}},
    "未完成项目保持原位，可再次重试" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Incomplete items remain in place and can be retried"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未完成項目保持原位，可再次重試"}}}},
    "未完成的相关文件已补充移到废纸篓" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Incomplete related files were subsequently moved to Trash"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未完成的相關檔案已補充移到垃圾桶"}}}},
    "仍有 %@ 个相关文件未处理" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ related files remain unprocessed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仍有 %@ 個相關檔案未處理"}}}},
    "正在取消磁盘分析…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cancelling disk analysis…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在取消磁盤分析…"}}}},
    "本次磁盘分析已取消；已有结果保持不变。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Disk analysis was cancelled; existing results remain unchanged."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本次磁盤分析已取消；已有結果保持不變。"}}}},
    "没有找到可由 Launch Services 精确确认的所属 App；当前项目继续保持只读。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No owning app could be precisely confirmed by Launch Services; the current item remains read-only."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"沒有找到可由 Launch Services 精確確認的所屬 App；當前項目繼續保持唯讀。"}}}},
    "所属 App 未能打开：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The owning app could not be opened: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所屬 App 未能打開：%@"}}}},
    "已把 %@ 标记为待清理复核；不会自动勾选或删除。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Marked %@ for cleanup review; it will not be selected or deleted automatically."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已把 %@ 標記為待清理復核；不會自動勾選或刪除。"}}}},
    "已记住保留 %@。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Remembered to keep %@."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已記住保留 %@。"}}}},
    "已把 %@ 设为稍后处理。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Marked %@ for later."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已把 %@ 設為稍後處理。"}}}},
    "%@ 已恢复为跟随系统建议。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ now follows system suggestions again."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 已恢復為跟隨系統建議。"}}}},
    "正在分析 %@…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Analyzing %@…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在分析 %@…"}}}},
    "磁盘增量索引无法读取，本次改为完整扫描：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The incremental disk index could not be read, so this scan is full instead: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"磁盤增量索引無法讀取，本次改為完整掃描：%@"}}}},
    "独立磁盘扫描完成：复用 %@ 项，实扫 %@ 项，耗时 %@ 秒。缓存只在元数据签名匹配且 15 分钟内复用。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Isolated disk scan complete: %@ reused and %@ scanned in %@ seconds. Cache entries are reused only when metadata signatures match and are under 15 minutes old."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"獨立磁盤掃描完成：復用 %@ 項，實掃 %@ 項，耗時 %@ 秒。緩存只在元資料簽名匹配且 15 分鐘內復用。"}}}},
    "独立磁盘扫描完成：实扫 %@ 项，耗时 %@ 秒。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Isolated disk scan complete: %@ items scanned in %@ seconds."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"獨立磁盤掃描完成：實掃 %@ 項，耗時 %@ 秒。"}}}},
    " 已向系统归还约 %@ 的空闲分配页。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" Returned approximately %@ of free allocation pages to the system."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" 已向系統歸還約 %@ 的空閒分配頁。"}}}},
    "磁盘分析没有完成" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Disk Analysis Did Not Complete"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"磁盤分析沒有完成"}}}},
    "正在连接独立扫描服务…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Connecting to the isolated scanner service…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在連接獨立掃描服務…"}}}},
    "独立服务正在检查可重建缓存…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The isolated service is checking regenerable caches…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"獨立服務正在檢查可重建緩存…"}}}},
    "独立服务正在检查下载、媒体与重复文件…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The isolated service is checking downloads, media, and duplicates…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"獨立服務正在檢查下載、媒體與重復檔案…"}}}},
    "独立服务正在生成磁盘证据…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The isolated service is generating disk evidence…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"獨立服務正在生成磁盤證據…"}}}},
    "演示模式：只重置了当前合成界面的索引状态。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo mode: only the index state in the current synthetic view was reset."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示模式：只重置了當前合成界面的索引狀態。"}}}},
    "磁盘增量索引已清空；下次分析会重新读取大小。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The incremental disk index was cleared; the next analysis rereads sizes."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"磁盤增量索引已清空；下次分析會重新讀取大小。"}}}},
    "磁盘增量索引未能清空：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The incremental disk index could not be cleared: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"磁盤增量索引未能清空：%@"}}}},
    "磁盘 AI 快照与当前目录不一致" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The disk AI snapshot does not match the current directory"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"磁盤 AI 快照與當前目錄不一致"}}}},
    "磁盘 AI 结果与当前层级不一致" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The disk AI result does not match the current level"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"磁盤 AI 結果與當前層級不一致"}}}},
    "已用 %@ 深度解读 %@ 个磁盘项目。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Used %@ to interpret %@ disk items in depth."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已用 %@ 深度解讀 %@ 個磁盤項目。"}}}},
    "%@ 报告权限不足，CleanNest 已终止本次分析，不会再回退到原生扫描，避免连续触发系统授权弹窗。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ reported insufficient permissions. CleanNest stopped this analysis and will not fall back to native scanning, avoiding repeated system authorization prompts."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 報告權限不足，CleanNest 已終止本次分析，不會再回退到原生掃描，避免連續觸發系統授權彈窗。"}}}},
    "权限不足" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Insufficient Permissions"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"權限不足"}}}},
    "没有权限" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Permission Denied"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"沒有權限"}}}},
    "拒绝访问" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Access Denied"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"拒絕訪問"}}}},
    "正在只读检查%@…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Running a read-only check of %@…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在唯讀檢查%@…"}}}},
    "执行前正在重新检查%@…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Rechecking %@ before execution…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行前正在重新檢查%@…"}}}},
    "正在%@…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Running %@…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在%@…"}}}},
    "演示模式没有运行系统命令。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo mode did not run system commands."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示模式沒有運行系統命令。"}}}},
    "正在复核%@是否恢复…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Verifying whether %@ has recovered…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在復核%@是否恢復…"}}}},
    "命令已返回成功：%@ %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Command returned success: %@ %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"命令已返回成功：%@ %@"}}}},
    "命令未成功：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Command was unsuccessful: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"命令未成功：%@"}}}},
    "未能打开 macOS 的完全磁盘访问设置。请手动打开“系统设置 > 隐私与安全性 > 完全磁盘访问”。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Could not open macOS Full Disk Access settings. Manually open System Settings > Privacy & Security > Full Disk Access."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未能打開 macOS 的完全磁盤訪問設定。請手動打開“系統設定 > 隱私與安全性 > 完全磁盤訪問”。"}}}},
    "演示模式不会改写本机偏好设置。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo mode never changes on-device preferences."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示模式不會改寫本機偏好設定。"}}}},
    "设置已恢复为安全默认值。本机活动、扫描结果、学习规则、历史指标和 macOS 授权均未清除。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Settings were restored to safe defaults. On-device activity, scan results, learned rules, metric history, and macOS grants were not cleared."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"設定已恢復為安全默認值。本機活動、掃描結果、學習規則、歷史指標和 macOS 授權均未清除。"}}}},
    "请选择本机的完整模型目录" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose a complete on-device model directory"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"請選擇本機的完整模型目錄"}}}},
    "模型目录不完整或不存在" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The model directory is incomplete or missing"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"模型目錄不完整或不存在"}}}},
    "API 模型必须使用 oMLX 列出的短名，不能使用文件路径" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The API model must use a short name listed by oMLX, not a file path"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"API 模型必須使用 oMLX 列出的短名，不能使用檔案路徑"}}}},
    "oMLX 没有列出“%@”。请从 API 模型列表重新选择；不要填写文件路径。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"oMLX does not list “%@”. Choose again from the API model list; do not enter a file path."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"oMLX 沒有列出“%@”。請從 API 模型列表重新選擇；不要填寫檔案路徑。"}}}},
    "服务已响应，但没有列出可用的模型短名" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The service responded but listed no usable short model names"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"服務已響應，但沒有列出可用的模型短名"}}}},
    "服务列出了多个模型，但无法确定要调用哪一个。请在 API 模型中选择短名。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The service listed multiple models, so the intended one is unclear. Choose a short name under API Model."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"服務列出了多個模型，但無法確定要調用哪一個。請在 API 模型中選擇短名。"}}}},
    "清理预览索引未能保存：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The cleanup preview index could not be saved: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"清理預覽索引未能保存：%@"}}}},
    "清理习惯记录无法读取，已使用空白记忆：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cleanup habit records could not be read, so empty memory is in use: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"清理習慣記錄無法讀取，已使用空白記憶：%@"}}}},
    "本机学习记录无法保存：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"On-device learning records could not be saved: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本機學習記錄無法保存：%@"}}}},
    "Agent 聚合摘要无法读取；文件级扫描尚未运行：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The Agent aggregate summary could not be read; no file-level scan has run: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agent 聚合摘要無法讀取；檔案級掃描尚未運行：%@"}}}},
    "Agent 聚合摘要未能保存：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The Agent aggregate summary could not be saved: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agent 聚合摘要未能保存：%@"}}}},
    "Agent 工作区基线未能保存：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The Agent workspace baseline could not be saved: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agent 工作區基線未能保存：%@"}}}},
    "手动清理决策无法读取，已使用空白记录：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Manual cleanup decisions could not be read, so an empty record is in use: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"手動清理決策無法讀取，已使用空白記錄：%@"}}}},
    "手动清理决策无法保存：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Manual cleanup decisions could not be saved: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"手動清理決策無法保存：%@"}}}},
    "CleanNest 累计成果已归零；活动明细、文件和废纸篓未改变。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest cumulative results were reset; activity details, files, and Trash were not changed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest 累計成果已歸零；活動明細、檔案和垃圾桶未改變。"}}}},
    "累计成果记录无法读取，已从现有活动明细重建：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cumulative results could not be read and were rebuilt from existing activity details: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"累計成果記錄無法讀取，已從現有活動明細重建：%@"}}}},
    "累计成果记录无法保存：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cumulative results could not be saved: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"累計成果記錄無法保存：%@"}}}},
    "最近维护证据无法读取，已保留空白记录：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Recent maintenance evidence could not be read; an empty record remains: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"最近維護證據無法讀取，已保留空白記錄：%@"}}}},
    "最近维护证据无法保存：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Recent maintenance evidence could not be saved: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"最近維護證據無法保存：%@"}}}},
    "3 个会话文件正被 Codex 打开" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"3 session files are open by Codex"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"3 個會話檔案正被 Codex 打開"}}}},
    "近 15 分钟仍有写入" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Writes occurred within the last 15 minutes"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"近 15 分鐘仍有寫入"}}}},
    "状态数据库正在使用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The state database is in use"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"狀態資料庫正在使用"}}}},
    "直接删除会造成索引不一致" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Direct deletion would make the index inconsistent"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"直接刪除會造成索引不一致"}}}},
    "这是 Claude 的隔离运行环境，删除后可能需要重新下载" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This is Claude’s isolated runtime; deleting it may require a new download"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這是 Claude 的隔離運行環境，刪除後可能需要重新下載"}}}},
    "1 个会话文件正被 Claude 打开" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1 session file is open by Claude"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1 個會話檔案正被 Claude 打開"}}}},
    "Codex 出现超大单文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Codex Has an Unusually Large File"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Codex 出現超大單檔案"}}}},
    "会话与工具输出中最大文件约 655 MB；已确认当前活跃会话并锁定。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The largest session/tool-output file is about 655 MB. The active session was confirmed and locked."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"會話與工具輸出中最大檔案約 655 MB；已確認當前活躍會話並鎖定。"}}}},
    "Codex 存在正在使用的文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Codex Has Files in Use"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Codex 存在正在使用的檔案"}}}},
    "已确认 7 个文件被本机进程打开，相关项目不会进入回收执行。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Confirmed that 7 files are open by on-device processes; related items are excluded from reclamation."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已確認 7 個檔案被本機進程打開，相關項目不會進入回收執行。"}}}},
    "演示模式：只展示合成的 Agent 元数据，不读取本机文件。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo mode: shows synthetic Agent metadata only and does not read on-device files."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示模式：只展示合成的 Agent 元資料，不讀取本機檔案。"}}}},
    "演示 Agent 工作区已就绪" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo Agent Workspace Ready"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示 Agent 工作區已就緒"}}}},
    "演示记录：备份已校验，可恢复。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo record: backup verified and recoverable."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示記錄：備份已校驗，可恢復。"}}}},
    "仅检测·规则待验证" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Detection only · Rules unverified"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"僅檢測·規則待驗證"}}}},
    "已验证只读适配" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Verified read-only adapter"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已驗證唯讀適配"}}}},
    "内存 286 MB" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Memory 286 MB"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"記憶體 286 MB"}}}},
    "7 类本机数据" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"7 types of on-device data"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"7 類本機資料"}}}},
    "4 类本机数据" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"4 types of on-device data"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"4 類本機資料"}}}},
    "用户 launchd 服务" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"User launchd service"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"使用者 launchd 服務"}}}},
    "演示模式：1 条 Agent 到本地模型关系由已建立 TCP 连接确认。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo mode: one Agent-to-local-model relationship confirmed by an established TCP connection."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示模式：1 條 Agent 到本機模型關係由已建立 TCP 連接確認。"}}}},
    "选择一个 Git 仓库后再预演" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose a Git repository before previewing"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選擇一個 Git 倉庫後再預演"}}}},
    "不会遍历整台 Mac 猜测仓库。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Does not traverse the entire Mac to guess repositories."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"不會遍歷整台 Mac 猜測倉庫。"}}}},
    "只清理 Git 判定失效的管理记录。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Only cleans administrative records that Git identifies as stale."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只清理 Git 判定失效的管理記錄。"}}}},
    "Docker 磁盘账本已读取" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Docker Disk Ledger Read"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Docker 磁盤帳本已讀取"}}}},
    "4.8 GB 可回收；官方没有 system prune dry-run，保持只读。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"4.8 GB reclaimable; there is no official system prune dry-run, so this remains read-only."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"4.8 GB 可回收；官方沒有 system prune dry-run，保持唯讀。"}}}},
    "不会删除停止容器、网络或镜像。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Does not delete stopped containers, networks, or images."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"不會刪除停止容器、網路或鏡像。"}}}},
    "hf cache prune dry-run 已完成" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"hf cache prune dry-run completed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"hf cache prune dry-run 已完成"}}}},
    "2 个未引用修订，预计 1.26 GB。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"2 unreferenced revisions, estimated at 1.26 GB."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"2 個未引用修訂，預計 1.26 GB。"}}}},
    "移除后可能需要重新下载。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Removal may require downloading them again."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"移除後可能需要重新下載。"}}}},
    "npm 已返回当前缓存位置" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"npm returned the current cache location"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"npm 已返回當前緩存位置"}}}},
    "没有内容级只读预演，使用备份优先通道。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No content-level read-only preview; use the backup-first path."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"沒有內容級唯讀預演，使用備份優先通道。"}}}},
    "不调用 cache clean --force。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Does not invoke cache clean --force."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"不調用 cache clean --force。"}}}},
    "pip 缓存账本已读取" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"pip Cache Ledger Read"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"pip 緩存帳本已讀取"}}}},
    "734 MB · 128 个文件；purge 没有 dry-run。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"734 MB · 128 files; purge has no dry-run."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"734 MB · 128 個檔案；purge 沒有 dry-run。"}}}},
    "保持只读。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Remains read-only."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"保持唯讀。"}}}},
    "演示引擎已就绪" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo Engine Ready"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示引擎已就緒"}}}},
    "正常 · 使用电池" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Normal · On Battery"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正常 · 使用電池"}}}},
    "CPU 温度" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CPU Temperature"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CPU 溫度"}}}},
    "3 天 12 小时" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"3 days 12 hours"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"3 天 12 小時"}}}},
    "演示数据：系统电源接口检测到内置电池。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo data: the system power interface detected an internal battery."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示資料：系統電源接口檢測到內置電池。"}}}},
    "本机模型服务，为 CleanNest 和其他客户端提供推理。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"On-device model service providing inference for CleanNest and other clients."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本機模型服務，為 CleanNest 和其他客戶端提供推理。"}}}},
    "退出后，正在进行的本机 AI 分析会中断，但不会删除模型文件。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Quitting interrupts active on-device AI analysis but does not delete model files."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"退出後，正在進行的本機 AI 分析會中斷，但不會刪除模型檔案。"}}}},
    "正在运行的 Figma 桌面应用。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The running Figma desktop app."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在運行的 Figma 桌面應用。"}}}},
    "退出后应用会关闭，未保存的本地编辑可能丢失。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Quitting closes the app and may lose unsaved local edits."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"退出後應用會關閉，未保存的本機編輯可能丟失。"}}}},
    "macOS 窗口与显示服务。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The macOS window and display service."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS 窗口與顯示服務。"}}}},
    "受系统保护，不提供结束操作。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Protected by the system; no termination action is offered."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"受系統保護，不提供結束操作。"}}}},
    "系统进程" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"System Process"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"系統進程"}}}},
    "演示模式：每 60 秒本机采样；保留 30 天，不上传。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo mode: samples on-device every 60 seconds, retained for 30 days and never uploaded."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示模式：每 60 秒本機採樣；保留 30 天，不上傳。"}}}},
    "演示模式：合成菜单栏指标，不读取本机硬件。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo mode: synthetic menu bar metrics; no on-device hardware is read."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示模式：合成選單列指標，不讀取本機硬件。"}}}},
    "演示 CPU 核心" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo CPU Cores"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示 CPU 核心"}}}},
    "演示电池传感器" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo Battery Sensor"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示電池傳感器"}}}},
    "Movies/访谈原片.mov" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Movies/Interview Original.mov"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Movies/訪談原片.mov"}}}},
    "Xcode 会在需要时重新生成" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Xcode regenerates it when needed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Xcode 會在需要時重新生成"}}}},
    "Homebrew 下载缓存" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Homebrew Download Cache"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Homebrew 下載緩存"}}}},
    "安装包可重新下载" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The installer can be downloaded again"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"安裝包可重新下載"}}}},
    "下载的安装介质 · 个人文件，默认不勾选" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Downloaded installer · Personal file, not selected by default"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"下載的安裝介質 · 個人檔案，默認不勾選"}}}},
    "旧诊断日志" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Old Diagnostic Logs"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"舊診斷記錄檔"}}}},
    "排查问题时可能有用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"May help troubleshoot issues"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"排查問題時可能有用"}}}},
    "素材归档.zip" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Asset Archive.zip"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"素材歸檔.zip"}}}},
    "Downloads/素材归档.zip" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Downloads/Asset Archive.zip"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Downloads/素材歸檔.zip"}}}},
    "普通 ZIP 资料归档；不能仅凭扩展名判断可删除" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"An ordinary ZIP archive; extension alone cannot establish that it is safe to delete"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"普通 ZIP 資料歸檔；不能僅憑擴展名判斷可刪除"}}}},
    "截图文件 · 个人文件，默认不勾选" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Screenshot · Personal file, not selected by default"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"截圖檔案 · 個人檔案，默認不勾選"}}}},
    "截屏2026-08-20 10.18.42.png" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Screenshot 2026-08-20 10.18.42.png"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"截屏2026-08-20 10.18.42.png"}}}},
    "Pictures/截屏2026-08-20 10.18.42.png" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pictures/Screenshot 2026-08-20 10.18.42.png"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pictures/截屏2026-08-20 10.18.42.png"}}}},
    "访谈原片.mov" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Interview Original.mov"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"訪談原片.mov"}}}},
    "较大的视频文件 · 来自影片 · 仅供手动复核" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Large video · From Movies · Manual review only"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"較大的視頻檔案 · 來自影片 · 僅供手動復核"}}}},
    "访谈原片 副本.mov" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Interview Original Copy.mov"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"訪談原片 副本.mov"}}}},
    "Downloads/访谈原片 副本.mov" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Downloads/Interview Original Copy.mov"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Downloads/訪談原片 副本.mov"}}}},
    "与“访谈原片.mov”字节完全相同；执行前会重新核验 SHA-256" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Byte-for-byte identical to “Interview Original.mov”; SHA-256 is verified again before execution"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"與“訪談原片.mov”字節完全相同；執行前會重新核驗 SHA-256"}}}},
    "桌面" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Desktop"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"桌面"}}}},
    "下载" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Downloads"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"下載"}}}},
    "图片" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pictures"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"圖片"}}}},
    "影片" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Movies"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"影片"}}}},
    "音乐" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Music"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"音樂"}}}},
    "文稿" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Documents"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"文稿"}}}},
    "Homebrew 缓存" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Homebrew Cache"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Homebrew 緩存"}}}},
    "演示模式：本机模型已连接" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo Mode: On-Device Model Connected"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示模式：本機模型已連接"}}}},
    "模型 API 已确认，并发现会自动拉起的用户守护。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Model API confirmed, and a user supervisor that can relaunch it was found."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"模型 API 已確認，併發現會自動拉起的使用者守護。"}}}},
    "关闭 PID 后可能自动重启" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"May restart automatically after the PID is stopped"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"關閉 PID 後可能自動重啓"}}}},
    "演示 LaunchAgent 使用 KeepAlive 和登录时启动。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The demo LaunchAgent uses KeepAlive and launches at login."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示 LaunchAgent 使用 KeepAlive 和登錄時啓動。"}}}},
    "有客户端正在连接" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clients Are Connected"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"有客戶端正在連接"}}}},
    "当前观察到本机 Agent 的已建立 TCP 连接；关闭服务会中断请求。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Established TCP connections from on-device Agents are currently observed; stopping the service interrupts requests."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"當前觀察到本機 Agent 的已建立 TCP 連接；關閉服務會中斷請求。"}}}},
    "演示模式：已确认 1 个本地模型服务。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo mode: one local model service confirmed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示模式：已確認 1 個本機模型服務。"}}}},
    "模型服务出现新进程" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Model Service Has a New Process"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"模型服務出現新進程"}}}},
    "oMLX 由演示 LaunchAgent 重新拉起；当前 PID 4242。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The demo LaunchAgent relaunched oMLX; current PID is 4242."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"oMLX 由演示 LaunchAgent 重新拉起；當前 PID 4242。"}}}},
    "主要空间来自可重新生成的开发与包管理器缓存；安装包和诊断日志仍建议逐项确认。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Most space comes from regenerable developer and package-manager caches; installers and diagnostic logs still require item-by-item review."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"主要空間來自可重新生成的開發與包管理器緩存；安裝包和診斷記錄檔仍建議逐項確認。"}}}},
    "超过三周未修改，Xcode 会在下次构建时按需重建。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Unmodified for over three weeks; Xcode rebuilds it as needed on the next build."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"超過三周未修改，Xcode 會在下次構建時按需重建。"}}}},
    "属于可重新下载的安装缓存，体积较大。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A large installer cache that can be downloaded again."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"屬於可重新下載的安裝緩存，體積較大。"}}}},
    "删除前应确认不再需要离线重装这个版本。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Before deleting, confirm you no longer need to reinstall this version offline."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"刪除前應確認不再需要離線重裝這個版本。"}}}},
    "可重新生成，但下一次安装依赖会增加下载时间。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Regenerable, but the next dependency installation will take longer to download."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"可重新生成，但下一次安裝依賴會增加下載時間。"}}}},
    "近期若在排查崩溃问题，这些诊断日志可能仍有价值。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"These diagnostic logs may still be valuable if you are investigating a recent crash."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"近期若在排查崩潰問題，這些診斷記錄檔可能仍有價值。"}}}},
    "AI 只分析元数据；最终处理仍以你的勾选和安全规则为准。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"AI analyzes metadata only; final processing follows your selections and safety rules."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"AI 只分析元資料；最終處理仍以你的勾選和安全規則為準。"}}}},
    "按 Bundle ID 精确匹配" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exact bundle ID match"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"按 Bundle ID 精確匹配"}}}},
    "偏好设置" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Preferences"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"偏好設定"}}}},
    "稳定路径：/Applications/Figma.app" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stable path: /Applications/Figma.app"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"穩定路徑：/Applications/Figma.app"}}}},
    "Bundle ID 精确匹配：com.figma.Desktop" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exact bundle ID match: com.figma.Desktop"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bundle ID 精確匹配：com.figma.Desktop"}}}},
    "App 本体进入废纸篓后才处理" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Processed only after the app bundle enters Trash"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"App 本體進入垃圾桶後才處理"}}}},
    "位于 App 包内；随 App 本体一起进入废纸篓" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Inside the app bundle; moves to Trash with the app"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"位於 App 包內；隨 App 本體一起進入垃圾桶"}}}},
    "launchd 标签与 Bundle ID 匹配" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"launchd label matches bundle ID"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"launchd 標籤與 Bundle ID 匹配"}}}},
    "KeepAlive 会在退出后尝试重启；配置保持只读" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"KeepAlive attempts a restart after exit; configuration remains read-only"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"KeepAlive 會在退出後嘗試重啓；配置保持唯讀"}}}},
    "代码签名声明共享组：group.com.figma.shared" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Code signature declares shared group: group.com.figma.shared"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"代碼簽名聲明共享組：group.com.figma.shared"}}}},
    "可能被同一开发者的其他 App 使用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"May be used by other apps from the same developer"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"可能被同一開發者的其他 App 使用"}}}},
    "Bundle ID 精确匹配" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exact Bundle ID Match"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bundle ID 精確匹配"}}}},
    "容器生命周期由 macOS 管理，CleanNest 只读" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS manages container lifecycle; CleanNest is read-only"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"容器生命週期由 macOS 管理，CleanNest 唯讀"}}}},
    "演示数据：macOS 代码签名校验通过。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo data: macOS code-signature validation passed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示資料：macOS 代碼簽名校驗通過。"}}}},
    "演示数据：Launch Services 已登记当前扫描路径。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo data: Launch Services registered the current scan path."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示資料：Launch Services 已登記當前掃描路徑。"}}}},
    "演示数据：确认 2 个可单独处理项目；其余依赖保持随本体或只读。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo data: confirmed 2 separately processable items; other dependencies stay with the app or read-only."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示資料：確認 2 個可單獨處理項目；其餘依賴保持隨本體或唯讀。"}}}},
    "浏览器、聊天工具和其他 App 下载到本机的文件。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Files downloaded to this Mac by browsers, chat tools, and other apps."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"瀏覽器、聊天工具和其他 App 下載到本機的檔案。"}}}},
    "来自用户主动下载或应用导出的内容。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Content actively downloaded by the user or exported by apps."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"來自使用者主動下載或應用導出的內容。"}}}},
    "其中可能有可重新下载的安装包，也可能有唯一文件，必须逐项确认。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"May contain redownloadable installers or unique files; every item requires confirmation."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"其中可能有可重新下載的安裝包，也可能有唯一檔案，必須逐項確認。"}}}},
    "用户创建或保存的文档与项目文件。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Documents and project files created or saved by the user."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"使用者創建或保存的文檔與項目檔案。"}}}},
    "主要来自用户编辑、保存或同步。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Primarily produced by user editing, saving, or syncing."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"主要來自使用者編輯、保存或同步。"}}}},
    "通常不可自动重建，默认保留。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Usually cannot be regenerated automatically; kept by default."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"通常不可自動重建，默認保留。"}}}},
    "用户的视频、照片、截图或创作素材。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"User videos, photos, screenshots, or creative assets."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"使用者的視頻、照片、截圖或創作素材。"}}}},
    "来自拍摄、导入、下载或创作。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Produced by capture, import, download, or creation."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"來自拍攝、導入、下載或創作。"}}}},
    "应用设置、数据库、模型、缓存与系统支持数据的混合目录。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A mixed directory of app settings, databases, models, caches, and system support data."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"應用設定、資料庫、模型、緩存與系統支持資料的混合目錄。"}}}},
    "由 macOS 和已安装应用共同产生。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Produced jointly by macOS and installed apps."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"由 macOS 和已安裝應用共同產生。"}}}},
    "不能整体清理；应继续下钻并按所属应用管理。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cannot be cleaned as a whole; drill down and manage by owning app."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"不能整體清理；應繼續下鑽並按所屬應用管理。"}}}},
    "基于目录名称、层级和体积推断，主要空间来自个人文件与应用数据；这些顶层目录都不适合直接整体清理，应继续进入查看。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Based on directory names, hierarchy, and size, most space comes from personal files and app data. None of these top-level directories should be cleaned wholesale; continue drilling down."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"基於目錄名稱、層級和體積推斷，主要空間來自個人檔案與應用資料；這些頂層目錄都不適合直接整體清理，應繼續進入查看。"}}}},
    "Users 包含多个用户主目录；应继续进入，不要把总量当成可清理空间。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Users contains multiple home directories; continue inside and do not treat the total as cleanable space."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Users 包含多個使用者主目錄；應繼續進入，不要把總量當成可清理空間。"}}}},
    "Applications 主要是 App 本体；应通过应用卸载页管理，不应从磁盘浏览整体处理。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Applications primarily contains app bundles; manage them through Uninstall Apps rather than Disk Browser."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Applications 主要是 App 本體；應通過應用解除安裝頁管理，不應從磁盤瀏覽整體處理。"}}}},
    "System 由 macOS 管理，保持只读。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"System is managed by macOS and remains read-only."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"System 由 macOS 管理，保持唯讀。"}}}},
    "Library 混合系统与全局应用数据，应继续下钻确认来源。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Library mixes system and global app data; drill down to confirm origins."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Library 混合系統與全局應用資料，應繼續下鑽確認來源。"}}}},
    "演示结果只依据元数据，不代表读取过文件内容，也不会产生任何清理动作。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Demo results use metadata only, do not imply file contents were read, and never trigger cleanup."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"演示結果只依據元資料，不代表讀取過檔案內容，也不會產生任何清理動作。"}}}},
    "14 项已移到废纸篓，可在清空前恢复。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"14 items moved to Trash and can be restored before it is emptied."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"14 項已移到垃圾桶，可在清空前恢復。"}}}},
    "卸载 Sample App" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Uninstall Sample App"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"解除安裝 Sample App"}}}},
    "App 与精确匹配的相关文件已移到废纸篓。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The app and precisely matched related files moved to Trash."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"App 與精確匹配的相關檔案已移到垃圾桶。"}}}},
    "系统维护任务已完成。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The system maintenance task completed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"系統維護任務已完成。"}}}},
    "每 60 秒本机采样；保留 " : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Samples on-device every 60 seconds; retained for "}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"每 60 秒本機採樣；保留 "}}}},
    " 天，不上传。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" days; never uploaded."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" 天，不上傳。"}}}},
    "每 60 秒本机采样；当前显示 " : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Samples on-device every 60 seconds; currently showing "}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"每 60 秒本機採樣；當前顯示 "}}}},
    " 个数据点。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" data points."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" 個資料點。"}}}},
