    "：这是系统压缩暂时不用的数据，不是可以删除的文件缓存。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" of compressed memory: temporarily inactive data compressed by the system, not deletable file cache."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"：這是系統壓縮暫時不用的資料，不是可以刪除的檔案緩存。"}}}},
    "交换空间已使用 " : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Swap used: "}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"交換空間已使用 "}}}},
    "；单次看到已有占用不代表此刻仍在频繁交换，应结合压力状态和持续卡顿判断。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"; existing usage in one sample does not mean active swapping. Consider pressure and sustained sluggishness."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"；單次看到已有佔用不代表此刻仍在頻繁交換，應結合壓力狀態和持續卡頓判斷。"}}}},
    "本次单个内存足迹最高的是 " : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The largest individual memory footprint in this sample is "}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本次單個記憶體足跡最高的是 "}}}},
    "，约 " : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":", approximately "}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"，約 "}}}},
    "；可刷新后观察是否持续增长。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"; refresh to see whether it keeps growing."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"；可刷新後觀察是否持續增長。"}}}},
    "”的辅助进程；未读取命令行参数，无法确认更具体的职责。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"” helper process; command-line arguments were not read, so its specific role cannot be confirmed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"”的輔助進程；未讀取命令行參數，無法確認更具體的職責。"}}}},
    "”的应用进程。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"” application process."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"”的應用進程。"}}}},
