    "；可关闭部分项目，或保持“双层紧凑”。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"; disable some items or keep “Compact Two-Line” layout."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"；可關閉部分項目，或保持“雙層緊湊”。"}}}},
    "自动宽度预算约 %@ pt；已保留异常项和首选项，将 " : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Automatic width budget is about %@ pt; anomalies and preferences were preserved, moving "}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自動寬度預算約 %@ pt；已保留異常項和首選項，將 "}}}},
    " 收进点开后的面板。数值没有被截断。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" into the opened panel. Values were not truncated."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":" 收進點開後的面板。數值沒有被截斷。"}}}},
    "%@ 项占用约 %@ pt，均以完整双层数值显示。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ items use about %@ pt, all showing complete two-line values."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 項佔用約 %@ pt，均以完整雙層數值顯示。"}}}},
    "%@ 项已以展开文字显示。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ items are shown with expanded text."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 項已以展開文字顯示。"}}}},
