    "深度遍历完成" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Full-Depth Traversal Completed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"深度遍歷完成"}}}},
    "有界遍历完成" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bounded Traversal Completed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"有界遍歷完成"}}}},
    "基础检查未发现异常" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No Anomaly Found in Basic Checks"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"基礎檢查未發現異常"}}}},
    "发现可验证异常" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Verifiable Anomaly Found"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"發現可驗證異常"}}}},
    "自动检查无法确认" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Automatic Checks Are Inconclusive"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自動檢查無法確認"}}}},
    "服务已验证恢复" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Service Recovery Verified"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"服務已驗證恢復"}}}},
    "基础复核通过" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Basic Verification Passed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"基礎復核通過"}}}},
    "执行后仍未恢复" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Not Recovered After Running"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行後仍未恢復"}}}},
    "任务没有执行成功" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Task Did Not Complete Successfully"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"任務沒有執行成功"}}}},
    "执行完成，但无法确认恢复" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Completed, but Recovery Could Not Be Confirmed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行完成，但無法確認恢復"}}}},
    "CleanNest 无法完成 Quick Look 只读检查。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest could not complete the Quick Look read-only check."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest 無法完成 Quick Look 唯讀檢查。"}}}},
    "仍可由你确认重建缓存，但不能把未知状态写成已经诊断出故障。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"You can still approve rebuilding the cache, but an unknown state must not be reported as a diagnosed fault."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仍可由你確認重建緩存，但不能把未知狀態寫成已經診斷出故障。"}}}},
    "Quick Look 基础接口可以响应。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The Quick Look basic interface responds."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Quick Look 基礎接口可以響應。"}}}},
    "这只能证明基础接口可用，不能判断你正在看的某个文件是否仍用了旧缩略图。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This only proves the basic interface is available; it cannot determine whether the file you are viewing still uses an old thumbnail."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這只能證明基礎接口可用，不能判斷你正在看的某個檔案是否仍用了舊縮略圖。"}}}},
    "Quick Look 基础接口没有正常响应。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The Quick Look basic interface is not responding normally."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Quick Look 基礎接口沒有正常響應。"}}}},
    "重建缓存有明确依据；原文件不会被修改。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"There is clear evidence for rebuilding the cache; original files will not be modified."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重建緩存有明確依據；原檔案不會被修改。"}}}},
    "无法读取 %@ 的进程状态。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The process state of %@ could not be read."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"無法讀取 %@ 的進程狀態。"}}}},
    "CleanNest 不会假装已诊断；你仍可在了解影响后确认重启。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest will not pretend a diagnosis succeeded; you can still approve a restart after reviewing its impact."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest 不會假裝已診斷；你仍可在瞭解影響後確認重啓。"}}}},
    "%@ 正在运行（PID %@）。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ is running (PID %@)."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 正在運行（PID %@）。"}}}},
    "进程存在不等于界面一定响应；CleanNest 无法读取你的点击或窗口内容。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A running process does not prove the interface responds; CleanNest cannot read your clicks or window contents."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"進程存在不等於界面一定響應；CleanNest 無法讀取你的點擊或窗口內容。"}}}},
    "没有发现当前用户的 %@ 进程。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No %@ process was found for the current user."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"沒有發現當前使用者的 %@ 進程。"}}}},
    "这是可验证的异常；执行后会检查它是否以新进程返回。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This is a verifiable anomaly; after running, CleanNest checks whether it returns as a new process."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這是可驗證的異常；執行後會檢查它是否以新進程返回。"}}}},
    "命令没有成功完成；CleanNest 没有把它记录成修复。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The command did not complete successfully; CleanNest did not record it as a repair."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"命令沒有成功完成；CleanNest 沒有把它記錄成修復。"}}}},
    "缓存重建命令已完成，Quick Look 基础接口也能响应；请重新按空格确认目标文件的预览是否更新。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The cache rebuild command completed and the Quick Look basic interface responds; press Space again to confirm whether the target file preview has updated."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"緩存重建命令已完成，Quick Look 基礎接口也能響應；請重新按空格確認目標檔案的預覽是否更新。"}}}},
    "缓存重建命令已完成，但 Quick Look 基础复核仍失败。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The cache rebuild command completed, but the Quick Look basic verification still failed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"緩存重建命令已完成，但 Quick Look 基礎復核仍失敗。"}}}},
    "缓存重建命令已完成，但自动复核无法确认结果。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The cache rebuild command completed, but automatic verification could not confirm the result."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"緩存重建命令已完成，但自動復核無法確認結果。"}}}},
    "旧进程已退出，%@ 已以新 PID 恢复；如果画面仍卡住，请按恢复说明处理。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The old process exited and %@ returned with a new PID; if the interface is still stuck, follow the recovery instructions."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"舊進程已退出，%@ 已以新 PID 恢復；如果畫面仍卡住，請按恢復說明處理。"}}}},
    "命令已完成，但预期服务没有在复核时间内返回。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The command completed, but the expected service did not return within the verification window."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"命令已完成，但預期服務沒有在復核時間內返回。"}}}},
    "命令已完成，但没有取得足以证明服务已换成新进程的证据。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The command completed, but there was not enough evidence to prove the service returned as a new process."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"命令已完成，但沒有取得足以證明服務已換成新進程的證據。"}}}}
,
    "CleanNest 的活动记录位于 Application Support；清空明细不会删除文件或清空废纸篓。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest activity is stored in Application Support; clearing details does not delete files or empty the Trash."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest 的活動記錄位於 Application Support；清空明細不會刪除檔案或清空垃圾桶。"}}}},
    "活动明细已清空；累计成果仍保留，文件、扫描结果与废纸篓未改变。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activity details cleared; lifetime totals remain, and files, scan results, and the Trash are unchanged."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"活動明細已清空；累計成果仍保留，檔案、掃描結果與垃圾桶未改變。"}}}},
    "内置引擎就绪" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Built-in engine ready"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"內建引擎就緒"}}}},
    "无需额外安装" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No additional installation required"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"無需額外安裝"}}}},
    "正在由 CleanNest 自身做一次轻量访问测试；完成前不会启动任何外部引擎或递归扫描。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest itself is performing a lightweight access test; no external engine or recursive scan starts before it finishes."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在由 CleanNest 自身做一次輕量存取測試；完成前不會啟動任何外部引擎或遞迴掃描。"}}}},
    "这个位置会遍历受 macOS 保护的应用数据。访问测试未通过前，CleanNest 不会启动任何外部引擎或递归扫描。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This location traverses app data protected by macOS. CleanNest will not start any external engine or recursive scan until the access test passes."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"此位置會遍歷受 macOS 保護的 App 資料。存取測試未通過前，CleanNest 不會啟動任何外部引擎或遞迴掃描。"}}}},
    "每 %@ 秒由内置原生引擎本机采样；不上传。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sampled locally by the built-in native engine every %@ seconds; never uploaded."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"每 %@ 秒由內建原生引擎在此 Mac 取樣；不上傳。"}}}},
    "系统状态由 CleanNest 内置原生引擎读取；无法取得的传感器或指标显示为空。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"System status is read by CleanNest's built-in native engine; unavailable sensors or metrics remain empty."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"系統狀態由 CleanNest 內建原生引擎讀取；無法取得的感測器或指標顯示為空。"}}}},
    "CleanNest 已在扫描前停止：%@ 会遍历受 macOS 保护的应用数据。请到设置页由你手动打开系统设置；访问测试通过前不会启动任何外部引擎或递归扫描。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest stopped before scanning: %@ traverses app data protected by macOS. Open System Settings manually from Settings; no external engine or recursive scan starts until the access test passes."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest 已在掃描前停止：%@ 會遍歷受 macOS 保護的 App 資料。請到設定頁由你手動開啟系統設定；存取測試通過前不會啟動任何外部引擎或遞迴掃描。"}}}},
    "CleanNest 已在 AI 深度采样前停止：%@ 会遍历受 macOS 保护的应用数据。访问测试通过前不会启动任何外部引擎或读取这些条目。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest stopped before deep AI sampling: %@ traverses app data protected by macOS. No external engine starts and these items are not read until the access test passes."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest 已在 AI 深度取樣前停止：%@ 會遍歷受 macOS 保護的 App 資料。存取測試通過前不會啟動任何外部引擎或讀取這些項目。"}}}},
    "CleanNest 活动明细已清空；累计成果、扫描结果、文件和废纸篓未改变。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest activity details cleared; lifetime totals, scan results, files, and the Trash are unchanged."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest 活動明細已清空；累計成果、掃描結果、檔案和垃圾桶未改變。"}}}},
    "内置引擎通过独立扫描服务读取最大的 4 个目录的直接子项，再由你选择的本机模型判断用途、风险和查看优先级。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The built-in engine uses the isolated scanner service to read direct children of the four largest directories, then your chosen on-device model assesses purpose, risk, and review priority."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"內建引擎透過獨立掃描服務讀取最大的 4 個目錄的直接子項目，再由你選擇的本機模型判斷用途、風險和檢視優先順序。"}}}},
    "会关闭由 CleanNest 启动的本机模型并重置模型连接、扫描开关和指标保留期限；不会清除活动、扫描结果、学习规则、历史指标或 macOS 授权。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This stops the on-device model launched by CleanNest and resets model connections, scan options, and metric retention; activity, scan results, learning rules, metric history, and macOS permissions remain."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"會關閉由 CleanNest 啟動的本機模型並重置模型連線、掃描開關和指標保留期限；不會清除活動、掃描結果、學習規則、歷史指標或 macOS 授權。"}}}},
    "内置原生引擎" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Built-in Native Engine"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"內建原生引擎"}}}},
    "清理、磁盘、系统数据、Agent 与系统状态均由随 App 安装的原生组件完成，不需要下载额外引擎。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cleanup, disk, system data, Agent, and system status all use native components installed with the app; no additional engine download is required."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"清理、磁碟、系統資料、Agent 與系統狀態均由隨 App 安裝的原生元件完成，不需要下載額外引擎。"}}}},
    "CleanNest 正在由自身做一次轻量访问测试，不会启动任何外部引擎或递归扫描。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest itself is performing a lightweight access test; it will not start any external engine or recursive scan."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest 正在由自身做一次輕量存取測試，不會啟動任何外部引擎或遞迴掃描。"}}}},
    "独立的原生 macOS 清理与系统维护客户端。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"An independent native macOS cleanup and system-maintenance client."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"獨立的原生 macOS 清理與系統維護用戶端。"}}}},
    "内置原生引擎，无需安装 Homebrew 或任何外部清理引擎。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Built-in native engine; no Homebrew or external cleanup engine installation required."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"內建原生引擎，無需安裝 Homebrew 或任何外部清理引擎。"}}}},
    "内置原生引擎开箱即用；普通使用不需要终端。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The built-in native engine works out of the box; Terminal is not needed for everyday use."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"內建原生引擎開箱即用；一般使用不需要終端機。"}}}},
    "系统电源接口读取失败；当前数值来自内置原生监测器。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The system power interface could not be read; current values come from the built-in native monitor."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"系統電源接口讀取失敗；目前數值來自內建原生監測器。"}}}},
    "APFS 与稀疏文件只读诊断" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"APFS and Sparse-File Read-Only Diagnostics"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"APFS 與稀疏檔案唯讀診斷"}}}},
    "把逻辑大小、实际分配块与卷总账分开" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Separate logical sizes, allocated blocks, and volume totals"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"分開呈現邏輯大小、實際配置區塊與卷總帳"}}}},
    "这里只读取证据，不清空废纸篓、不删除快照，也不执行 purge。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This view only reads evidence. It does not empty the Trash, delete snapshots, or run purge."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這裡只讀取證據，不清空垃圾桶、不刪除快照，也不執行 purge。"}}}},
    "重新读取" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reload"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重新讀取"}}}},
    "正在读取有界只读诊断…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reading bounded read-only diagnostics…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在讀取有界唯讀診斷…"}}}},
    "只读诊断尚不可用；可以点击“重新读取”。未知不会被换算成可清理空间。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Read-only diagnostics are unavailable. Select “Reload”; unknown values are never treated as reclaimable space."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"唯讀診斷尚不可用；可以點擊「重新讀取」。未知值不會換算成可清理空間。"}}}},
    "卷容量" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Volume Capacity"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"卷容量"}}}},
    "卷" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Volume"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"卷"}}}},
    "已用／可用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Used / Available"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已用／可用"}}}},
    "重要用途可用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Available for Important Usage"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重要用途可用"}}}},
    "卷总账" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Volume Totals"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"卷總帳"}}}},
    "当前用户废纸篓" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Current User’s Trash"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目前使用者垃圾桶"}}}},
    "逻辑大小" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Logical Size"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"邏輯大小"}}}},
    "分配块" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Allocated Blocks"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"配置區塊"}}}},
    "只读遍历 %@ 项；不可读 %@ 项。清空前不会把占用记为已释放。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Read %@ items; %@ unreadable. Occupied space is not counted as released before the Trash is emptied."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"唯讀遍歷 %@ 項；不可讀 %@ 項。清空前不會把佔用記為已釋放。"}}}},
    "当前大文件清单中的稀疏文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sparse Files in the Current Large-File List"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目前大型檔案清單中的稀疏檔案"}}}},
    "当前清单未发现稀疏文件；这不是对整个卷的结论。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No sparse files were found in the current list; this is not a whole-volume conclusion."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目前清單未發現稀疏檔案；這不是對整個卷的結論。"}}}},
    "逻辑 %@ · 实际分配 %@ · 稀疏差额 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Logical %@ · Allocated %@ · Sparse difference %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"邏輯 %@ · 實際配置 %@ · 稀疏差額 %@"}}}},
    "稀疏差额不是可直接释放的物理空间；实际分配块才用于磁盘占用解释。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The sparse difference is not directly reclaimable physical space; allocated blocks explain disk usage."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"稀疏差額不是可直接釋放的實體空間；磁碟佔用應以實際配置區塊解釋。"}}}},
    "APFS 卷摘要" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"APFS Volume Summary"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"APFS 卷摘要"}}}},
    "卷明细未知" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Volume details unknown"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"卷明細未知"}}}},
    "已用 %@ · 容量 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Used %@ · Capacity %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已用 %@ · 容量 %@"}}}},
    "同容器卷可能共享容量，不能把各卷容量相加。未显示的 Preboot、Recovery、VM 等卷也不能自动视为垃圾。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Volumes in the same container may share capacity, so their capacities must not be added together. Preboot, Recovery, VM, and other volumes that are not shown cannot automatically be treated as junk."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"同容器卷可能共享容量，不能把各卷容量相加。未顯示的 Preboot、Recovery、VM 等卷也不能自動視為垃圾。"}}}},
    "本地快照" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Local Snapshots"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本機快照"}}}},
    "系统返回 %@ 个本地快照；仅显示名称，不执行删除。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The system returned %@ local snapshots. Only names are shown; nothing is deleted."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"系統回傳 %@ 個本機快照；僅顯示名稱，不執行刪除。"}}}},
    "本地快照未知；不会根据卷差额猜测快照数量或大小。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Local snapshots are unknown; their count and size are not inferred from volume discrepancies."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本機快照未知；不會根據卷差額猜測快照數量或大小。"}}}},
    "配置引用或解析问题：本组保持复核" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Configuration references or parsing issues: this group requires review"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"設定引用或解析問題：此群組保持複核"}}}},
    "执行账本无法读取；不会据此恢复任何文件：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The execution ledger could not be read; no files will be restored from it: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行帳本無法讀取；不會據此復原任何檔案：%@"}}}},
    "执行账本未能持久化；请保留技术详情，不要仅依赖恢复入口：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The execution ledger could not be persisted. Keep the technical details and do not rely solely on the recovery command: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行帳本未能持久化；請保留技術詳情，不要僅依賴復原入口：%@"}}}},
    "恢复记录已变化，请重新打开执行账本" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The recovery record has changed. Reopen the execution ledger."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"復原記錄已變更，請重新開啟執行帳本"}}}},
    "正在复核并恢复“%@”…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Verifying and restoring “%@”…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在複核並復原「%@」…"}}}},
    "已恢复“%@”" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Restored “%@”"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已復原「%@」"}}}},
    "恢复清理项目" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Restore Cleanup Item"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"復原清理項目"}}}},
    "执行 %@ · 已按身份复核放回原位置" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Execution %@ · Restored to its original location after identity verification"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行 %@ · 已按身分複核並放回原位置"}}}},
    "未能恢复项目" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The item could not be restored"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未能復原項目"}}}},
    "执行：%@\n项目：%@\n源路径：%@\n废纸篓目标：%@\n状态：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Execution: %@\nItem: %@\nSource path: %@\nTrash destination: %@\nStatus: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行：%@\n項目：%@\n來源路徑：%@\n垃圾桶目標：%@\n狀態：%@"}}}},
    "当前 APFS 可用空间未知，最终释放量保持未知。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Current APFS free space is unknown, so the final reclaimed amount remains unknown."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目前 APFS 可用空間未知，最終釋放量保持未知。"}}}},
    "记录中的废纸篓项目仍存在；最终释放量仍需等待清空后复核" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The recorded Trash items still exist; empty the Trash before the final reclaimed amount can be reconciled"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"記錄中的垃圾桶項目仍存在；最終釋放量仍需等待清空後複核"}}}},
    "已记录清空废纸篓后的 APFS 观测增量；该数值包含同期系统变化，不作独占归因" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Recorded the APFS observed delta after the Trash was emptied. It includes concurrent system changes and is not exclusively attributed to CleanNest"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已記錄清空垃圾桶後的 APFS 觀測增量；該數值包含同期系統變化，不作獨佔歸因"}}}},
    "执行 %@ · 已移到废纸篓；最终 APFS 释放量待清空后复核" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Execution %@ · Moved to the Trash; final APFS reclaimed space requires reconciliation after emptying"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行 %@ · 已移至垃圾桶；最終 APFS 釋放量待清空後複核"}}}},
    "执行 %@ · 部分项目未通过复核或结果不确定" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Execution %@ · Some items failed verification or have an indeterminate outcome"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行 %@ · 部分項目未通過複核或結果不確定"}}}},
    "执行 %@ · %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Execution %@ · %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行 %@ · %@"}}}},
    "执行 %@；路径、身份、活跃和废纸篓结果均已复核。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Execution %@; paths, identities, activity, and Trash outcomes were all verified."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行 %@；路徑、身分、活躍狀態與垃圾桶結果均已複核。"}}}},
    "执行 %@ · 已移到废纸篓，最终释放量待清空后复核" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Execution %@ · Moved to the Trash; final reclaimed space requires reconciliation after emptying"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行 %@ · 已移至垃圾桶，最終釋放量待清空後複核"}}}},
    "清理执行账本与恢复" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cleanup Execution Ledger and Recovery"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"清理執行帳本與復原"}}}},
    "候选体积、实际移入量、即时 APFS 变化和清空后的最终观测分别记录。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Candidate size, confirmed moved amount, immediate APFS change, and final observation after emptying are recorded separately."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"候選體積、實際移入量、即時 APFS 變化和清空後的最終觀測分別記錄。"}}}},
    "%d 次执行" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d executions"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d 次執行"}}}},
    "账本需要复核" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ledger requires review"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"帳本需要複核"}}}},
    "执行 %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Execution %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行 %@"}}}},
    "中断或未完成" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Interrupted or incomplete"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"中斷或未完成"}}}},
    "已记录完成" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Completion recorded"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已記錄完成"}}}},
    "最终数值只在记录中的废纸篓项目已消失后生成；它包含同期系统变化，不作独占归因。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The final value is generated only after the recorded Trash items disappear. It includes concurrent system changes and is not exclusively attributed to CleanNest."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"最終數值只在記錄中的垃圾桶項目已消失後產生；它包含同期系統變化，不作獨佔歸因。"}}}},
    "复核最终空间" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reconcile Final Space"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"複核最終空間"}}}},
    "本次还有 %d 项保留在持久化账本中。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d additional items remain in the persistent ledger."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本次還有 %d 項保留在持久化帳本中。"}}}},
    "已确认移入" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Confirmed Moved"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已確認移入"}}}},
    "即时 APFS 变化" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Immediate APFS Change"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"即時 APFS 變化"}}}},
    "清空后最终观测" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Final Observation After Emptying"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"清空後最終觀測"}}}},
    "未知／待复核" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Unknown / Review Needed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未知／待複核"}}}},
    "实际废纸篓目标：%@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Actual Trash destination: %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"實際垃圾桶目標：%@"}}}},
    "恢复原位置" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Restore to Original Location"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"復原至原位置"}}}},
    "中断待核对" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Interrupted; reconciliation needed"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"中斷待核對"}}}},
    "已确认在废纸篓" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Confirmed in Trash"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已確認在垃圾桶"}}}},
    "未移动" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Not moved"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未移動"}}}},
    "结果不确定" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Outcome indeterminate"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"結果不確定"}}}},
    "恢复未成功" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Restore unsuccessful"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"復原未成功"}}}},
    "扫描保护项逐路径复核" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Review Scan Protections Path by Path"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"逐路徑複核掃描保護項目"}}}},
    "这些路径没有生成清理候选；请补充权限或重新扫描，不能直接重试移动。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"These paths did not produce cleanup candidates. Grant access or rescan; moving them cannot be retried directly."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這些路徑沒有產生清理候選；請補充權限或重新掃描，不能直接重試移動。"}}}},
    "%d 条路径证据" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d path evidence records"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d 條路徑證據"}}}},
    "仅显示前 %d 条；完整数量保留在本次扫描证据中。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Only the first %d records are shown; the full count remains in this scan’s evidence."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"僅顯示前 %d 條；完整數量保留在本次掃描證據中。"}}}},
    "云端占位文件" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cloud placeholder"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"雲端佔位檔案"}}}},
    "符号链接边界" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Symbolic-link boundary"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"符號連結邊界"}}}},
    "App 或包边界" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"App or bundle boundary"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"App 或套件邊界"}}}},
    "路径不可读取" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Path unreadable"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"路徑不可讀取"}}}},
    "达到目录深度上限" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Directory-depth limit reached"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"達到目錄深度上限"}}}},
    "根目录不安全" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Unsafe root directory"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"根目錄不安全"}}}},
    "达到文件数量上限" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"File-count limit reached"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"達到檔案數量上限"}}}},
    "达到哈希检查上限" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hash-check limit reached"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"達到雜湊檢查上限"}}}},
    "未纳入本次清理" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Not Included in This Cleanup"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未納入本次清理"}}}},
    "这些不是清理候选，也不会被处理。按原因查看路径证据。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"These are not cleanup candidates and will not be processed. Review path evidence by reason."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這些不是清理候選，也不會被處理。按原因查看路徑證據。"}}}},
    "安全边界" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Safety Boundary"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"安全邊界"}}}},
    "%@，%d 条" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@, %d records"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@，%d 條"}}}},
    "授权后重新扫描" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Rescan After Granting Access"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"授權後重新掃描"}}}},
    "找到 %d 个可处理候选 · %@；未经选择不会处理。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Found %d cleanup candidates · %@; nothing is handled without selection."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"找到 %d 個可處理候選 · %@；未經選擇不會處理。"}}}},
    "%@ 项候选 · %@/%@ 个位置可读 · %d 条未纳入路径" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ candidates · %@/%@ locations readable · %d excluded paths"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 項候選 · %@/%@ 個位置可讀 · %d 條未納入路徑"}}}},
    "%@。未扫描内容不会成为候选，也不会被处理。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@. Unscanned content does not become a candidate and is not processed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@。未掃描內容不會成為候選，也不會被處理。"}}}},
    "查看扫描诊断" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"View Scan Diagnostics"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"查看掃描診斷"}}}},
    "扫描诊断" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Scan Diagnostics"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"掃描診斷"}}}},
    "所有项目移动前还会复核路径、身份和活跃状态。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Every item's path, identity, and active state are rechecked before moving."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所有項目移動前還會複核路徑、身分與活躍狀態。"}}}},
    "选择本组…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Select Group…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選擇本組…"}}}},
    "选择本组应用日志？" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Select All App Logs in This Group?"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選擇本組應用記錄檔？"}}}},
    "选择本组" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Select Group"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選擇本組"}}}},
    "本组 %d 项均为应用日志。确认不再需要这些历史诊断记录后再选择；仍可在最终复核时取消。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"All %d items in this group are app logs. Select them only if you no longer need their diagnostic history; you can still cancel during final review."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本組 %d 項均為應用記錄檔。確認不再需要這些歷史診斷記錄後再選擇；仍可在最終複核時取消。"}}}},
    "手动确认" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Manual Confirmation"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"手動確認"}}}},
    "这是什么？" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"What Is This?"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這是什麼？"}}}},
    "为什么列为候选？" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Why Is This a Candidate?"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"為什麼列為候選？"}}}},
    "处理后有什么影响？" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"What Happens After Processing?"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"處理後有什麼影響？"}}}},
    "如何恢复？" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"How to Restore"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"如何復原？"}}}},
    "项目说明" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Item Details"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"項目說明"}}}},
    "选择此项目" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Select This Item"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選擇此項目"}}}},
    "读取权限不足或状态无法确认。授权后可重新扫描；这些路径不会直接进入清理。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Access was denied or the state could not be confirmed. Rescan after granting access; these paths do not directly become cleanup candidates."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"讀取權限不足或狀態無法確認。授權後可重新掃描；這些路徑不會直接進入清理。"}}}},
    "当前有界扫描未继续深入。相同设置下重扫不会扩大扫描范围。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The bounded scan did not descend farther. Rescanning with the same settings does not expand its scope."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目前有界掃描未繼續深入。相同設定下重掃不會擴大掃描範圍。"}}}},
    "当前扫描数量上限已到达。相同设置下重扫不会增加覆盖范围。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The scan item limit was reached. Rescanning with the same settings does not increase coverage."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目前掃描數量上限已達到。相同設定下重掃不會增加覆蓋範圍。"}}}},
    "当前哈希核验上限已到达。相同设置下重扫不会增加核验数量。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The hash-verification limit was reached. Rescanning with the same settings does not verify more items."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目前雜湊核驗上限已達到。相同設定下重掃不會增加核驗數量。"}}}},
    "云端内容尚未成为可安全处理的本地候选；请先由云端服务管理本地副本。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cloud content is not yet a local candidate that can be handled safely. Manage the local copy in the cloud service first."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"雲端內容尚未成為可安全處理的本機候選；請先由雲端服務管理本機副本。"}}}},
    "路径身份未通过安全检查。重新扫描不会绕过这条安全边界。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The path identity failed safety validation. Rescanning does not bypass this safety boundary."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"路徑身分未通過安全檢查。重新掃描不會繞過這條安全邊界。"}}}},
    "为避免触及链接目标，扫描没有跟随这些链接。重新扫描也不会改变这一行为。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"To avoid touching link targets, the scan did not follow these links. Rescanning does not change this behavior."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"為避免觸及連結目標，掃描沒有跟隨這些連結。重新掃描也不會改變這一行為。"}}}},
    "为避免破坏 App 或资料库包结构，扫描没有展开其内容；请使用所属 App 管理。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"To protect app or library bundle structures, the scan did not inspect their contents. Manage them in the owning app."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"為避免破壞 App 或資料庫套件結構，掃描沒有展開其內容；請使用所屬 App 管理。"}}}},
    "应用或服务日志 · 用于运行记录与故障排查" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"App or service logs · Runtime records and diagnostics"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"應用或服務記錄檔 · 用於執行記錄與故障排查"}}}},
    "应用或服务产生的运行与故障诊断记录。不会自动选择；不再需要历史排查记录时才处理。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Runtime and diagnostic records created by apps or services. Nothing is selected automatically; process these only when you no longer need their diagnostic history."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"應用或服務產生的執行與故障診斷記錄。不會自動選擇；不再需要歷史排查記錄時才處理。"}}}},
    "这是 ~/Library/Logs 下的应用或服务日志目录，通常记录运行状态、错误或诊断事件。CleanNest 只检查路径、体积和修改时间，没有读取日志内容；原始目录名不等于已核验的应用归属。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This is an app or service log directory under ~/Library/Logs, usually containing runtime status, errors, or diagnostic events. CleanNest checks only the path, size, and modification date; it does not read log contents. A raw directory name does not verify the owning app."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"這是 ~/Library/Logs 下的應用或服務記錄檔目錄，通常記錄執行狀態、錯誤或診斷事件。CleanNest 只檢查路徑、體積與修改時間，沒有讀取記錄內容；原始目錄名不等於已核驗的應用歸屬。"}}}},
    "此目录至少 30 天未修改，符合应用日志候选规则。只有不再需要这些历史诊断记录时才应选择。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This directory has not been modified for at least 30 days and meets the app-log candidate rule. Select it only if you no longer need this diagnostic history."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"此目錄至少 30 天未修改，符合應用記錄檔候選規則。只有不再需要這些歷史診斷記錄時才應選擇。"}}}},
    "处理只会将所选日志目录移到废纸篓，不会卸载应用，也不会删除文稿或项目。历史排查记录将不在原位置；之后是否生成新日志取决于对应应用或服务。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Processing moves only the selected log directory to Trash. It does not uninstall apps or delete documents or projects. The diagnostic history leaves its original location; whether new logs are created depends on the app or service."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"處理只會將所選記錄檔目錄移到垃圾桶，不會解除安裝應用，也不會刪除文件或專案。歷史排查記錄將不在原位置；之後是否產生新記錄取決於對應應用或服務。"}}}},
    "清空废纸篓前，可以从废纸篓放回；清空后 CleanNest 无法恢复。实际空间释放以清空后的 APFS 可用空间为准。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Until Trash is emptied, you can put the item back from Trash. CleanNest cannot restore it after Trash is emptied. Actual space reclaimed is determined by APFS free space after emptying Trash."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"清空垃圾桶前，可以從垃圾桶放回；清空後 CleanNest 無法復原。實際空間釋放以清空後的 APFS 可用空間為準。"}}}},
    "路径身份未通过安全检查，重新扫描不会绕过这条边界。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The path identity failed safety validation; rescanning does not bypass this boundary."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"路徑身分未通過安全檢查，重新掃描不會繞過這條邊界。"}}}},
    "为避免触及链接目标，重新扫描也不会跟随或清理链接目标。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"To avoid touching link targets, rescanning does not follow them or clean their targets."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"為避免觸及連結目標，重新掃描也不會跟隨或清理連結目標。"}}}},
    "本轮有界扫描未覆盖此处；相同设置下重扫不会扩大范围或执行权限。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This bounded scan did not cover this location; rescanning with the same settings does not expand its scope or execution permissions."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本輪有界掃描未覆蓋此處；相同設定下重掃不會擴大範圍或執行權限。"}}}},
    "本机 Agent 客户端" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Installed Agent clients"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本機 Agent 用戶端"}}}},
    "Bundle ID、有效签名和开发者团队均已核实" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exact Bundle ID, valid signature, and developer team verified"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已核實精確 Bundle ID、有效簽名與開發者團隊"}}}},
    "正在刷新" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Refreshing"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在重新整理"}}}},
    "独立于工作区扫描" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Separate from workspace scan"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"獨立於工作區掃描"}}}},
    "版本 %@ · Build %@" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Version %@ · Build %@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"版本 %@ · Build %@"}}}},
    "签名团队 %@ · 此副本单独管理" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Signing team %@ · This copy is managed separately"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"簽名團隊 %@ · 此副本單獨管理"}}}},
    "卸载 Agent…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Uninstall Agent…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"解除安裝 Agent…"}}}},
    "只卸载你选择的安装副本。云端账户、机器人、浏览器记录、共享容器及无法证明归属的内容不在操作范围内。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Only the installation copy you select is uninstalled. Cloud accounts, bots, browser history, shared containers, and items without proven ownership are excluded."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只解除安裝你選取的安裝副本。雲端帳號、機器人、瀏覽器記錄、共享容器及無法證明歸屬的內容不在操作範圍內。"}}}},
    "在线识别规则没有返回有效响应。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The online recognition-rule service returned an invalid response."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"線上識別規則服務沒有回傳有效回應。"}}}},
    "当前正式版本没有单独的在线规则包，内置规则继续有效。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The current release has no separate online rule bundle. The built-in rules remain active."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目前正式版本沒有獨立的線上規則包，內建規則繼續有效。"}}}},
    "在线规则服务暂时不可用（HTTP %d）。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The online rule service is temporarily unavailable (HTTP %d)."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"線上規則服務暫時無法使用（HTTP %d）。"}}}},
    "在线规则包超过 2 MB 安全上限。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The online rule bundle exceeds the 2 MB safety limit."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"線上規則包超過 2 MB 安全上限。"}}}},
    "在线规则归档中只有一个 CleanNestAgentRules.bundle 才能安装。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The online archive must contain exactly one CleanNestAgentRules.bundle to be installed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"線上規則封存檔必須只有一個 CleanNestAgentRules.bundle 才能安裝。"}}}},
    "在线规则下载被重定向到不受信任的地址。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The online rule download was redirected to an untrusted address."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"線上規則下載被重新導向至不受信任的位址。"}}}},
    "在线规则早于当前已验证规则，已停止降级。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The online rules predate the currently verified rules. The downgrade was blocked."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"線上規則早於目前已驗證的規則，已停止降級。"}}}},
    "检查识别规则" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Check Recognition Rules"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"檢查識別規則"}}}},
    "仅从官方 Release 获取与 CleanNest 同签名者的规则包；失败不会改变现有规则" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fetches only official Release bundles signed by the same signer as CleanNest; a failure leaves the current rules unchanged"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"僅從官方 Release 取得與 CleanNest 同簽名者的規則包；失敗不會改變現有規則"}}}},
    "这个 Agent 的安装位置或签名已经变化，未打开卸载流程。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This Agent’s location or signature has changed. Uninstall was not opened."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"此 Agent 的安裝位置或簽名已變更，未開啟解除安裝流程。"}}}},
    "已验证并安装在线规则 %@；识别目录和图标已刷新。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Verified and installed online rules %@. Recognition entries and icons were refreshed."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已驗證並安裝線上規則 %@；識別目錄與圖示已重新整理。"}}}},
    "当前已是最新签名识别规则。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The signed recognition rules are already up to date."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目前已是最新的簽名識別規則。"}}}},
    "在线规则未更新：%@。继续保留最近通过的规则。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Online rules were not updated: %@. The last verified rules remain active."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"線上規則未更新：%@。繼續保留最近通過驗證的規則。"}}}},
    "Agent 签名或产品规则已经变化，未改动 App 或任何关联文件。请刷新后重试。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The Agent signature or product rules have changed. No app or related file was modified. Refresh and try again."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agent 簽名或產品規則已變更，未改動 App 或任何關聯檔案。請重新整理後重試。"}}}},
    "请在 %@ 后再检查；等待期内不会重复请求 GitHub。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Check again after %@. GitHub will not be contacted again during this waiting period."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"請在 %@ 後再檢查；等待期間不會重複請求 GitHub。"}}}},
    "GitHub 暂时限制了检查频率，可在 %@ 后重试。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"GitHub has temporarily limited check frequency. Try again after %@."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"GitHub 暫時限制了檢查頻率，可在 %@ 後重試。"}}}},
    "macOS 已拒绝此安装包的 Gatekeeper 评估，已停止安装。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS rejected this installer’s Gatekeeper assessment. Installation was stopped."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS 已拒絕此安裝包的 Gatekeeper 評估，已停止安裝。"}}}},
    "此 Mac 无法完成安装包校验：%@。这不是“已验证”；可前往官方 Release 页核对后使用系统安装器。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This Mac could not complete installer verification: %@. This is not a verified package; check the official Release page before using macOS Installer."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"此 Mac 無法完成安裝包校驗：%@。這不代表「已驗證」；可前往官方 Release 頁核對後使用系統安裝器。"}}}},
    "无法打开 macOS 安装器。已验证的安装包仍保留在更新缓存中，你可以重试打开。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS Installer could not be opened. The verified package remains in the update cache so you can retry opening it."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"無法開啟 macOS 安裝器。已驗證的安裝包仍保留在更新快取中，你可以重試開啟。"}}}},
    "Gatekeeper 评估服务不可用" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gatekeeper assessment service unavailable"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gatekeeper 評估服務無法使用"}}}},
    "将从 CleanNest 官方 GitHub Release 下载 %@ 安装包，核对 SHA-256 与 Developer ID Installer 签名，并进行 macOS Gatekeeper 系统评估。校验通过后仍需你点击“打开安装器”，并在 macOS 安装器中最终确认。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CleanNest will download the %@ installer from its official GitHub Release, verify its SHA-256 and Developer ID Installer signature, and perform a macOS Gatekeeper assessment. After verification, you must still click “Open Installer” and confirm in macOS Installer."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"將從 CleanNest 官方 GitHub Release 下載 %@ 安裝包，核對 SHA-256 與 Developer ID Installer 簽名，並進行 macOS Gatekeeper 系統評估。校驗通過後仍需你點擊「開啟安裝器」，並在 macOS 安裝器中最終確認。"}}}},
    "正在校验 SHA-256、Developer ID Installer 签名与 Gatekeeper 系统评估…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Verifying SHA-256, Developer ID Installer signature, and Gatekeeper assessment…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在校驗 SHA-256、Developer ID Installer 簽名與 Gatekeeper 系統評估…"}}}},
    "摘要、Developer ID Installer 签名及 Gatekeeper 系统评估已通过。点击“打开安装器”后，由 macOS 安装器继续。" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The checksum, Developer ID Installer signature, and Gatekeeper assessment passed. Click “Open Installer” to continue in macOS Installer."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"摘要、Developer ID Installer 簽名及 Gatekeeper 系統評估已通過。點擊「開啟安裝器」後，由 macOS 安裝器繼續。"}}}},
    "重试打开安装器" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Retry Opening Installer"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重試開啟安裝器"}}}},
    "重新下载并校验…" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Download and Verify Again…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重新下載並校驗…"}}}}
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}